ticon-rocket" data-emoji-id=3D"1f680" data-emoji-shortname=3D":rocket:" dat=
a-emoji-fallback=3D"=F0=9F=9A=80" src=3D"e202d3115eb3d4f0093c0b39327d5d0fca=
aaa74f96362707c9f25760ffed005c" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" data-emoticon-na=
me=3D"rocket" alt=3D"content.emoticon.rocket"> Product Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"dac4e6218b21">Beem is launching new Visa Debit + Interac =E2=
=80=9CCo-badge=E2=80=9D debit cards for all existing and new members, enabl=
ing them to use these debit cards for making all =E2=80=98Card Not Present=
=E2=80=99 (CNP) transactions (online purchases, recurring payments, etc.) a=
nd international transactions via the Visa network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9624553159d9">We expect that these cards will drive new habi=
t of our members to use these cards for these CNP transactions, and help us=
 increase member wallet share.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"bc91b8dbdb87" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-Hypothesis:"><strong>Hypothesis:</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"3d419e158bfe">If we provide Beem members with a Visa Debit c=
ard, allowing for CNP and International usage alongside continued full ATM =
and POS access, we will boost member satisfaction along with increased card=
 and account usage abilities, and increase non-interest revenue (NIR) and s=
hare-of-wallet metrics for Beem.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"216c0f47705b" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-PrimaryUserOutcome:"><strong>Primary User Outcome:</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"7a44b6edbf20">Users can now conveniently use their Beem Visa=
 Debit card to conduct all of their transactions directly from their Beem a=
ccounts, including CNP and International transactions, boosting member sati=
sfaction and ease of use with their Beem accounts.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"b40d3fecbf0a" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-PrimaryBusinessOutcome:"><strong>Primary Business Outcome:</strong>=
</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"80f039936ab8">
<li local-id=3D"f4c3ff8800ce">
<p local-id=3D"9122e977333a">Increase NIR =E2=86=92 ~$3.5M net new NIR thro=
ugh Visa ICF and OIF</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"944ac25a293e">
<p local-id=3D"041c26d70f2e">Better MLI =E2=86=92 through a higher Satisfac=
tion score</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"19c03ddd-5e4b-431b-966e-e320ec594bd7" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
<h2 local-id=3D"3f42efe3-e4dc-4153-a4b4-5201e72177b2" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequ=
irementsDocument:VisaDebitCards-Problem&amp;StrategicFit"><img class=3D"emo=
ticon emoticon-blue-star" data-emoji-id=3D"1f945" data-emoji-shortname=3D":=
goal:" data-emoji-fallback=3D"=F0=9F=A5=85" src=3D"f0c9bdbb11826ca2971d9156=
6e68e33da818199c0976262fa500a01d33cf5d98" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" data-e=
moticon-name=3D"blue-star" alt=3D"(blue star)"> Problem &amp; Strategic Fit=
</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"0508565f8978" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-ObservedPain:">Observed Pain:</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f6056d3b0c5e">Currently, all debit cards issued by Beem to i=
ts members are Interac-only. These debit cards do not support =E2=80=98Card=
 Not Present=E2=80=99 (CNP) transactions or international purchases, hence =
reducing the ability of these cards to be used for several types of transac=
tions such as online purchases, recurring transactions, digital transaction=
s, or international transactions.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8ac4b0173620">Current Beem debit cards restrict our members =
to only performing specific types of Interac-supported transactions (ATM + =
POS usage), forcing them to use other instruments (credit cards, other FI c=
o-badge cards, etc) to make other non-supported transactions such as CNP an=
d international purchases. This not only adds friction and frustration, but=
 also hurts the member stickiness with our products.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"4ef63190fabe" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-StrategicContext:">Strategic Context:</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b133e2e59ea2">Most members from Beem=E2=80=99s strategically=
 prioritized key segments, such as Digital Multiculturals and Leveraged Div=
erse Families, predominantly use CNP transactions for their purchases. Due =
to this behavior, Beem unfortunately misses out on capturing the increasing=
 revenue share of these types of transactions (missed revenue), which are b=
ecoming more common among these groups. This also impacts long term loyalty=
, satisfaction, and business stickiness of these members.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"ee0d580eddc9" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-WhyNow:">Why Now:</h3>
<p local-id=3D"01dd1de6a56d">Co-badge cards are increasingly becoming table=
stakes in the market, with many major FIs and financial providers offering =
this type of functionality. If we do not introduce this offering, Beem risk=
s falling behind and losing out, not only on missed revenue opportunities, =
but in providing the essential payments services our members need and are s=
eeking from other FIs. This, in turn, may well lead to decreased member sat=
isfaction with Beem as a whole, and lessened usage of other Beem products, =
as they turn to other FIs to address their payments needs.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f61b33e2-0cf6-4c07-b13d-5af1261d993a" data-layout=3D"wide" =
data-width=3D"760">
