<p local-id=3D"b7c7265cc94e"><strong>I want to</strong> receive and review =
all important information (benefits, terms, cost etc.) about the card</p>
<p local-id=3D"6e4e1b47e000"><strong>So that</strong> I can quickly make an=
 informed decision on activating and using this card</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"75f63319-011a-49f5-b=
e00-786550195ffd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"05a6dca18168"><strong>I want to</strong> quickly activate th=
e card</p>
<p local-id=3D"f9697c6bb185"><strong>So that</strong> I am ready to use thi=
s card for my desired transactions</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"945bd28b-fd59-4e00-b=
c3b-1d5d4b6c83ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e488ea1548f0"><strong>I want to</strong> be able to make all=
 desired (CNP) transactions using this card easily, quickly, and securely</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"1797f93d2196"><strong>So that</strong> I can avail the purch=
ased goods / services with confidence on the transactions</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"75099739-3231-46c6-b=
bd5-efc183e46497" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ecdf9c3437f0"><strong>I want to</strong> promote the card an=
d banking services in my network</p>
<p local-id=3D"b190f5684832"><strong>So that</strong> people in my network =
can also avail the benefits of this card</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"690ef0ea-ab62-4a5e-a739-72403dedbe57">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#deebff" data-local-id=3D"ac2d9f18-2f3f-48dd-9=
78f-1d4bcf073b6f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbd18e386bff"><strong>Key requirements</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"a20557fb-fbd5-43c4-b=
46b-23108efc56c4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"6f5a0fbd-5bad-4103-9a51-e2395a5692e4">
<li local-id=3D"a4998276-ef94-47db-81e7-f80ac122de19">
<p local-id=3D"46f7e3192be2">Create member comms highlighting key benefits =
crisply and clearly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c1616c4-25cb-4949-8e8f-2ba660e74aed">
<p local-id=3D"290c709f4ad1">Distribute the comms on preferred channels (em=
ails, website, to reach intended member base</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0479bc13-5fe2-4b86-a699-862ee817d0c7">
<p local-id=3D"cc38835aa3a5">Provide easy ways for members to show interest=
 or read more</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"705ea6a0-a46f-4a2b-8=
b7d-79d40b1a277f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"2940f384-3f5b-4247-ac5d-ebd4e36b1861">
<li local-id=3D"d444d558-85a6-4e18-bbba-64428bbe2e17">
<p local-id=3D"0ab1920c77d6">Create member comms clearly highlighting the v=
alue proposition with messaging and tonality appealing to the intended segm=
ents</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e9d9b7cb-bc2c-4b45-b0cd-96f7409f5b05">
<p local-id=3D"58b4f48799a9">Provide links / ways to access more informatio=
n as desired</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6c5f9bde-3241-440c-84f3-578ca2b33cf8">
<p local-id=3D"f05d931e77d5">Frictionless way (for early adopters) to opt i=
n to receive digital / physical cards</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5aee7443-88c3-49c5-afa0-feff182b5712">
<p local-id=3D"345d5f2c0e19">Incentivize decision making through promotions=
 including:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f631b364-e97f-4e2f-897e-f24fc789c4e5">
<li local-id=3D"c21a9c7d-61d6-4a13-afdf-33d5e8083f5e">
<p local-id=3D"39eb8cb45198">Beem bucks</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"394aa386-0b64-4d55-a7c1-40a8303975f3">
<p local-id=3D"821f9acc7f39">Digital-only cards</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"85d7dadd-523b-4816-a=
830-3fa7dc4863ff" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"b8ee5ef3-9ad5-48f4-880a-20db057ef48b">
<li local-id=3D"2feb9e61-2e7d-42d8-a4f8-08930d15d43b">
<p local-id=3D"ecabf3b2ad77">Provide digital (in app / website) and physica=
l ways to activate the card, prioritizing self serve</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4964924d-1797-4568-b493-1cccdd0cebd7">
<p local-id=3D"66018af045af">Provide digital as well as physical ways to se=
t / reset PIN</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"2b0434de-4134-4780-a=
ac9-3110369815be" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"072dc93f-5211-4575-908e-52d2390e51fe">
<li local-id=3D"07010403-5465-4dd1-8643-2ae771cf113d">
<p local-id=3D"6640310a42f2">Provide functionality to add the card to digit=
al wallets</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bede6557-23db-40c5-8c2f-484f6927b6fd">
<p local-id=3D"ab04ffa4d767">Allow the card to be used for all CNP transact=
ions (including online purchases, recurring payments, subscriptions etc.) u=
sing Visa Debit rail</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"969039f3-61b1-4587-9415-0f69c7588842">
<p local-id=3D"fb4547c6f65d">Allow the card to be used for international tr=
ansactions using Visa debit rail</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"657934e2-490f-4a8c-acb2-412e23324700">
<p local-id=3D"c8f621166da7">Provide digital card management functionalitie=
s through app / website</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a751411f-48b4-49e0-babd-b648f9f96d37">
<p local-id=3D"ffbd262ab48b"></p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"f926ec71-5e88-442c-8=
b3b-26bc307fadbe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"d1ef71c2-9e85-4f36-bc5d-9674caf04287">
<li local-id=3D"3f71ca8f-d6e5-4c13-8d44-2d80096a1cec">
<p local-id=3D"346f63df7fa7">Provide quick in app CSAT survey</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ba5f391d-2fc3-4da4-b55c-42033b16b5e9">
<p local-id=3D"15b196cbf027">Collect CSAT scores through emails</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae780c31-9469-4000-adc2-5b4c143c5300">
<p local-id=3D"6f0e939d852c">Provide ways for members to provide qualitativ=
e feedback</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b854635-509d-413e-a2b2-399693d75f6d">
<p local-id=3D"2248a74da616">Provide a referal link to refer other members<=
/p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
