<h2 local-id=3D"2ede9b57-4245-4e54-800f-8ea9a93732c7" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequ=
irementsDocument:VisaDebitCards-FunctionalRequirements-Member"><img class=
=3D"emoticon emoticon-documents" data-emoji-id=3D"1f4c4" data-emoji-shortna=
me=3D":page_facing_up:" data-emoji-fallback=3D"=F0=9F=93=84" src=3D"9a9c9a2=
17a8fd81cca5bdf1a26cc546ae22f3380c87327e47daaecbed0a2ead8" width=3D"16" hei=
ght=3D"16" data-emoticon-name=3D"documents" alt=3D"content.emoticon.documen=
ts"> Functional Requirements - Member</h2>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<h3 local-id=3D"a5ffbc2453fe" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-OverarchingMemberJobToBeDone(JTBD):"><u>Overarching Member Job To B=
e Done (JTBD):</u></h3>
<p local-id=3D"1815b74d03b1"><strong>WHEN I</strong> make payments from my =
account with Beem,</p>
<p local-id=3D"80b60788dcfe"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> use a single debit =
card to make all in-person (physical), digital/online (CNP), and internatio=
nal transactions,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4d358bfe18e6"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> perform everyth=
ing directly from my Beem account with one debit card, without having to re=
ly on using other cards/payment methods for these purposes.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"338727a5e0b6" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-Pre-Conditions:"><u>Pre-Conditions:</u></h3>
<p local-id=3D"1ae4ecd8828b">The following conditions apply to the below re=
quirements, unless otherwise stated in the specific requirement:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"65b1065f-5ba8-4c38-a27f-2858064d9004">
<li local-id=3D"21020bdf-7faa-45aa-bab1-1d861c5e6b6f">
<p local-id=3D"0d22ea6f7fc8">The Visa Debit card has been issued to the mem=
ber and is active</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d1dd8bf8-cb12-46e0-a5cc-95d4caf6aa6c">
<p local-id=3D"b491322e08ec">The member is subject to standard hold limits =
applied in DNA, including ATM withdrawal limits, purchase limits, and POS c=
ontactless/tap limits</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b91a15e-fb83-4356-a80b-0606b20625fd">
<p local-id=3D"dfe99314736a">For all applicable CNP transactions, the corre=
ct card details - including card number, expiry date, and CVV code - are be=
ing entered</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"43ebd5a47de1" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-1.Awareness/Consideration/Decision">1. Awareness/Consideration/Deci=
sion</h3>
<p local-id=3D"e20e43145fa4"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"d83f181c0fdb"><strong>WHEN I</strong> am either an existing =
Beem member or a new prospective member considering joining Beem,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ca6c5feba5ff"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> <span class=3D"inli=
ne-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"63c2a85c-c9fb-4d7e-887c-e6ab9913b65b">learn =
about the new Visa Debit cards,</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"3ce455be3c74"><strong>SO THAT I CAN </strong>be well informe=
d and prepared to avail myself of the maximum benefits of the card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-969745141" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-969745141" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
