<td data-local-id=3D"fa455f9e98c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e64bd8f61dc7"><strong>As a </strong>member who is not yet aw=
are of the new Beem Visa Debit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8713c7559102"><strong>I want to</strong> be notified about t=
he new card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f2189346391b"><strong>So that </strong>I am informed about t=
his new product being offered by Beem</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e9c7f2e9-67b9-4b6a-900a-c487db930bf0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df054403f3bb">Beem shall notify the member about the new car=
d via BeemDB, both online banking and the mobile app, and via BeemDB</p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"224ffe3f-b9e8-48d2-be57-f08d0094c104" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c8d627be3de"><strong>1 - BeemDB Notification</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"33a532f39301"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
is not yet aware of, and has not yet received, Beem=E2=80=99s new Visa Debi=
t card, and my new card is not yet issued or active,</p>
<p local-id=3D"37414332f160"><strong>When </strong>the card is ready to be =
offered to me, prior to me receiving the new card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"28e8114b250d"><strong>Then </strong>I should receive a notif=
ication in BeemDB informing me about the new card and providing me with a l=
ink to select and learn more about this new product</p>
<hr local-id=3D"2f0851fb7ab0">
<p local-id=3D"7de9ebed8d5e"><strong>2 - Email Notification</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"cb7a71b669fa"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
is not yet aware of, and has not yet received, Beem=E2=80=99s new Visa Debi=
t card, and my new card is not yet issued or active</p>
<p local-id=3D"95214bebb7b4"><strong>When </strong>the card is ready to be =
offered to me, prior to me receiving the new card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0e881404c7ac"><strong>Then </strong>I should receive a notif=
ication via email informing me about the new card and providing me with a l=
ink to select and learn more about this new product</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c077455-2d56-40f4-ad35-a9f309235be0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3010a683989">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3155545d-7372-487d-8735-8dfc3d00a5cc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"64e33b2f7be5"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-150?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-150</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"25b4b2ed-2c7f-45b8-bbb6-6b862a43edb9">
<td data-local-id=3D"74b07ca1-6a8c-4415-9dcb-f40bbd8d827b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31c6507e3fe6">1.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"664f29032d7c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"728f0f0f49da"><strong>As a </strong>member who has been made=
 aware of the new Beem Visa Debit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"60dee4eb1001"><strong>I want to</strong> have the opportunit=
y to read and learn more about the new card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3cc440671c9a"><strong>So that </strong>I can understand the =
benefits to get maximum value out of it</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"66c9a8d0-5e33-4bda-85e5-e31568574cf3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a468d4ccc1e">I want to <strong>read and learn more </strong=
>about the new Visa Debit card so I can understand the benefits to get maxi=
mum value out of it</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8c4d49f4-9729-4a6b-b989-75e54dabce45" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"28362f05b507"><strong>1 - Learn More About the Card</strong>=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"ae5c0ced3193"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
has been made aware of Beem=E2=80=99s new Visa Debit card, and my new card =
is not yet issued or active,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5c045c70f9f7"><strong>When </strong>I am ready to learn more=
 about the new card and its benefits,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ecf97c1c27b3"><strong>Then </strong>I should be able to easi=
ly find more information about the new card and its benefits on the Beem we=
bsite, and the information should be presented in a simple and easily-consu=
mable format so that I can readily understand it</p></td>
