<h3 local-id=3D"ee23b435f766" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-2.Activation">2. Activation</h3>
<p local-id=3D"1b07ae8b02e1"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"cb97fb2e8485"><strong>WHEN I</strong> receive my new Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"eba925f8d56e"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> be able to easily a=
ctivate my new Visa Debit card, either physically or digitally,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f963a7089656"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> begin using the=
 card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1813756024" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1813756024" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
