<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"d2b=
781e4-7d30-41c9-b1b4-be4616e8fdfc" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 283.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 120.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 212.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 251.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2369cbd7-b8f4-4195-9a97-aee1071bda02">
<th data-local-id=3D"45fdb344-d675-4813-b3a1-3a61b317221a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f563f45ae64b"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"13b3a5e2ea4f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4e94ef573fcb"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d15232e1-78d2-4fb4-afbe-11b9d91b6d87" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2b78d920d89f"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"a804f8e3-135c-4fea-955e-bcac70990c9b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4f213fe29b5a"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"977911e6-f853-417d-8225-890389442bab" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3964028d73a0"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"46f149b9-a9a6-4cd6-9328-4d2037f31bc0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0b46a23ea12c"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7a1c840b-861d-449b-a101-d93963d0a967">
<td data-local-id=3D"afe9acf9-8b0f-49f7-a26c-49db50850cb3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6de167daf25a">2.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"02355bde60c0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a790401153f"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"481e243d8425"><strong>I want to</strong> activate my new car=
d,</p>
<p local-id=3D"971833aab9a7"><strong>So that </strong>I can begin to use it=
</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4e3e704d-61c2-4f82-aebe-375044f51c94" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94123a91397f">The system shall allow the member to activate =
the new card by performing an initial in-person transaction, either a Chip-=
and-PIN POS transaction or an ATM transaction</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9a236724-dec8-4917-9e1c-031b2364948c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10ad95572d9a"><strong>1 - Happy Path POS Activation:</strong=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"c3ec4cb21566"><strong>Given </strong>that the member has rec=
eived their new card, and the card is not yet active, and the initial trans=
action amount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has=
 sufficient funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"52a85b3f285b"><strong>When </strong>the member presents the =
card at the POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/=
sav), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3edc6751718d"><strong>Then</strong> the card is activated an=
d ready for use, the transaction successfully completes and the member=E2=
=80=99s account is debited for the funds</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c821c11b290d">
<p local-id=3D"abe5ddf76847"><strong>2 - POS Activation - Exceeds Purchase =
Limit:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5fa88a6be38f"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c2b54bcdb133"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/s=
av), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a74fff4b743d"><strong>Then: </strong>the card is not activat=
ed and the transaction is declined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"09c16f63-b78b-45d9-9fa7-8d5bac894e9f">
<p local-id=3D"6d3d05f215c8"><strong>3 - POS Activation - Exceeds Account B=
alance:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7b0106c4b30b"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a6215f17c462"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/s=
av), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"37c8730fbd3d"><strong>Then: </strong>the card is not activat=
ed and the transaction is declined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"2cb299e7-fedb-4d18-81a6-2aa2ea7a0700">
<p local-id=3D"7c8538e45f30"><strong>4 - POS Activation - Incorrect PIN:</s=
trong></p>
<p local-id=3D"8a4f67a548cd"><strong>Given</strong> that the member uses an=
 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f02756e11c3e"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c38617517c0a"><strong>Then: </strong>the card is not activat=
ed and the transaction is declined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6c1e6b92-3997-4104-b686-387b155bd72c">
<p local-id=3D"4bee34577131"><strong>5 - POS Activation - Incorrect Account=
:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0d76f296b8a9"><strong>Given </strong>that the member attempt=
s to use an account (chq/sav) that is not connected to the card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"aea9b8604d48"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the incorrect account=
 (chq/sav), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ec4cb33ffdea"><strong>Then: </strong>the card is not activat=
ed and the transaction is declined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"7dee84676372">
<p local-id=3D"becc06c387f7"><em><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(248,2=
30,160);">6-10?? - TBC</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"2004b7c89b28"><em><strong>6 - ATM Withdrawal Activation:</st=
rong></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"1f0ff2985c9e"><em><strong>Given </strong>that the member has=
 received their new card, and the card is not yet active, and the initial w=
ithdrawal transaction amount does not exceed the ATM withdrawal amount limi=
t, and the member has sufficient funds in their account,</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"a510e0824206"><em><strong>When </strong>the member presents =
the card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and se=
lecting the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,<=
/em></p>
<p local-id=3D"66251941a61a"><em><strong>Then</strong> the card is activate=
d and ready for use, the transaction successfully completes, cash is dispen=
sed, and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"24533867f116"><em><strong>7 - ATM Deposit Activation:</stron=
g></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"5d0fa137230d"><em><strong>Given </strong>that the member has=
 received their new card, and the card is not yet active,</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"f62792f21342"><em><strong>When </strong>the member presents =
the card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and se=
lecting the account (chq/sav), enters the amount of funds to deposit, and i=
nserts the deposit into the ATM,</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"120cc21c00ab"><em><strong>Then</strong> the card is activate=
d and ready for use, the transaction successfully completes, and the member=
=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"f3caaa845f18"><em><strong>8 - ATM Balance Inquiry Activation=
:</strong></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"84fe24e3f16a"><em><strong>Given </strong>that the member has=
 received their new card, and the card is not yet active,</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"79a0d09e30bf"><em><strong>When </strong>the member presents =
the card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and se=
lecting the account (chq/sav), and selects the option for balance inquiry,<=
/em></p>
<p local-id=3D"b7438a0a7fed"><em><strong>Then</strong> the card is activate=
d and ready for use, the transaction successfully completes, and the member=
=E2=80=99s account balance is displayed</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"a5240ad2cfc7"><em><strong>9 - ATM Transfer Activation:</stro=
ng></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"76ae3481f95f"><em><strong>Given </strong>that the member has=
 received their new card, and the card is not yet active, and the transfer =
amount does not exceed the balance in the =E2=80=98from=E2=80=99 account,</=
em></p>
<p local-id=3D"b07dddf1b4fe"><em><strong>When </strong>the member presents =
the card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the correct PIN, sel=
ects the =E2=80=98from=E2=80=99 and =E2=80=98to=E2=80=99 accounts for the t=
ransfer, and enters the transfer amount,</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"57cde4846a27"><em><strong>Then</strong> the card is activate=
d and ready for use, the transaction successfully completes, and the transf=
er is made between the member=E2=80=99s accounts</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"70141815c832"><em><strong>10? Negative ATM scenarios?</stron=
g></em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8352929d-abba-48ee-88f6-f8a46918dc09" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d14a8e49fa7">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"513c58ce-920a-4776-91a0-e0ae0cadfa2a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a90da5702d3"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-148?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-148</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e8ab18608bcb">
<td data-local-id=3D"52d2f810-eb74-4e45-a98e-75277ad62a97" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9ad74d92425">2.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"918bd846-3af2-42d1-ba55-848fa5a2e6bf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"640a0a168a2f"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"18b64d2daf22"><strong>I want to</strong> activate my new car=
d digitally,</p>
<p local-id=3D"39a1ca0ec182"><strong>So that </strong>I can quickly begin t=
o use it without having the hassle of making an in-person transaction</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3295f767-ed49-4a46-b8ae-388a0b7ff0e3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aed3d375a90b">The system shall allow the member to activate =
the new card digitally via BeemDB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a2fa4ab4-3793-4787-ae8e-59f78b77d080" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06ac84eec4ff"><em><strong>Descoped</strong> currently - for =
future consideration/development if and when capabilities exist in BeemDB.<=
/em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a9de2ffd-1ff9-450b-b2de-068fa70b95ad">
<li local-id=3D"ba88f27b496c">
<p local-id=3D"3ca51812851d"><em>Once issued, member sees a notification ba=
nner in BeemDB asking for their action to activate the card - clicking on w=
hich should digitally activate the card</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ad97116b-5d9b-47f5-b033-48a05d4c0598">
<p local-id=3D"f5f017a1d33a"><em>Once the card is activated, it should be s=
hown as activated and be ready for usage</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"574dab42-7752-4a8c-820c-2a3cc4093fc3">
<p local-id=3D"afd8489d8888"><em>The activation message should only be show=
n for cards that have been newly issued and need activation</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9630bfd9-d900-4d23-accd-687ca88d94d4">
<p local-id=3D"4e8e9d5c686f"><em>In case of any error, display in simple la=
nguage the issue in activation, and provide the next steps for the member</=
em></p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc50c277-a1d9-40fc-a578-35587222f0c2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c14f2a51c638">P3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7faa2f24-f5de-47d8-b2ec-0ebc385178e9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff3dbd4f4829"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-147?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-147</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"fbd9c8e2d9ac" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-3.In-PersonTransactions(Domestic)">3. In-Person Transactions (Domes=
tic)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"fb3d5e2f2857"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"c88b53314dc3"><strong>WHEN I </strong>have an active Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"48746036a4a4"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> use my card for all=
 in-person ATM and POS transactions, using both chip-and-PIN as well as Int=
erac Flash/tap (where applicable), as well as use my card to receive refund=
s from returned / cancelled in-person transactions,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d47b851da479"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> conduct all in-=
person/physical transactions from my Beem account using my card, and receiv=
e applicable refunds back into my Beem account using my card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1553406040" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1553406040" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1553406040" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"b66=
70d93-1b67-497b-a597-afcd1449d6c0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 282.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 116.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 212.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 256.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d44e88b8-0f68-4fb9-93a8-f3ca15138812">
<th data-local-id=3D"613a1be6-da2a-4930-95dc-003c727bb6a0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5979bb2b2162"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"137bf7d2173e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"874261f59339"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ff1cb9e6-37e6-457d-bfd5-fa2584773a3a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"acf8def2539f"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"c2ab2505-6347-4846-8f8f-3d5b2f6a5f9a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a2b9f4017097"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c9139e63-8495-4441-b01c-51699a5fb2da" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"cfed2ccc9253"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b1d31ff0-331e-4370-8062-e6d56d65a76e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"dad04a89ddc8"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e4249b28-6cda-4974-9150-410797f0b63e">
<td data-local-id=3D"b96d45d1-93f2-4cb5-8144-f6b5aea4d327" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7e4548220aef">3.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aa6064053831" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7133f7e29f25"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2c0b02e67712"><strong>I want to</strong> use my card for in-=
person transactions at POS terminals via tap,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0b931bcc3bd5"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete my in-person transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b215f134-0bab-4c32-a6a5-3f42cd16f5c6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c31cf35fa09">The card shall allow the member to complete tr=
ansactions via contactless tap at all eligible merchant POS terminals via t=
he Interac network, within tap amount limits as defined by Beem</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"df392810-0430-4bf4-a986-5528fbe6138a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3452163ba64f"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a6e577ab48c0"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the tap amount limit, and that member has sufficient f=
unds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7f532fd37263"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d6b52700c4cb"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds</=
p>
<hr local-id=3D"a92264ec5007">
<p local-id=3D"aea66252088f"><strong>2 - Exceeds Tap Limit:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e195561f2238"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the tap amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"25b9152d0363"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e37c741a452c"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5eacdfe3d048">
<p local-id=3D"9dcb647d6307"><strong>3 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"047008b32762"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fea5b77da51a"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"52032873b72e"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81acc43d-55c8-4ff3-b919-4a58c89d06ce" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ce6be2876f4">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cc79299f-3879-4af1-a0e9-0a0400b15ced" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7cbc8c096b55"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-128?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-128</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5dd2f1da-8cef-4f08-8262-757559f00842">
<td data-local-id=3D"db9b37bc-fbe7-40bb-8624-9d60a9e24a61" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"230b99571b21">3.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7c1554299391" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df4703c7c9ba"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c8c8bc30277e"><strong>I want to</strong> use my card for<str=
ong> </strong>in-person transactions at POS terminals via Chip and PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fa14b33340c5"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete my in-person purchase transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b965b2e4-9274-4562-87ed-9bebd18bc88f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75258269a71a">The card shall allow the member to complete tr=
ansactions via Chip and PIN at all merchant POS terminals via the Interac n=
etwork, within purchase amount limits as defined by Beem</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a4f87c18-1841-4968-87b0-78ad17de3d20" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8d7245c85a6"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"3f7b2c35eece"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e83c8fbee8e7"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"da601c726cbe"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds</=
p>
