<tr data-local-id=3D"7a0b1ece-7fe3-453f-b3e8-5a4d8aea668f">
<td data-local-id=3D"01240ba2-4021-4b72-824c-da97624f430a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f3c64dc3928c">3.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3822b05d1fe7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ef65d55c200"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b0f8a7b3155c"><strong>I want to</strong> use my card for in-=
person <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"94a5b6d4-3791-4626=
-86eb-4eb4d66a5cbb">pre-authorization</span><strong><span class=3D"inline-c=
omment-marker" data-ref=3D"94a5b6d4-3791-4626-86eb-4eb4d66a5cbb"> </span></=
strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"94a5b6d4-3791-4626=
-86eb-4eb4d66a5cbb">transactions </span>at POS terminals,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6170fbc4a38b"><strong>So that</strong> I can complete purcha=
ses that require a pre-authorization to be placed</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"18629c4a-b48b-47e7-b5ad-8b4effe0c93a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa336d97c9e5">The card shall allow the member to complete pr=
e-authorization transactions via Chip and PIN at all eligible merchant POS =
terminals via the Interac network, within purchase amount limits as defined=
 by Beem</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ff75464-38ca-4ca8-8eff-6fba311a49d2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c28d4f311571"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4c928f825c01"><strong>Given</strong> that the merchant suppo=
rts pre-authorized transactions, the pre-authorization amount does not exce=
ed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient funds in their =
account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2acf4d5c854f"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d09ac3e65ba4"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization s=
uccessfully completes and a hold for the funds is temporarily placed on the=
 member=E2=80=99s account</p>
<hr local-id=3D"1499212ba4d5">
<p local-id=3D"228949eeee30"><strong>2 - Hold Released:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f8be4e192b5b"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion has successfully completed and a hold for the funds is temporarily plac=
ed on the member=E2=80=99s account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"473a35ac5629"><strong>When</strong> the member has subsequen=
tly completed the transaction purchase and the transaction amount has been =
debited from the member=E2=80=99s account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ac5a9a43ae2f"><strong>Then </strong>the temporary hold is re=
leased</p>
<hr local-id=3D"708a11b8-9b36-4838-af81-6e78255b234d">
<p local-id=3D"562fd8dc8238"><strong>3 - Transaction Cancelled:</strong></p=
>
<p local-id=3D"35021dd17ffa"><strong>Given </strong>that the that the pre-a=
uthorization has successfully completed and a hold for the funds is tempora=
rily placed on the member=E2=80=99s account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e75b5a51e7f6"><strong>When</strong> the transaction is subse=
quently cancelled and no funds are debited from the member=E2=80=99s accoun=
t,</p>
<p local-id=3D"41f059c74707"><strong>Then</strong> the temporary hold is re=
leased</p>
<hr local-id=3D"ca213f7ef5cd">
<p local-id=3D"144aae37271c"><strong>4 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"f8a1bdb8ddfe"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion amount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5afcf9c71ca4"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/s=
av), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0f70591f23f0"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"4a8f4bd8-7480-4d6b-ad69-b94ccbdff03c">
<p local-id=3D"558d9bc42fc6"><strong>5 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"116bf52ae002"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion amount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c99fdc5a5e94"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/s=
av), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d4a6cac78c70"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"ba980fe5-61d7-4f77-a078-10ed51f0ad11">
<p local-id=3D"b3e454267c90"><strong>6 - Incorrect PIN:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d1d587a4c9ba"><strong>Given</strong> that the member uses an=
 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a9be1e224a0c"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a063f3e7c689"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"601967221be9">
<p local-id=3D"c9dbf352c721"><strong>7 - Incorrect Account:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"98506a767204"><strong>Given </strong>that the member attempt=
