<p local-id=3D"b9859e31fc13"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the incorrect account=
 (chq/sav), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d962c66e2f1e"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
