<p local-id=3D"a9a2e04a6ebc">The card shall allow the member to complete re=
turn transactions via Chip (and PIN, if required) at all merchant POS termi=
nals via the Interac network</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8fe01697f141" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2397a02bb248"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b4e7ef9be675"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting an eligible return,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef4492fde1b6"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
