nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e049fbf8f293">3.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b3341c6-24ec-408a-b794-3299e2c4b3ac" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b994c408dcf"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"65f49ec45810"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for in-=
person USD cash withdrawal transactions at domestic Beem ATMs (OnUs network=
),</p>
<p local-id=3D"948ce9ee00d6"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully wi=
thdraw USD cash from my account at Beem ATMs in Canada</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9b6909f3-293d-4fa9-aad6-10b2411dadf9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"18214ff19ac4">The card shall allow the member to complete wi=
thdrawal transactions via Chip and PIN at all USD-dispensing domestic Beem =
ATMs on the OnUs network, within ATM withdrawal amount limits as defined by=
 Beem.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6ae63bb905ed">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f59fafca-dd2a-4c7a-a8fb-c388df53ca9d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"386da469c0b2"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"c282cca7865a"><strong>Given</strong> that the withdrawal amo=
unt does not exceed the ATM withdrawal amount limit, and the member has suf=
ficient funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d01abebca812"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d2aa45629314"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes, USD cash is dispensed, and the member=E2=80=99s account is=
 debited for the funds in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f25a12ec-b2a1-42cc-a323-519381ce73c2">
<p local-id=3D"8884b8051fac"><strong>2 - Exceeds ATM Withdrawal Limit:</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"96951575424e"><strong>Given</strong> that the withdrawal amo=
unt exceeds the ATM withdrawal amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0cd35bdfb9dc"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7dffa695a664"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"884532ea-d4f6-4e51-876f-896cafec2596">
<p local-id=3D"a9029a09bf6e"><strong>3 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"784eca2210ab"><strong>Given</strong> that the withdrawal amo=
unt exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6750fc4fc56c"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6b60068d7bed"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
