<td data-local-id=3D"a23b907a-4c99-4fe7-a1ae-90192ec44afc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a1ad895b3b14"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5466edc88e8d"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for in-=
person deposit transactions at applicable ATMs,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3db3081a65c8"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully de=
posit cash and/or cheques into my account</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b75cd6df-c0b1-4648-bf00-2b9a86e2d951" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"534ab99696b8">The card shall allow the member to complete de=
posit transactions via Chip and PIN at all ATMs on the following networks: =
OurNet (Beem), Exchange, and Acculink.</p>
<p local-id=3D"61c6f99f5e2c">If the specific ATM used supports multiple net=
works, the transaction will be automatically routed via the most appropriat=
e network, in the following order: (1) OurNet (Beem), (2) Exchange, (3) Acc=
ulink</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b56caa2d-0e1e-42c7-8687-9205458cbf5f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d2ec6f12aac"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"099356d43d69"><strong>Given</strong> that the member has cas=
h and/or cheques to deposit into their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0da0b2ab1b7f"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), enters the amount of funds to deposit, and inser=
ts the deposit into the ATM,</p>
<p local-id=3D"1a3f1b080104"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds<=
/p>
