 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"32a0ff6f9c58"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"018fde3261f2"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"17dc2239-37ec-4224-843d-0903f28776bc">
