nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a4dfdf00018">The card shall allow the member to complete ba=
lance inquiry transactions via Chip and PIN at all ATMs on the following ne=
tworks: OurNet (Beem), Exchange, Acculink, Interac, and Visa.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c7c4a0849b9f">If the specific ATM used supports multiple net=
works, the transaction will be automatically routed via the most appropriat=
e network, in the following order: (1) OurNet (Beem), (2) Exchange, (3) Acc=
ulink, (4) Interac, (5) Visa</p></td>
