nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c031cf56d2ae"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"df09a459f64f"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for in-=
person transfer activities at applicable ATMs,</p>
<p local-id=3D"51f0fee9da3e"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully tr=
ansfer funds between my accounts</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51d17463-a514-4a51-8bf8-a3e488f27a43" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"97149228f97e">The card shall allow the member to complete tr=
ansfers between their own accounts via Chip and PIN at applicable ATMs on t=
he following networks: OurNet (Beem), Exchange, and Acculink</p>
<p local-id=3D"a32a79b30e9a">If the specific ATM used supports multiple net=
works, the transaction will be automatically routed via the most appropriat=
e network, in the following order: (1) OurNet (Beem), (2) Exchange, (3) Acc=
ulink</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e325030d-4384-4359-a86c-76d9451d9933" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c4a3ddcb526"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6a6a988b08c0"><strong>Given</strong> that the transfer amoun=
t does not exceed the balance in the =E2=80=98from=E2=80=99 account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6d8f7450fa05"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the correct PIN, selects=
 the =E2=80=98from=E2=80=99 and =E2=80=98to=E2=80=99 accounts for the trans=
fer, and enters the transfer amount,</p>
<p local-id=3D"550280337874"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the transfer is made between the member=E2=80=99s accou=
nts</p>
