 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"66659ffa0500"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9525b60a05ac"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
