nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2df60f0d9f85">The card shall allow the member to complete PI=
N changes via Chip and PIN at applicable ATMs on the following networks: Ou=
rNet (Beem), Exchange, and Acculink.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a6a2d1448dab">If the specific ATM used supports multiple net=
works, the transaction will be automatically routed via the most appropriat=
e network, in the following order: (1) OurNet (Beem), (2) Exchange, (3) Acc=
ulink</p></td>
