<p local-id=3D"6418c9faf21e"><strong>Given</strong> that the member wishes =
to change their card PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"60b453b733bd"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the correct current PIN,=
 selects the option for PIN change, <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" d=
ata-ref=3D"c5b6ca84-4aed-4eeb-9a0e-028f8a473baf">and follows the process to=
 input their new PIN,</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"e5151b8c3892"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the PIN is successfully changed on the card</p>
