<h3 local-id=3D"a8042d6a4034" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-4.CNPTransactions(CAD)">4. CNP Transactions (CAD)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"09fd1d52ea1d"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"9a94a76006b9"><strong>WHEN I</strong> have an active Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e9e0cb90e384"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> use my card for all=
 CNP transactions including online purchases of goods/services, phone/mail =
orders, recurring transactions, automatic bill payments, and card-on-file t=
ransactions, as well as use my card to receive refunds from returned / canc=
elled CNP transactions,</p>
<p local-id=3D"60b0eae4a6b5"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> conduct all CNP=
 transactions directly from my Beem account using my card, and receive appl=
icable refunds back into my Beem account using my card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-228346993" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-228346993" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-228346993" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"0cc=
bd5b7-8a8e-4fab-bede-e416f9e8641a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 179.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 203.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 195.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 289.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0d4f0cd8-48e5-419a-9e11-9056b4bb75ea">
<th data-local-id=3D"5d9c0ca7-f245-435c-a9fc-e45e93e7a9e5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3fa5759d9bff"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8ab462434972" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bd181117718f"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"2bd932bb-0554-46d1-90b8-4cbc4ff41d02" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"553069bfce81"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"e5c9d435-7baa-4a20-9b5b-17be5f21ccef" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"cc9bd72f3b05"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e54d0344-0a28-4969-8e5f-ef6aef276b4a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b1f047a4142d"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"494d743d-401e-410c-84b9-f0ab6b4168ba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ad182d72faca"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8cabf8af-a527-4bbf-af14-f044f50f3c37">
<td data-local-id=3D"ec3f8fd8-27da-4f46-95ea-8623de12e839" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"714fd3222b88">4.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cdd9dfe15537" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d5632ccb53cb"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"949815191466"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for onl=
ine purchases of goods or services,</p>
<p local-id=3D"18bcbddc6600"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete my online purchase transactions</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eff33b31-754b-4f9f-add5-7d5c877021af" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b4c0a543e92">The card shall allow the member to complete al=
l online non-3DS and 3DS CNP purchase transactions via the Visa network</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"edfde0bf-b688-4100-a348-1f965da56b45" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29e0c1cbb09e"><strong>1 - Happy Path (non-3DS):</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7c6d4da1ea9d"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f6be724ced21"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"031dfb19c340"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds</=
p>
<hr local-id=3D"67b4f91c859d">
<p local-id=3D"dbc197a85eea"><strong>2 - Happy Path (3DS - SMS OTP)</strong=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"c9f44ac9ee9e"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a17c8eb4cb93"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and is completing the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8d93c08e5f66"><strong>Then t</strong>he 3DS authentication p=
rocess is initiated, an OTP is delivered to the member via SMS, and once th=
e OTP is correctly entered, the transaction completes and the member=E2=80=
=99s account is debited for the funds</p>
<hr local-id=3D"88cc596ecb55">
<p local-id=3D"33e7a7e73c13"><strong>3 - Happy Path (3DS - Email OTP)</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"06e9d32eb881"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d2d52f971640"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and is completing the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"336e1b97a2d6"><strong>Then t</strong>he 3DS authentication p=
rocess is initiated, an OTP is delivered to the member via email, and once =
the OTP is correctly entered, the transaction completes and the member=E2=
=80=99s account is debited for the funds</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6ba3996a4460">
<p local-id=3D"496651d8c52b"><strong>4 - 3DS Incorrect OTP (SMS + Email)</s=
trong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6891936af8a7"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting a 3DS authentication process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"1589e4456109"><strong>When</strong> the member enters an inc=
orrect OTP,</p>
<p local-id=3D"72250816cf56"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned after 1 failed attempt and is blocked after 3 failed OTP attempts.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6ac162100f8b">
<p local-id=3D"81373783cbd5"><strong>5 - 3DS Expired OTP</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e19fd9030d54"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting a 3DS authentication process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"484234925134"><strong>When</strong> the member enters an OTP=
 after the time limit expires,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f8e387f2392a"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p>
