p>
<p local-id=3D"c7057537c760"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e6c83b0bc9d9"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a2d96634843a"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5476d9392dae">
