/p>
<p local-id=3D"b7c5eb2a97ce"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6f7c9eba7e7e"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
