<p local-id=3D"706e68b6d4a6"><strong>Then</strong> the card is saved on fil=
e with the merchant to process future transactions</p>
<hr local-id=3D"777b41fd-1409-4370-b339-5b4d10f1cd8f">
<p local-id=3D"122db4cd487a"><strong>2 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d92110ddaca3"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"cd4ac71f6ea1"><strong>When</strong> the member has set up a =
card on file with a merchant and provides authorization to the merchant to =
charge the card on file for a transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b3fc5da61bb9"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is comp=
leted and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds</p>
<hr local-id=3D"884496c4-c776-41ea-b373-365ab0143ae0">
<p local-id=3D"aa9cec9b11ff"><strong>3 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"afdcef93a57a"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"663f0dc50961"><strong>When</strong> the member has set up a =
card on file with a merchant and provides authorization to the merchant to =
charge the card on file for a transaction,,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e74180f19271"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"742638eaa7f0">
<p local-id=3D"f8d1434781d3"><strong>4 - Exceeds Account Balance </strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"14881d777ae1"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fda7fc363128"><strong>When</strong> the member has set up a =
card on file with a merchant and provides authorization to the merchant to =
charge the card on file for a transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8118f71c253e"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f1f37f3e-0cbe-466e-933c-d97b68c1fb73">
<p local-id=3D"061e2a5f8389"><strong>5 - Incorrect CVV </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"88e41dc49a9b"><strong>Given</strong> the transaction amount =
does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient fu=
nds in their account and a CVV must be provided to complete the purchase,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"031d1c506739"><strong>When</strong> an incorrect CVV is ente=
red,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f448974714f1"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0cace148-eb8d-463b-a203-e891e6f45a5a">
<p local-id=3D"792d23f57d60"><strong>6 - Incorrect Card Expiry Date</strong=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"8429443b4764"><strong>Given</strong> the transaction amount =
does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient fu=
nds in their account and a card expiry date must be provided to complete th=
e purchase,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7af20f4308ac"><strong>When</strong> an incorrect card expiry=
 date is entered,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6aceb30382bf"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p></td>
