r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"779aabbd21d8"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization t=
ransaction is declined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"445bfdc7d912">
<p local-id=3D"a3228d8cc886"><strong>5 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"8c5808e91fe9"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion amount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5276abab1273"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d8cfe2606643"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization t=
ransaction is declined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c1004b60-f991-4c63-9ec4-fc2b1851c9e2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"526bfe764976">P1</p></td>
