<td data-local-id=3D"32b95d6c0971" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ddba68048b97">4.13</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f17acc8c06fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2966fc2c9e63"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d9c6e4e309ab"><strong>I want to</strong> receive funds from =
other Visa cardholders via a Visa Direct Original Credit Transaction (OCT),=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"c0625c988a5d"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully re=
ceive money to other individuals</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d634e748479" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e576ce83c07e">The card shall allow the member to receive all=
 CNP Visa Direct Original Credit Transactions (OCT) via the Visa network</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"989cefbad17b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2cf5a4322434"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"29e05b31f205"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is rece=
iving funds from another Visa cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"32351c2828a8"><strong>When</strong> the member receives an O=
riginal Credit Transaction (OCT) via Visa Direct,</p>
<p local-id=3D"765bbbf6ceaf"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1eed03f5c97b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2934ac517fb2">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"76f15bcb8fce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e04b140b3c12"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b33800855c2e">
<td data-local-id=3D"b63b0c8039df" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"730660417e0a">4.14</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01ca95761a8c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"98e0a66d0471"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f503ad666cb1"><strong>I want</strong> to receive SMS text al=
erts of my purchases,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8c79fd001506"><strong>So that</strong> I can be informed whe=
n specific transactions are authorized and debited from my account which ca=
n help identify fraudulent transactions.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2273f3c4472a">&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e0e9fb4e95dd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd561661e814">Authorized CNP online purchases, phone/mail or=
ders and Account Funding Transactions (AFT) made via the Visa network shoul=
d trigger an SMS text alert upon debiting the account with the exception of=
 recurring payments, merchant returns/refunds and declined transactions whi=
ch should not trigger any alert.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cf7c819978de" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2bb2ef342af4"><em>To be completed with details</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"d9b9d2225949"><strong>1 - Happy Path (CNP Purchase)</strong>=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"b6a4c2100197"><strong>2 - Happy Path (Phone/Mail Order)</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"fdf18886383d"><strong>3 - Happy Path (AFT)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b3ec500b2321"><strong>4 - Recurring Payments </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"bf7dc61d93eb"><strong>5 - Merchant Returns/Refunds</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"49c9d4cd26c1"><strong>6 - Declined Transactions</strong></p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"61d178347e03" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"56e5ca7e2e40"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd2f7ea17be2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"377946c708b7"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9007fed2ba03">
<td data-local-id=3D"7f0eeffa67a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce5f0f1b5297">4.15</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a4cef785b9d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fc3f464aa0d"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"65f0c41487f4"><strong>I want</strong> to cancel (opt out) SM=
S text alerts of my purchases,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c62ba3888067"><strong>So that</strong> I am no longer alerte=
d when specific transactions are authorized and debited from my account.</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"622d8742430a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5cd381b63f26">Authorized CNP online purchases, phone/mail or=
ders and Account Funding Transactions (AFT) made via the Visa network shoul=
d no longer trigger SMS alerts after cancellation or opt out by cardholder.=
</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1af31b54bfc4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0fa358e093cf"><em>To be completed with details</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"6aff1c3cdcfa"><strong>1 - Happy Path (CNP Purchase)</strong>=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"b1fc59d67f60"><strong>Given </strong>the member has opted ou=
t of receiving text alerts,</p>
<p local-id=3D"681a8f73adc6"><strong>When</strong> the member completes a C=
NP purchase and funds are authorized and debited from the account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4bc6d8de6771"><strong>Then</strong> an SMS text message is n=
ot triggered.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"9dcac4b3-9bd3-458b-8dc4-a2b326658042">
<p local-id=3D"19fdf6d11425"><strong>2 - Happy Path (Phone/Mail Order)</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ed94c4ae6752"><strong>3 - Happy Path (AFT)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4f00477877f3"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73bdcb835a4f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"00a7ecdc0869"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f3e648176ad2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3650a289c19c"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"5cdc9bba876a" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-5.In-PersonTransactions(International)">5. In-Person Transactions (=
International)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"67592afc0966"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"9b5330d6703e"><strong>WHEN I</strong> have an active Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a45800235b93"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> use my Visa Debit c=
ard for all International in-person ATM and POS transactions, including mak=
ing in-person transactions at merchants outside of Canada, receiving refund=
s from returned / cancelled in-person transactions outside of Canada, and w=
ithdrawing foreign currency from ATMs outside of Canada,</p>
<p local-id=3D"35c403152cea"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> conduct all int=
ernational in-person ATM and POS transactions directly from my Beem account=
 using my card, and receive applicable refunds back into my Beem account us=
ing my card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-249244684" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-249244684" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-249244684" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"586=
30417-29eb-4582-aaa9-5ebaf4b8c0a9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 262.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 120.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 214.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 270.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7ce6dbda-e2d6-45ef-890f-9f4d3af38ddd">
<th data-local-id=3D"e83f2711-1cb3-4c6f-ae32-1a752e4fc59a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a19e04b26c86">#</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"cce9d6755911" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"1a377f3bb07a"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6893963c-3f8f-4de6-9e8b-aaca15f5457d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"19f74e834f6f"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"97e81baf-0096-418c-a1af-9f1e99d42822" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f50ee840734a"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"dce79671-8162-4818-8a82-c81779e6ab7f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6180ef58441d"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"bc624c88-f716-487d-b5a6-99018cb41e0b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"851975a06662"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"54c69f48-22b8-4b3c-a205-ce524867010e">
<td data-local-id=3D"37fa51f0-42af-4ac8-9ee6-dabfb8175deb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbe93ffbf115">5.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ebbd8d7af873" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b5a7c7110713"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f8b19cc0dea9"><strong>I want to</strong> use my card for in-=
person transactions at POS terminals internationally (outside Canada) via t=
ap,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0f6741c0adb7"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete my international in-person transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4a85d9b6-040a-4a6c-89cf-f80006b90607" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ed1dd7a9a979">The card shall allow the member to complete tr=
ansactions at all eligible merchant POS terminals internationally (outside =
Canada) via the Visa network, within tap amount limits as defined by Beem.<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"4b77914d13cd">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cb0bd1db-0da2-4dee-b7e1-9719e25f7df6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6249159b7fc6"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4ca985cfc8bb"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the tap amount limit, and that member has sufficient f=
unds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4c2059cd1802"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8a811f7c904c"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds i=
n CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"a07602c0-d755-455f-8f75-89000270199f">
<p local-id=3D"254d44e0a6b5"><strong>2 - Exceeds Tap Limit:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"1007c939089f"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the tap amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e855682eac12"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c130f0406c1d"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"450a7177-7adc-454b-aa0a-8b1b00f4be85">
<p local-id=3D"b9a669aa1619"><strong>3 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"f58ec7635d9e"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3424c0994e52"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7836d7468c12"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b264794a-dfa6-41b0-a143-6d27eab7060b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"edcb58f899a2">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4a21b1e5-13db-4667-875e-6d355d64db9f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ff769f0c1fe"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-138?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-138</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"762ba938a9ad">
<td data-local-id=3D"6471d9547c27" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"050cb74afc89">5.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b2811f877410" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d6e555b01e7"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"eb84a5d98ea4"><strong>I want to</strong> use my card for<str=
ong> </strong>in-person transactions at POS terminals internationally (outs=
ide Canada) via Chip and PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"96d58f03a984"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete my international in-person purchase transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8b44a5a48f63" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a730844e631e">The card shall allow the member to complete tr=
ansactions via Chip and PIN at all merchant POS terminals internationally (=
outside Canada) via the Visa network, within purchase amount limits as defi=
ned by Beem.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6c63cbd8f5f7">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b0c004b37bf9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff71061e7510"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f28ee62b11a5"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"354af3cd62f4"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e76b1d6212be"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds i=
n CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"204caaeb-7e45-4f2a-8b74-0c9fb81d84e6">
<p local-id=3D"bfd9773037a6"><strong>2 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"16db3d0d27cb"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"caae7808633c"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/s=
av), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"91c8a8e1d310"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"094bc072-c37d-45e6-8df8-2bffff4c2aba">
<p local-id=3D"7751385e0f04"><strong>3 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"9c83f1b5ef4d"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8129b0edc406"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/s=
av), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4d7141c3d1b3"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c46a5844-42c5-4a7a-a053-cc840edefdce">
<p local-id=3D"37e84215de61"><strong>4 - Incorrect PIN:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5fc410d28978"><strong>Given</strong> that the member uses an=
 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bf9d06db1700"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a5faa424a242"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"aeae33d3-af1c-4fdf-976d-50307eabf864">
<p local-id=3D"d057bcab8578"><strong>5 - Incorrect Account:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6a5501787645"><strong>Given </strong>that the member attempt=
s to use an account (chq/sav) that is not connected to the card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f0c63794afb6"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the incorrect account=
 (chq/sav), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"15b8983b6bde"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c80630b4b7a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c54c069c754">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b8dfc2057b4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b7b48cc8543b"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bc33f762f35a">
<td data-local-id=3D"9e6b62c1fa7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"20144b265351">5.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a289ba71cda9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c998c37bddde"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f5f75923866c"><strong>I want to</strong> use my card for in-=
person pre-authorization<strong> </strong>transactions at POS terminals int=
ernationally (outside Canada),</p>
<p local-id=3D"b157a83b873b"><strong>So that</strong> I can complete intern=
ational purchases that require a pre-authorization to be placed</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"409baf8fe631" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"636e61564fa6">The card shall allow the member to complete pr=
e-authorization transactions via Chip and PIN at all eligible merchant POS =
terminals internationally (outside Canada) via the Visa network, within pur=
chase amount limits as defined by Beem.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a2a51a82ba5b">A hold on the member=E2=80=99s account shall b=
e placed for the appropriate amount in CAD, using the correct current excha=
nge rate at the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6819f1156938" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba082f4d5229"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f4d3b3df4b12"><strong>Given</strong> that the merchant suppo=
rts pre-authorized transactions, the pre-authorization amount does not exce=
ed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient funds in their =
account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c0ba791980d8"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"67b1419e6ded"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization s=
uccessfully completes and a hold for the funds is temporarily placed on the=
 member=E2=80=99s account, in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7dbab25156a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0e37695a7e8">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"415bbf28760e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a3a7eb0388b"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"092e3709-ad32-4dcc-8a16-97f369ef2700">
<td data-local-id=3D"8c3fc735-3dc6-4c3a-8f69-cf03e09116b3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c0ab21b4e6b">5.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c1fa0ff3e2d2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"526186e60bbe"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f41c1ed128b2"><strong>I want to </strong>receive refunds fro=
m in-person return transactions internationally (outside Canada), back to m=
y card/account via tap,</p>
<p local-id=3D"dbdee66a19bd"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully re=
trieve my funds for items that I have returned internationally</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"42fd962b-28dd-433b-80e0-4eef9790070c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c1c2d9fbb7f">The card shall allow the member to complete re=
turn transactions via tap at all eligible merchant POS terminals internatio=
nally (outside Canada) via the Visa network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"05ae897e1507">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be credite=
d to the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at =
the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f569b84d-b1f6-4936-8c2f-4d9ce03ce16d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ffa9874754a7"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"28d82c219bee"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting an eligible return,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d593e1c968ac"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by tap/flash,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b6b79018a577"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds =
in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c03397a-b5ca-4686-9478-0b8693d51bc6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76409f16c35e">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1dddb9e9-9b0f-4604-8c66-568366cef8c5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b993e655de3"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ae5ca24a6f36">
<td data-local-id=3D"02e896b8a88b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec3a1a5e0258">5.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4f7812116412" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a953be912ab"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5b230ca296bf"><strong>I want to </strong>receive refunds fro=
m in-person return transactions internationally (outside Canada) back to my=
 card/account via Chip (and PIN, if required),</p>
<p local-id=3D"f61a8729f551"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully re=
trieve my funds for items that I have returned internationally</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa4af13ee41c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1d615eba11a">The card shall allow the member to complete re=
turn transactions via Chip (and PIN, if required) at all merchant POS termi=
nals internationally (outside Canada) via the Visa network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6584917d3b02">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be credite=
d to the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at =
the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e9f05ae8afff" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dec977e043a9"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"83c5ee3dae94"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting an eligible return,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c566e0852a6b"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav,=
 if required), and entering the correct PIN (if required),</p>
<p local-id=3D"05697c18798d"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds =
in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"141fb6b8-6456-43d5-bb3b-743f9d09c3fc">
<p local-id=3D"6096692a2f64"><strong>2 - Incorrect PIN:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4b1f31677496"><strong>Given</strong> that the member uses an=
 incorrect PIN (if required),</p>
<p local-id=3D"1088045ae3e5"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the account (chq/sav)=
, and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bb8743741700"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c5157423-c85f-42dd-95a6-102b0d5e9891">
<p local-id=3D"a99710de2d09"><strong>3 - Incorrect Account:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a29fe4d174bb"><strong>Given </strong>that the member attempt=
s to use an account (chq/sav, if required) that is not connected to the car=
d,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f00709cd35c6"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at POS terminal by inserting the Chip, selecting the incorrect account=
 (chq/sav), and entering the correct PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6b3917f8b787"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"923ce4473988" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b21cef207c8">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8655837c87a0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"70945a9e8c6c"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"62268d37-9a48-4166-9edd-6e6b57b908af">
<td data-local-id=3D"023c56aa-1e69-4e61-adc5-3eb0f90ef82d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"014f18ebc84a">5.6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3ece313a2dc1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a6ad28235234"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"070f92a69e8e"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for in-=
person foreign currency cash withdrawal transactions at international (outs=
ide Canada) ATMs,</p>
<p local-id=3D"43e902747404"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully wi=
thdraw cash from my account internationally</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"227581d7-4b33-4921-8fe3-b648b195197d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cecca7f467aa">The card shall allow the member to complete fo=
reign currency cash withdrawal transactions via Chip and PIN at all interna=
tional (outside Canada) ATMs via the Visa network, within ATM withdrawal am=
ount limits as defined by Beem.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2b3a4d14d0e4">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9cf68481-0ee4-4c41-ae16-abe9c38f9334" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26ef73f730c0"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e5449da9dc3f"><strong>Given</strong> that the withdrawal amo=
unt does not exceed the ATM withdrawal amount limit, and the member has suf=
ficient funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8e50b729a6bf"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3dd3332891e5"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes, foreign currency cash is dispensed, and the member=E2=80=
=99s account is debited for the funds in CAD, using the current exchange ra=
te</p>
<hr local-id=3D"9109158c-f1ff-41dc-b541-16841fdb19e3">
<p local-id=3D"d7649fb286e4"><strong>2 - Exceeds ATM Withdrawal Limit:</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5c5e21f3328f"><strong>Given</strong> that the withdrawal amo=
unt exceeds the ATM withdrawal amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"1620db8c2fb2"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0464bc293d4a"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c8c96249-e904-4dff-9fa2-43c14c343b70">
<p local-id=3D"4d64bba847a7"><strong>3 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"7d442b4700b5"><strong>Given</strong> that the withdrawal amo=
unt exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c8f24379da54"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and enters the amount of funds to withdraw,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8b12371eeb99"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"a08e5bf0-f12d-401a-8e8d-aa8a73d11291">
<p local-id=3D"5450ffb254e1"><strong>4 - Incorrect PIN:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"34cd113d1398"><strong>Given</strong> that the member uses an=
 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e633d5c5e162"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6b7aac9a42fb"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"2eef5b73-c024-4d11-af8b-0981a6d09ff2">
<p local-id=3D"2ca0741c9450"><strong>5 - Incorrect Account:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e2d454afa115"><strong>Given </strong>that the member attempt=
s to use an account (chq/sav) that is not connected to the card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"17cff4b02acf"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the incorrect account (chq/sav),</p>
<p local-id=3D"6ca0d37cfaea"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5950e2e-a6af-4fe3-a909-ca499a325db0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6faa4225e60c">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"707e8c9f-cc8c-4500-b348-aa16bb9de288" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"18668f8dc775"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-140?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-140</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"132c467c1c05">
<td data-local-id=3D"76c45754-b060-4df2-a0aa-a6d9b473b0cd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d52802f1dfe9">5.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d1a975f8-e5e7-4b4a-9414-daffa71137c1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b70cc91a69a"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"64d2305ec935"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for in-=
person balance inquiries at international (outside Canada) ATMs,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ee4846e570fe"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully fi=
nd out the amount of funds in my account internationally</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5eb0001f-fe1b-46f6-8165-aef7e21e8f42" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b8dba939b103">The card shall allow the member to complete ba=
lance inquiry transactions via Chip and PIN at eligible international (outs=
ide Canada) ATMs via the Visa network</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"483e0895-0fb8-4088-8914-97668fea46a1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf36857f24c2"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ee664f67b0fd"><strong>Given</strong> that the member wishes =
to know their account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"97312c3dd8d6"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the account (chq/sav), and selects the option for balance inquiry,</p>
<p local-id=3D"07487a093f44"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account balance is displayed</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f37a0602-a119-47dd-8d18-dc8b8e0f9dee">
<p local-id=3D"204a77cd91da"><strong>2 - Incorrect PIN:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0510b8116fd2"><strong>Given</strong> that the member uses an=
 incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"66ad125daef2"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip and entering the incorrect PIN,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ff62639b47b5"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"81f11b28-d47c-415c-a9a1-71e5ccabdd5a">
<p local-id=3D"9bc71c8f3e3c"><strong>3 - Incorrect Account:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d4d587ce0824"><strong>Given </strong>that the member attempt=
s to use an account (chq/sav) that is not connected to the card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a62347d8f7a"><strong>When</strong> the member presents the =
card at the ATM by inserting the Chip, entering the correct PIN, and select=
ing the incorrect account (chq/sav),</p>
<p local-id=3D"86665cbf6a43"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"867ba6fd-924b-441f-b43b-dc1235cadbf2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12f0c419675b">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6fb5040f-cfbc-46cf-a39a-5aa4a3f4f7ef" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"535dfd057d12"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a45e37c92772">
<td data-local-id=3D"9909349abcb0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b330f39f04b9">5.8</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7ad3d7f53e19" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5bd703ad4f82"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"251ac7f5531e"><strong>I want</strong> to receive SMS text al=
erts of my international POS transactions and ATM withdrawals,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7b8102dc1ac9"><strong>So that</strong> I can be informed whe=
n specific transactions are authorized and debited from my account which ca=
n help identify fraudulent transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"28f9149558d7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"148692c7051d">Authorized international in person ATM withdra=
wals and POS transactions made via the Visa network should trigger an SMS t=
ext alert upon debiting the account with the exception of recurring payment=
s, merchant returns/refunds, declined transactions and ATM balance inquirie=
s which should not trigger any alert.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e2cfe65ddf1f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"245a345d2b74"><em>To be completed with details</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"060564a3eb4a"><strong>1 - Happy Path (ATM Withdrawal)</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"e6bf01519cfa"><strong>2 - Happy Path (POS transaction)</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"e2f10372d5de"><strong>3 - Recurring Payments </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b92736b885af"><strong>4 - Merchant Returns/Refunds</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"7442e842fa54"><strong>5 - Declined Transactions</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"c32d8947c86d"><strong>6 - ATM Balance Inquiry</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4b3f49f4c568"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"416e16626c69" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42a843499d75"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fbc769f1f9a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"061871918cf4"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3f63de399a18">
<td data-local-id=3D"67bb3e04fcdf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de451a2197b6">5.9</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"19ed66ba96c6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6ce0b765250a"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bcbed5983681"><strong>I want</strong> to cancel (opt out) SM=
S text alerts of my purchases,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f5c651597a55"><strong>So that</strong> I am no longer alerte=
d when specific transactions are authorized and debited from my account.</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"92d5bf672c2e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12631a463625">Authorized international in person ATM withdra=
wals and POS transactions made via the Visa network should no longer trigge=
r SMS alerts after cancellation or opt out by cardholder.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"709087a546e6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0272292209a2"><em>To be completed with details</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"209a88e5d58f"><strong>1 - Happy Path (ATM Withdrawal)</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"0a64bd1d1dfb"><strong>Given </strong>the member has opted ou=
t of receiving text alerts,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4bb2aa088f22"><strong>When</strong> the member completes an =
ATM Withdrawal and funds are authorized and debited from the account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"356b6b209855"><strong>Then</strong> an SMS text message is n=
ot triggered.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5e040302-1dd9-47cf-99e4-370628ab92f2">
<p local-id=3D"3f958bd726b4"><strong>2 - Happy Path (POS Transaction)</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"f0d0a69c0dc4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3c7f787e1cf9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"09b609a8734a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c9c1d215c3d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce7bca07603c"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"ab788776dca2" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-6.CNPTransactions(ForeignCurrency)">6. CNP Transactions (Foreign Cu=
rrency)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3a82281a5b31"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"71d36a3e29d1"><strong>WHEN I</strong> have an active Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fe8b5a256bcc"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> use my Visa Debit c=
ard for all foreign currency CNP transactions including online purchases of=
 goods/services in foreign currencies, phone/mail orders in foreign currenc=
ies, recurring transactions in foreign currencies, and card-on-file transac=
tions in foreign currencies, as well as use my card to receive refunds from=
 returned / cancelled CNP transactions in foreign currencies,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ae6e43dfb399"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> conduct all int=
ernational/foreign currency transactions directly from my Beem account usin=
g my card, and receive applicable foreign currency refunds back into my Bee=
m account using my card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-650689300" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-650689300" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-650689300" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"399=
e2f37b5cd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 262.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 120.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 214.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 270.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"63c2411c-b55a-4a20-99f1-86215b68db93">
<th data-local-id=3D"a9713097-f6bc-44e6-87dc-f98c8a165940" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ac7df4d7c3a1">#</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b678768d-ecb4-4824-9598-81799cd9d857" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4119c88820f9"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fee4308d-f4de-4188-93da-e55577287461" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"81e93b8c1f15"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"f57ba449-67f7-4bdc-a80e-c61adbc461b7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f6fb4c48c9aa"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0676f0e8-4422-4e0c-a4db-196b859381f7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d21904a44553"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a5c025e2-8e88-49df-8968-a11cf7b1041c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a167b2c66052"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"91ad1f7d-4c1f-4bd1-94dc-66fbbf94f5b0">
<td data-local-id=3D"34bdbc85-5160-4394-8c74-0bb01d6036f6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ce3445947f4">6.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b947f38a-638a-44fb-a424-c11e731329df" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe74dbe4a1b8"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2e94c6f4b41b"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for onl=
ine purchases of goods or services in foreign currencies,</p>
<p local-id=3D"81b7e27caa4f"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete my foreign currency online purchase transactions</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4af13baa-d126-4de4-abf6-1eb0403057eb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b025aba7bea">The card shall allow the member to complete al=
l online non-3DS and 3DS CNP purchase transactions in foreign currencies vi=
a the Visa network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef41c6066e45">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9e1938b857ab"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"082e0e11-2e78-4b6a-bfaa-f831c83abb44" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a3d35c82518b"><strong>1 - Happy Path (non-3DS):</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"c8a368fa175a"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"be1fc26f4063"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b2800c4406f6"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds i=
n CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"524038e3-b5cc-4437-ada6-fe167c1de707">
<p local-id=3D"51f451299a5b"><strong>2 - Happy Path (3DS - SMS OTP)</strong=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"673bf06c7180"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"991af7fb5b8e"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and is completing the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2e4caa6bfe8f"><strong>Then t</strong>he 3DS authentication p=
rocess is initiated, an OTP is delivered to the member via SMS, and once th=
e OTP is correctly entered, the transaction completes and the member=E2=80=
=99s account is debited for the funds in CAD, using the current exchange ra=
te</p>
<hr local-id=3D"cbfb4bcf-5118-474f-bddd-08be00e1e128">
<p local-id=3D"580beed7bb64"><strong>3 - Happy Path (3DS - Email OTP)</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"b71064f40b8b"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b4e26273ea4b"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and is completing the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"95b9b13afaed"><strong>Then t</strong>he 3DS authentication p=
rocess is initiated, an OTP is delivered to the member via email, and once =
the OTP is correctly entered, the transaction completes and the member=E2=
=80=99s account is debited for the funds in CAD, using the current exchange=
 rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"daa2b1c0-cd74-4164-90c3-3830d6a0ab56">
<p local-id=3D"9bc60257f32d"><strong>4 - 3DS Incorrect OTP (SMS + Email)</s=
trong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ac0178512004"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting a 3DS authentication process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"81e358d9d0b6"><strong>When</strong> the member enters an inc=
orrect OTP,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bbd67f54c10a"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned after 1 failed attempt and is blocked after 3 failed OTP attempts.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"7f4e63a1-ea24-40e5-b36e-10fa6aebd023">
<p local-id=3D"6ed45a91843e"><strong>5 - 3DS Expired OTP</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6033d53ec509"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting a 3DS authentication process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d5f3baa623f8"><strong>When</strong> the member enters an OTP=
 after the time limit expires,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e9ca8d70a87d"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0f0be130-bc9b-412c-94d0-8f64f0750192">
<p local-id=3D"e4ad5aecfe7c"><strong>6 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"cefd2b01bbc4"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a840199c3432"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a6c3cd508a84"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6213ad4b-1acb-441a-ad71-2ef74c5aa8d6">
<p local-id=3D"3a00cae62327"><strong>7 - Exceeds Account Balance</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"a6df1a1f1b83"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"59d517f8d745"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a65e8a38a32"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"ff1a4aca-0dc2-4118-ad32-b514ddefaeff">
<p local-id=3D"747eaa0ff7c2"><strong>8 - Incorrect CVV </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"2ded88601cfe"><strong>Given</strong> the transaction amount =
does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient fu=
nds in their account and a CVV must be provided to complete the purchase,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"4e753ecf698a"><strong>When</strong> an incorrect CVV is ente=
red,</p>
<p local-id=3D"745a23a775cd"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p>
<hr local-id=3D"e6581d51-8217-4545-839f-b833d5e1db27">
<p local-id=3D"84aa93304509"><strong>9 - Incorrect Card Expiry Date</strong=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"bcbc87e12522"><strong>Given</strong> the transaction amount =
does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient fu=
nds in their account and a card expiry date must be provided to complete th=
e purchase,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0dec55c1fa79"><strong>When</strong> an incorrect card expiry=
 date is entered,</p>
<p local-id=3D"42525c1bfa64"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p>
<p local-id=3D"f5f24fac9010"></p></td>
