<td data-local-id=3D"e77d5abd-6894-462b-8669-9ca0a51f9026" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0bbbcca92275"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-137?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-137</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"96196927-bfba-4d7e-97e5-44376600ec33">
<td data-local-id=3D"5aeb3625-1ab9-4bf9-a9e6-e93ca4d41d39" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"68544cc427e2">6.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8a476957-9592-4802-9206-61ecac70b22a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a3d2ff954cc5"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9b77aa2c8d00"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for onl=
ine pre-authorization transactions in foreign currencies,</p>
<p local-id=3D"931b617dbf11"><strong>So that</strong> I can complete foreig=
n currency online purchases that require a pre-authorization to be placed</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fc4c32ab-b728-4401-9680-9bd06db3f87e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f902fb74f6f5">The card shall allow the member to complete CN=
P pre-authorization transactions in foreign currencies via the Visa network=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"be1deb29de36">A hold on the member=E2=80=99s account shall b=
e placed for the appropriate amount in CAD, using the correct current excha=
nge rate at the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0babc3c6-ec6d-4576-bcb4-263a443adbb8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e8ffad6a8ee5"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"534417f29ebe"><strong>Given</strong> that the merchant suppo=
rts pre-authorized transactions, the pre-authorization amount does not exce=
ed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient funds in their =
account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"31e8d21b11a9"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"adc0ac730122"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization s=
uccessfully completes and a hold for the funds is temporarily placed on the=
 member=E2=80=99s account, in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"d3c7ca95-e4d1-407e-ab39-404d2f3cea97">
<p local-id=3D"763f9102d10c"><strong>2 - Hold Released:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ebb053403790"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion has successfully completed and a hold for the funds is temporarily plac=
ed on the member=E2=80=99s account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e1a949fbc3a9"><strong>When</strong> the member has subsequen=
tly completed the transaction purchase and the transaction amount has been =
debited from the member=E2=80=99s account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"511c0b961b08"><strong>Then </strong>the temporary hold is re=
leased</p>
<hr local-id=3D"b7a40bcf-1430-46e5-8799-1205b2046412">
<p local-id=3D"c4ba085374a1"><strong>3 - Transaction Cancelled:</strong></p=
>
<p local-id=3D"7d1d3d70a241"><strong>Given </strong>that the that the pre-a=
uthorization has successfully completed and a hold for the funds is tempora=
rily placed on the member=E2=80=99s account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3451c16f9398"><strong>When</strong> the transaction is subse=
quently cancelled and no funds are debited from the member=E2=80=99s accoun=
t,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c7ab58a969f1"><strong>Then</strong> the temporary hold is re=
leased</p>
<hr local-id=3D"afae4b7b-345e-42c4-a36b-5bb1b91495a7">
<p local-id=3D"f9287cf0aed6"><strong>4 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"d2b811822a67"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion amount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5ada8c7b1009"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"badd27a0c457"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization t=
ransaction is declined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6544b4ee-6cae-4dfb-be80-376ba4f5a2d4">
<p local-id=3D"6fdd06713644"><strong>5 - Exceeds Account Balance:</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"fcc4f49d1d01"><strong>Given</strong> that the pre-authorizat=
ion amount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"678a72615c11"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ea4cba5f728f"><strong>Then: </strong>the pre-authorization t=
ransaction is declined</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3edb7e3f-2e2c-45e3-bb73-e25e8e9b5976" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eddc07c55119">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9263c81f-3751-4342-854f-c2d6373f8a9f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd0ee2e0879c"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"094ec051-0e27-4ba6-9eee-21f27b161ddf">
<td data-local-id=3D"971665b4-8791-4cd0-a6d1-8ad22b5a553e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01c27a80bac4">6.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"362830b8-9e5f-4309-a11b-93cd90083a54" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b07a93c0c0d9"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b93fa3f36990"><strong>I want to </strong>receive refunds fro=
m online return transactions in foreign currencies back to my card/account,=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"e1ddb755720a"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully re=
trieve my funds for items that I have returned in foreign currencies</p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"17b444d3-ac59-486f-81f9-776153ed2ae8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a2477cf1279d">The card shall allow the member to complete al=
l CNP return transactions in foreign currencies via the Visa network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bd595bd69ae2">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be credite=
d to the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at =
the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"300f4e31-0d1b-4e85-b699-3e01feabe045" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4d93f4c0f4b"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f0cfa98f1a7b"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting an eligible online return,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bc8cceaf8350"><strong>When</strong> the member completes the=
 online merchant return process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4f208953cc5b"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds =
in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<p local-id=3D"d171e0164e0c"></p></td>
