nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1ddc88e64ce8">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"31161b55-858f-4a4e-935f-6c3217791c46" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"25bf18b58864"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"39deb4fc-cdb7-4e62-a11d-72bf25eb921f">
<td data-local-id=3D"61ea694e-8696-4538-bf7b-a34882cf5193" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"53508aa60c0a">6.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8d26a7d4-bbda-42fa-8b66-32d32e3279a4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79da8b76b2a3"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef27f74c0a32"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for set=
 up and completion of recurring transactions in foreign currencies,</p>
<p local-id=3D"223cec90c30d"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete foreign currency recurring transaction purchases</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6db94bec-c5d2-49d4-8ad7-710ab48e3a77" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52c4554ccd71">The card shall allow the member to set up and =
complete all CNP recurring transactions in foreign currencies via the Visa =
network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8607d5aacd2a">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b3f72398-9201-481d-91b8-38c630fc039e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0847785aaccb"><strong>1 - Setup:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b62939288bc0"><strong>Given </strong>that the member wishes =
to set up a recurring transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0251392e479c"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details and completes the online merchant checkout process for the r=
ecurring transaction to be set up,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5809a6a952b9"><strong>Then</strong> the recurring transactio=
n is created with the merchant and the card is saved on file for the recurr=
ing transactions to be processed on the pre-defined dates</p>
<hr local-id=3D"8089b9bb-8b44-4555-a278-19a4d00e8f31">
<p local-id=3D"141b1f49ff56"><strong>2 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0441275a7f61"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"785aa8fcb73f"><strong>When</strong> the member has set up a =
recurring transaction and the transaction date has arrived,</p>
<p local-id=3D"82fe1dd91938"><strong>Then: </strong>the recurring transacti=
on is completed and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds i=
n CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"07884e63-2b74-4bde-be41-1cd44b28ebeb">
<p local-id=3D"d83b861326dd"><strong>3 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"86ee0a0fce2c"><strong>Given</strong> that the recurring tran=
saction amount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"65da560e7c4a"><strong>When</strong> the member has set up a =
recurring transaction, the transaction date has arrived, and the transactio=
n attempts to be processed,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7ce1ae891b03"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"127ee756-2af7-434f-8e29-8b751420a8f3">
<p local-id=3D"8fe96b85e8f5"><strong>4 - Exceeds Account Balance</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"7407ed02b9d0"><strong>Given</strong> that the recurring tran=
saction amount exceeds the account balance,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b6838a62457f"><strong>When</strong> the member has set up a =
recurring transaction, the transaction date has arrived, and the transactio=
n attempts to be processed,</p>
<p local-id=3D"956ac62177bd"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"4f07cceb-82be-40d2-ba9c-4647e92d451b">
<p local-id=3D"3d8758ae436a"><strong>5 - Incorrect CVV </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b57d8d9adc22"><strong>Given</strong> the transaction amount =
does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient fu=
nds in their account and a CVV must be provided to complete the purchase,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"254689819dfa"><strong>When</strong> an incorrect CVV is ente=
red,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2946507596d8"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p>
<hr local-id=3D"ff7c74d9-d509-4a94-bb72-7969a7217af4">
<p local-id=3D"e66b696516f4"><strong>6 - Incorrect Card Expiry Date</strong=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"14b51d02fb53"><strong>Given</strong> the transaction amount =
does not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficient fu=
nds in their account and a card expiry date must be provided to complete th=
e purchase,</p>
<p local-id=3D"066ab8907ab2"><strong>When</strong> an incorrect card expiry=
 date is entered,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9a8f29c09df8"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0a8308bc-83c6-4bd6-a00f-edec6d904d7c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"abda16127ed3">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e7fe6e2d-845d-4a70-86fb-b4363a2d4e5c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0df55648b78"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-141?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-141</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"98ad4fbd-e5f9-4a0f-baca-491538963805">
<td data-local-id=3D"2a06991b-eb82-44a3-901d-65a7606270cb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9dd8a018a447">6.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d6c1bf29-79a0-41b1-965c-07e85263ea5a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ca885c23466"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5863317af87d"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card for set=
 up and completion of phone transactions in foreign currencies</p>
<p local-id=3D"1217cafd86b9"><strong>So that</strong> I can successfully co=
mplete foreign currency phone transaction purchases</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"657483e5-89af-429a-864b-cf7ddc7f5478" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db28755f6703">The card shall allow the member to complete al=
l CNP phone transactions in foreign currencies via the Visa network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3ec696e794db">The appropriate amount in CAD shall be debited=
 from the account of the member, using the correct current exchange rate at=
 the time of making the transaction for conversion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4dee55df-4614-4b6f-9818-814a35cac142" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bdf912976a12"><strong>1 - Happy Path:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"33333a11847f"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount odes not exceed the purchase amount limit, and the member has sufficie=
nt funds in their account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0e63a7773ccf"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details via phone and the merchant processes the transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"16360a90a7c4"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds i=
n CAD, using the current exchange rate</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f89c364d-154d-46f4-b95d-f0b6bacc1161">
<p local-id=3D"4ad195d97f10"><strong>2 - Exceeds Purchase Limit:</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"1efdf691c7a6"><strong>Given</strong> that the transaction am=
ount exceeds the purchase amount limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"26f44799d6b0"><strong>When</strong> the member provides thei=
r card details via phone and the merchant processes the transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b5a93c33d46b"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction is decl=
ined</p>
<hr local-id=3D"2301b4ca-bb16-4c5d-9fd6-cb0804a5f58c">
<p local-id=3D"ef7b91c79ea7"><strong>3 - Exceeds Account Balance</strong></=
p>
