<p local-id=3D"1578a1612c5b"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is comp=
leting an eligible card on file transaction cancellation/return,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fad096300522"><strong>When</strong> the member completes the=
 merchant return process,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a2a0744377e"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes and the member=E2=80=99s account is credited for the funds =
in CAD, using the current exchange rate</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e254af15-62ab-41cc-9be7-6c161360b110" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e1f51e5ed182">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"28f0d596-7ab1-460f-a889-86c347986566" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a7acca11ec3"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"251edb07-cc8e-4eac-9f3b-2c0f2da8b056">
<td data-local-id=3D"b2d1f256-3701-4f75-8686-2c2b0fbfd1b0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35f60f3d5105">6.12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dc18fcfd-5016-428b-afdf-f65329cb7474" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3435cac195d3"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c7582b185ddc"><strong>I want to </strong>have the <span clas=
s=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"bee1ea44-0e15-4dc2-84aa-24d8ce59d5b=
d">DCC (Dynamic Currency Conversion) option, when applicable</span>, while =
making international purchases in foreign currency,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bb5009118662"><strong>So that </strong>I can choose whether =
I want to pay in my domestic currency or directly in foreign currency</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5df2099c-a3be-4cae-8bb3-8d3162ac0cb1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd4943ffc263">The card shall allow the member to have the op=
tion, at eligible merchants where DCC is available and applicable, to condu=
ct international purchases by being billed in domestic currency (CAD) or di=
rectly in foreign currency</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7bf7327-6abc-49fe-ae3d-c21397e3e872" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a6842acebda3"><strong>1 - Member Billed in CAD:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6d8e2cc4b988"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is cond=
ucting a transaction at an eligible merchant where DCC is available and app=
licable, and the member is asked whether to be billed in CAD or in the fore=
ign currency,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2c1607e8373d"><strong>When</strong> the member selects to be=
 billed in CAD,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b99e3ddfbacd"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes in CAD, with the merchant conducting the conversion, and th=
e member=E2=80=99s account is debited for the funds in CAD</p>
<p local-id=3D"2ec7d10c8af3"><strong>2 - Member Billed in Foreign Currency:=
</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"758b9be2670e"><strong>Given</strong> that the member is cond=
ucting a transaction at an eligible merchant where DCC is available and app=
licable, and the member is asked whether to be billed in CAD or in the fore=
ign currency,</p>
<p local-id=3D"cf772c479282"><strong>When</strong> the member selects to be=
 billed in the foreign currency,</p>
<p local-id=3D"84b53249a1e8"><strong>Then: </strong>the transaction success=
fully completes in the foreign currency, and the member=E2=80=99s account i=
s debited for the funds in CAD, using the current exchange rate (with the i=
ssuer (Beem) conducting the conversion)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"556f84cd-7d1e-48b1-a8e2-2dfd4472e6f8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f8334f84f75">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b43732e7-b574-4409-b392-4f85738de9fd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e01746d42ff1"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-142?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-142</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9ff72ed05fa4">
<td data-local-id=3D"70c96b167b08" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"594e8dfaff9a">6.13</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f819197b33ec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"64eb653aa72f"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ccb7492a0f16"><strong>I want</strong> to receive SMS text al=
erts of my purchases,</p>
<p local-id=3D"56b1a494c979"><strong>So that</strong> I can be informed whe=
n specific transactions are authorized and debited from my account which ca=
n help identify fraudulent transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e0425c88b753" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"387122c663b8">Authorized foreign currency CNP online purchas=
es, phone/mail orders, DCC transaction made via the Visa network should tri=
gger an SMS text alert upon debiting the account with the exception of recu=
rring payments, merchant returns/refunds and declined transactions which sh=
ould not trigger any alert.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4bae0ee58eac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b650889bed2e"><em>To be completed with details</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"5c0d81a7de02"><strong>1 - Happy Path (Foreign CNP Purchase)<=
/strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"911e74117f75"><strong>2 - Happy Path (Foreign Phone/Mail Ord=
er)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d9cc913aa4bf"><strong>3 - Happy Path (DCC)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"8cd9b868bece"><strong>4 - Recurring Payments </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a08189de9375"><strong>5 - Merchant Returns/Refunds</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"f3a34220a1ab"><strong>6 - Declined Transactions</strong></p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ee3cf2967283" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dfc727dd2fbf"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"66e909dfcd82" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb28fafcb32a"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e9e9ebbfceb8">
<td data-local-id=3D"8e68bbeb8d6c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a57de28493f2">6.14</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d5ef159ed0cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f05eea264f0e"><strong>As a</strong> member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ea4a5ec2e5a0"><strong>I want</strong> to cancel (opt out) SM=
S text alerts of my purchases,</p>
<p local-id=3D"77d1102862a1"><strong>So that</strong> I am no longer alerte=
d when specific transactions are authorized and debited from my account.</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7fe5089f545" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fafde9734d06">Authorized foreign CNP online purchases, phone=
/mail orders and DCC transactions made via the Visa network should no longe=
r trigger SMS alerts after cancellation or opt out by cardholder.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0ca7e413c2dd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef60be2721b3"><em>To be completed with details</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"443eeab648cc"><strong>1 - Happy Path (Foreign CNP Purchase)<=
/strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"07b55d834a9f"><strong>Given </strong>the member has opted ou=
t of receiving text alerts,</p>
<p local-id=3D"eacbb1980a25"><strong>When</strong> the member completes a C=
NP purchase and funds are authorized and debited from the account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bdcefb08b3ff"><strong>Then</strong> an SMS text message is n=
ot triggered.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3355363cb9df">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"47b712acf193"><strong>2 - Happy Path (Phone/Mail Order)</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b87b7b1485fe"><strong>3 - Happy Path (DCC)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d625f9c8f44a">&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f179c1b3dee2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1d105e275ea7"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c7277b846f0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f20215cf3160"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"4b3189b35dfb" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-7.DigitalWallets">7. Digital Wallets</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b88c435e6cc1"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"0abcbd9aeac6"><strong>WHEN I</strong> have an active Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"924638204b07"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> add my Visa Debit c=
ard to my digital wallet (Apple Pay, Google Pay, other), set my card as the=
 default card on the digital wallet, make transactions on my card using the=
 digital wallet, and remove my card from the digital wallet if desired,</p>
<p local-id=3D"87921ce4a36d"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> easily and seam=
lessly manage and use my card in my digital wallet.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-2108033627" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-2108033627" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-2108033627" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"f2b=
4a10f-5498-447b-b7bc-8fb9b8ab6eee" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 293.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 117.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 220.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 236.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb3bd425-30a6-4065-8f77-1917ab6087a9">
<th data-local-id=3D"6b669d39-3be8-4452-b809-54b0de2fea4d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2db34f3633f5"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"cde4d810f6dd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8cf479e9c01b"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"36d5a231-25ab-43f8-9eb0-6b6f741e77a1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b2bf2a235000"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"370975fa-d3b8-4682-ac4d-5e59b1fec62f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"066e56da235e"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"344c9f4e-27b6-4808-831d-71e2918749a7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ec0b05bf7fac"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1ee12d2c-04ea-492d-98d6-f2dddfcaa5bd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ce1a35a4f9ad"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b8d6e3ea-2614-4092-8757-a99710c1ed9c">
<td data-local-id=3D"bbc7604f-524c-42d2-a790-66bbf3a4674d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7cd4b25d4014">7.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5407c568920" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29d1b699035c"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2cc8e7fc65df"><strong>I want to </strong>add my card to my d=
igital wallet(s) and view my card details in the wallet(s),</p>
<p local-id=3D"56d2c3d54d2c"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily conduct =
transactions with my card via my digital wallet(s)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ae7df715-c7cc-49b9-9f09-23fc7714f67a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"07ad107c55bf">The card shall be able to be added to one or m=
ore digital wallet(s), and the card details should be viewable in the digit=
al wallet(s) - including Apple Wallet, Google Wallet, and other applicable =
digital wallets</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"230f0991-0c75-46f7-bba6-63344f8b001e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf9cabbb9071"><strong>1 - Add Card to Wallet</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"78377eeec4f6"><strong>Given </strong>that I am am a member w=
ho wishes to add my card to my digital wallet,</p>
<p local-id=3D"cd90ac7a848b"><strong>When </strong>I access my digital wall=
et and follow the steps to add a new card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"137acf215dc4"><strong>Then</strong> I am able to find and ad=
d my card directly from within the wallet</p>
<hr local-id=3D"3f1786192e83">
<p local-id=3D"89a36882284e"><strong>2 - View Card Details in Wallet</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"0d921e023d4f"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
has added my card to my digital wallet,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8859fa775f5b"><strong>When </strong>I access my digital wall=
et and view the card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a8e92d33f96d"><strong>Then</strong> I am able to see a digit=
al image of my card which replicates the physical card appearance, and see =
the partially-masked card number</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"814ea243-92ce-4fa9-9908-febe2264b487" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"65e87cc2b80e">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0967d1c3-64a0-4f31-b68d-27544d88af71" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"beae9271ac7c"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-143?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-143</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8bfcfe4c-ac63-4988-92e3-71483f8bca2f">
<td data-local-id=3D"32a8289e-ce10-410b-b234-64ec7d795fc3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"25d6ca84391d">7.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8cd02d45bc6b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cdac69c37660"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"961546ebfcb7"><strong>I want to </strong>set my card as the =
default card on my digital wallet(s),</p>
<p local-id=3D"22f105076038"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily conduct =
transactions with my card via my digital wallet(s)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"56f1ff8b-c8b9-4b09-8ae6-d95e626422eb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba4e68fef0b2">The card shall be able to be set as the defaul=
t/preferred card on the member=E2=80=99s digital wallet(s) - including Appl=
e Wallet, Google Wallet, and other applicable digital wallets</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"808c31e9-33ec-4c81-9cc3-d0c16017de19" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37afe21d298c"><strong>1 - Set Card as Default in Wallet</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"2d7053870542"><strong>Given </strong>that I am am a member w=
ho has added my card to my digital wallet,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3a502bbc0d16"><strong>When </strong>I access the wallet and =
follow the steps to set my card as the default card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e7abc5ba6df8"><strong>Then</strong> my card is set as the de=
fault card in my wallet</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ada9dc3f-20c7-4a95-a67f-52499b772be7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5f8961638efc">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6403395f-e53f-47e3-8630-019b08f01ac2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b640345d9ec9"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-144?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-144</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"293d8696-0923-493d-9d06-584a342745a2">
<td data-local-id=3D"391faecd-183b-4770-a92e-feab6f4a82ec" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d15abc929056">7.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4f734e22dc5a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e793aa18331"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"837c08bc3e2d"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card to make=
 purchases via my digital wallet(s),</p>
<p local-id=3D"87d3dab23b54"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily conduct =
transactions with my card via my digital wallet(s)rather than using the phy=
sical card</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b5e0d187-3328-475a-a674-0c4dbd1c5632" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7eee3f7d6abe">The card shall be able to be used to conduct t=
ransactions via the member=E2=80=99s digital wallet(s) - including Apple Wa=
llet, Google Wallet, and other applicable digital wallets</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0348c27a-3cc7-40ba-9ce5-71b1ccdef273" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7855ded67c72"><strong>1 - Conduct Card Transactions via Wall=
et</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4077e4dadbbe"><strong>Given </strong>that I am am a member w=
ho has added my card to my digital wallet,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d816901f639d"><strong>When </strong>I access the wallet and =
follow the steps to conduct a transaction using my card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"546a4cc4d928"><strong>Then</strong> I am able to successfull=
y make purchases using my card via the digital wallet, and the wallet authe=
ntication process follows all established security protocols to secure the =
transaction</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"800f9e1f-7073-46ad-ac83-a67e974594e8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8597939aaf17">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d3bb2f2d-e530-4325-9983-0017ce623223" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"13bf6ebe1cf7"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"57117f7e-ac23-4257-a9a8-4b899cb6a8ae">
<td data-local-id=3D"c7634bbd-e153-4356-89d7-3ec11c9f0d38" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e925d4d9900d">7.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5f5c28716e18" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df4839b6d782"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"85dbb08d492a"><strong>I want to </strong>remove my card from=
 my digital wallet(s),</p>
<p local-id=3D"43ac206a3631"><strong>So that </strong>my card will no longe=
r be in my digital wallet(s)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f1e3fbf7-949e-4964-abd9-b7a346a8b086" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ddf7cf314fa">The card shall be able to be removed from the =
digital wallet(s) it has previously been added to, and once removed, the ca=
rd shall no longer be visible, accessible, or usable to conduct transaction=
s via the digital wallet(s) - including Apple Wallet, Google Wallet, and ot=
her applicable digital wallets</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"43aeab96-b6b1-4b42-a7e8-000d20d17303" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"72547cb0ecb2"><strong>1 - Remove Card from Wallet</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"f349554a21d5"><strong>Given </strong>that I am am a member w=
ho wishes to remove my previously-added card from my digital wallet,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e01f2e4b553a"><strong>When </strong>I access my digital wall=
et and follow the steps to remove the card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2707a9da1b74"><strong>Then</strong> the card is removed from=
 my wallet and is no longer visible, accessible, or usable to conduct trans=
actions</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"38f333a8-87b4-46f5-a3b6-05a72438c310" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ede11d195d9">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"54d72902-354e-4a5e-8c88-9230591554dc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a68646ecbcad"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"48c2aecd01f8" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-8.MoneyMovementPortals">8. Money Movement Portals</h3>
<p local-id=3D"6b0633ce0adf"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"391ca510fd99"><strong>WHEN I</strong> have an active Visa De=
bit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"72989b13703a"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> use my Visa Debit c=
ard to conduct transactions on various money movement portals and make inte=
rnational payments using third party apps,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c8fe0f272f3e"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> easily and seam=
lessly conduct all desired transactions, with funds in my Beem account, usi=
ng my card.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-446882470" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-446882470" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-446882470" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"a9b=
0505d-0dfc-45a2-b660-69963f4b21a3" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 290.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 120.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 220.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 236.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4fd629f7-1d53-4444-ba64-535973bede18">
<th data-local-id=3D"b3f3d14b-dcae-45c8-b1b4-cca2e9fd3a93" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5b874f2e1478"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"adf18a052802" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"369c23c333bf"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"98090e19-06c7-4dff-a64e-03cc3f68335a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8caa1aadd574"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"ebb8e2d4-fbfb-47a7-a2f0-080b24f9c8bb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c21919ed9fe4"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"23ca4c84-c4ba-40d0-95dd-60da6933de39" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5235091aee7e"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b7288bec-0dd0-4bcc-8f45-73e3c2f21532" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4c077ccd3760"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"85974f40-9b8d-4176-a0df-386129973eb2">
<td data-local-id=3D"9e6e3487-a9bc-4ac0-8632-7bdfcb3e9275" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e8dff0410aea">8.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"08f3be2e43d4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3e1f76850f5"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4cbbcaa2825e"><strong>I want to </strong>use my card to cond=
uct domestic and international transactions on 3rd party money movement por=
tals,</p>
<p local-id=3D"97deec358743"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily send and=
 receive funds via 3rd party apps</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b59cb7e6-a88a-4826-a872-ad8e648cd2d8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef3abcc86d50">The platform shall allow the member to add, vi=
ew, and use their card to conduct domestic and international transactions o=
n 3rd party money movement portals<strong> </strong>(eg: Wise, Paypal, Venm=
o, Wealthsimple)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1e647a88-1f87-4271-b17a-d6b3ac219cbc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b0585fe245a"><em>To be further built out</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"1f39c0223a25"><strong>1 - E2E High Level:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f3f15ef97bdd"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
wishes to use my Beem account funds to conduct domestic and/or internationa=
l transactions on 3rd party money movement portals,</p>
<p local-id=3D"88de63ef5dae"><strong>When </strong>I access my 3rd party mo=
ney movement app,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8ef5026df606"><strong>Then </strong>I can add, view, and use=
 my card to conduct transactions (both send and receive) in the 3rd party a=
pp - including P2P transfers, P2B payments, B2P transfers, B2B payments - u=
sing my card to add funds to my 3rd party app from my Beem account and/or t=
o withdraw funds from my 3rd party app back to my Beem account</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f24792c7-70d0-4d3e-9184-bac0567ff259" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3285455f1740">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c23a681a-6512-4eff-9ee8-cdd8a2a8d18a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27612eecbf5d"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-145?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-145</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"f74587b91939" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-9.CardManagement(BeemDB)"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" dat=
a-ref=3D"fd407fcb-6c48-4dc7-977a-5d63d2183ceb">9. Card Management (BeemDB)<=
/span></h3>
<p local-id=3D"5d2ebd1928ed"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"ff3921a93737"><strong>WHEN I </strong>have a Visa Debit card=
,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9c6107ab08bc"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> see and manage my V=
isa Debit card in my BeemDB online and mobile banking,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ec00d6325083"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> view my card in=
formation/details, lock/unlock my card, change my card=E2=80=99s usage sett=
ings, and have the ability to report my card as lost or stolen.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-960606323" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-960606323" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-960606323" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"3cc=
91b69-b727-46de-afa0-4ef3b5793186" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 270.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 109.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 231.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 256.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c78e06b1-acc5-45d9-8769-1f33f63b9844">
<th data-local-id=3D"6c08b7d5-acab-4109-8ef1-c2786bf0b7bd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8150dc6dd1c9"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ff49811d863f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ffc4bc4f2d40"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d6973e70-2774-4aa9-8f2a-823be449143c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"30a791417fb3"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"c956548c-0ac3-4d54-ac62-bb0749b46bec" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"94cdb726b0a6"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6b373888-f673-4ad1-8aea-afe31a71695e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e3b414568e2c"><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" =
data-ref=3D"c7b391f5-10e1-450e-bb6b-c0d3d4818a4c">Priority</span></strong><=
/p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6d0c0789-a79f-463b-8102-a07b7cc58be8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"07367d23112c"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4924b8b2-01d6-44bc-bd2f-206d4c1e1461">
<td data-local-id=3D"15d1b611-9719-439d-aa25-5b430283bdaa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2eae866148b8">9.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"530ec251a516" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"838eb24d2852"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3e397bfbf84b"><strong>I want to </strong>see my card details=
 and status in my digital banking,</p>
<p local-id=3D"79f7bdcf7de1"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily retrieve=
 and view my card information</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aa4c7080-c235-4b84-82b7-d40fba791724" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2482212b118e">The Beem digital banking platform, both online=
 + mobile app, shall allow the member to view a digital image of their card=
 and partially-masked card number, along with their card=E2=80=99s current =
status</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bd744146-ab75-44a6-bffa-abadc13fd522" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a7fadb37cf68"><strong>1 - Card Details</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ca9d232bd7fe"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in act=
ive, locked, or expired status,</p>
<p local-id=3D"07c72d6b984c"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7f74956a006a"><strong>Then </strong>the member sees a digita=
l image of their card including partially-masked card number</p>
<hr local-id=3D"707a75164f67">
<p local-id=3D"980803cfb984"><strong>2 - Card Status Active</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"8c0dbacda7c6"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in iss=
ued or active status in the banking system,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bcce428aede0"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"31ee9d8f1b1f"><strong>Then </strong>the member sees the stat=
us of their card in the upper-right of the screen as Active</p>
<hr local-id=3D"43df7e57102c">
<p local-id=3D"b6d430094f16"><strong>3 - Card Status Locked</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"cee980d33dfc"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in loc=
ked status in the banking system,</p>
<p local-id=3D"deff5ce3f8bd"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8bd880e5aadc"><strong>Then </strong>the member sees the stat=
us of their card in the upper-right of the screen as Locked</p>
<hr local-id=3D"07a8984a6ebc">
<p local-id=3D"b4c1120d84ea"><strong>4 - Card Status Expired</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a087f5265143"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in exp=
ired status in the banking system,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d88c633434da"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"567fa22ba1c4"><strong>Then </strong>the member sees the stat=
us of their card in the upper-right of the screen as Expired</p>
<hr local-id=3D"2336b97ce607">
<p local-id=3D"e8b207b78278"><strong>5 - Card Status Cancelled/Closed</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"6571aa9c436e"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in can=
celled/closed status in the banking system,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6391d07acf8d"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f11917fee760"><strong>Then </strong>the member does not see =
their card, neither card details nor card status in BeemDB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d932896-c93d-4e28-8164-6c22c0216f47" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22a90b90730c">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"97ca9771-810d-4cd2-abbe-6276add53cb7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a5543536370f"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-179?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-179</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"557f0e60d3a2"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-170?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-170</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6ca30c5b-7fc2-4cbe-9246-77e3d5124e69">
<td data-local-id=3D"476a4195-4c05-47cc-afec-09e35c6dbdc6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fcd1a42e1f9e">9.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"854192e31b93" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d796e7972850"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"dd80a7771ae5"><strong>I want to </strong>have the ability to=
 lock and unlock my card in my digital banking,</p>
<p local-id=3D"485f4c2f2119"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily lock and=
 unlock my card when desired</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e6470cc-a5b9-483a-964c-73279c5fa6d1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"38e47619b2f6">The Beem digital banking platform, both online=
 + mobile app, shall allow the member to lock and unlock their card, and wh=
en the card is locked no transactions may be performed using the card.</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7a516f76-f19d-46e4-a771-fa2360e8525f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cdcba8da2946"><strong>1 - Lock Card</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"063826e216e8"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status with the =E2=80=98Lock this card=E2=80=99 toggle turned Off,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0b61e2144343"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB, switches the =E2=80=98Lock this card=
=E2=80=99 toggle to On, and confirms the change,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4ac434998d06"><strong>Then </strong>the card is locked, the =
card status changes to Locked, and no transactions may be performed using t=
he card</p>
<hr local-id=3D"3d6cbdf55778">
<p local-id=3D"c8b97fd6fcda"><strong>2 - Unlock Card</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"eb53357c3ad2"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is Locked=
 status with the =E2=80=98Lock this card=E2=80=99 toggle turned On,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bb55e843d77f"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB, switches the =E2=80=98Lock this card=
=E2=80=99 toggle to Off, and confirms the change,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a9efcbf3551e"><strong>Then </strong>the card is unlocked, th=
e card status changes to Active, and transactions may be performed using th=
e card</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ed296827-3b6a-483e-ab1c-012d51ec4dff" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f08f655c15ce">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4dab0d5f-27fc-4f69-b287-3171a0906595" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9f3ed830dc6e"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-180?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-180</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"513b5a18-dcff-48b2-abe2-d3bf6facb914">
<td data-local-id=3D"5666032c-86df-4834-88dd-27b740ed26bf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ac36901b314">9.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"03647e60d810" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3d997d05480f"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0e777fe7d901"><strong>I want to </strong>have the ability to=
 modify my card transaction settings in my digital banking,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0cfbc8fb50f3"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily adjust m=
y transaction settings to allow or block ATM transactions, purchases/refund=
s, and/or international transactions</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"384a802b-ff19-4c56-b874-6a91632de4d0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6b31c45b971">The Beem digital banking platform, both online=
 + mobile app, shall allow the member to adjust their card transaction sett=
ings, to allow or block the following transaction categories: (1) ATM trans=
actions, (2) purchases and refunds, (3) international transactions. When a =
category is blocked, no transactions of that type may be performed using th=
e card.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"86ac4287-81e6-43c7-a85b-09624e5a4d9a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a30004ad2403"><strong>1 - Block ATM Transactions</strong></p=
>
<p local-id=3D"6f62b8af6e5b"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status and the =E2=80=98Block ATM transactions=E2=80=99 toggle is turne=
d Off,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6de1d626deea"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB and switches the =E2=80=98Block ATM tra=
nsactions=E2=80=99 toggle to On,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2522a6f00a29"><strong>Then </strong>no ATM transactions may =
be performed using the card</p>
<hr local-id=3D"ff3bbd46ee1e">
<p local-id=3D"c01ff82bf19b"><strong>2 - Unblock ATM Transactions</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"d8be83c79f68"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status and the =E2=80=98Block ATM transactions=E2=80=99 toggle is turne=
d On,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e42a4d828916"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB and switches the =E2=80=98Block ATM tra=
nsactions=E2=80=99 toggle to Off,</p>
<p local-id=3D"11bcd34e5fea"><strong>Then </strong>ATM transactions may be =
performed using the card</p>
<hr local-id=3D"37657311ff99">
<p local-id=3D"2051fcd0bd5e"><strong>3 - Block Purchases and Refunds</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"dc26840cf614"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status and the =E2=80=98Block purchases and refunds' toggle is turned O=
ff,</p>
<p local-id=3D"67f94ee0ee67"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB and switches the =E2=80=98Block purchas=
es and refunds=E2=80=99 toggle to On,</p>
<p local-id=3D"15760025c373"><strong>Then </strong>no POS purchase or refun=
d transactions may be performed using the card</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0f1b4804-ad26-4c43-b419-fb3cb5b49050">
<p local-id=3D"b3f42711c87b"><strong>4 - Unblock Purchases and Refunds</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"c1256457d212"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status and the =E2=80=98Block purchases and refunds' toggle is turned O=
n,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f55c464ad0aa"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB and switches the =E2=80=98Block purchas=
es and refunds=E2=80=99 toggle to Off,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2e79f8225ff8"><strong>Then </strong>POS purchase and refund =
transactions may be performed using the card</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c18b3316be29">
<p local-id=3D"b194c3f72e93"><strong>5 - Block International Transactions</=
strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"46075f6f8fc7"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status and the =E2=80=98Block international transactions' toggle is tur=
ned Off,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8dfa90057061"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB and switches the =E2=80=98Block interna=
tional transactions=E2=80=99 toggle to On,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ac4e131be7c3"><strong>Then </strong>no international ATM, in=
ternational POS, or foreign currency CNP transactions may be performed usin=
g the card</p>
<hr local-id=3D"ba3ea914f2d9">
<p local-id=3D"750128167634"><strong>6 - Unblock International Transactions=
</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"3890fc3c4770"><strong>Given </strong>that the card is in Act=
ive status and the =E2=80=98Block international transactions' toggle is tur=
ned On,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b8a11fae2844"><strong>When </strong>the member accesses the =
Manage Member Card screen in BeemDB and switches the =E2=80=98Block interna=
tional transactions=E2=80=99 toggle to Off,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6d79e0a6e89e"><strong>Then</strong> international ATM, inter=
national POS, and foreign currency CNP transactions may be performed using =
the card</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eb275e68-bf35-46c7-bdad-4141846f9ab0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b00716eded6b">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5d9833d5-7d38-45ae-960d-ef057b6a9adf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"598d9b54d4d6"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-180?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-180</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8b6aa2f1-7bd9-484e-be19-9f59cd6ddde9">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae8d7823-fa40-45ee-af8d-f6bf6cb2fc40" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"938681d270c3">9.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9a1d46c12d37" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"02f5117bc4ab"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder who is=
 a first-time Beem Digital Banking user,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c1101b70391a"><strong>I want to </strong>be able to use my c=
ard number as my initial login ID/username when logging into BeemDB for the=
 first time,</p>
<p local-id=3D"983e5a3ff517"><strong>So that </strong>I can successfully ac=
cess BeemDB and set up my new login credentials</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd7e103a-ecb4-4d61-84e5-4d47bb774de9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c88d89d15e6">The card shall allow the member to log into Be=
em DB for the first time, using the card card number as the member=E2=80=99=
s initial login ID/username prior to setting up their own new login credent=
ials</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"71154b47-f005-46b6-851c-1daca9f9d506" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"756103e80784"><strong>1 - Happy Path - First Time Login:</st=
rong></p>
<p local-id=3D"40347a0da8c5"><strong>Given </strong>that the member has not=
 logged into BeemDB before and is logging in as a new digital banking user,=
 and all other applicable information that is required for BeemDB access is=
 correctly established,</p>
<p local-id=3D"55a42dc96a6e"><strong>When </strong>the member enters the ca=
rd number as the ID/username for their initial login, along with the new pa=
ssword that has been provided to them by Beem staff,</p>
<p local-id=3D"a461873c9606"><strong>Then</strong> the first-time login wil=
l be successful and the member will be prompted to set up new login credent=
ials to use moving forward</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c564947b96c4">
<p local-id=3D"3cd79bb3bc74"><strong>2 - Card Not Active</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"64b6a78d2942"><strong>Given </strong>that the member has not=
 logged into BeemDB before and is logging in as a new digital banking user,=
 and all other applicable information that is required for BeemDB access is=
 correctly established, but the card is not in Issued or Active status,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ce01c1ec645f"><strong>When </strong>the member enters the ca=
rd number as the ID/username for their initial login, along with the new pa=
ssword that has been provided to them by Beem staff,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9be509c0051f"><strong>Then</strong> the first-time login wil=
l not be successful</p>
<hr local-id=3D"69d6bf3f15ce">
<p local-id=3D"8b1bed6c2646"><strong>3 - Card Number Incorrect</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b1d91865994d"><strong>Given </strong>that the member has not=
 logged into BeemDB before and is logging in as a new digital banking user,=
 and all other applicable information that is required for BeemDB access is=
 correctly established,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2d2100b9ea88"><strong>When </strong>the member enters the in=
correct card number as the ID/username for their initial login, along with =
the new password that has been provided to them by Beem staff,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8fd51daaab75"><strong>Then</strong> the first-time login wil=
l not be successful</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fb524e1a-3c91-463e-bdcc-9d4fd8c15d21" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"68879ed1e354">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c294c007-cc70-4eb2-80c2-5c5a8b4ca536" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3d67dc1b518a"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-176?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-176</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1400bd79508e">
<td data-local-id=3D"8dd4e4e8-a1cf-42ef-8695-d1f79dd3b21f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2756ec2323a">9.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4f475f91-37f1-477a-9b64-d501a00d88d2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc120923e5fc"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f236f773b58b"><strong>I want to </strong>have the ability to=
 change my card PIN in my digital banking,</p>
<p local-id=3D"53e23447349d"><strong>So that </strong>I can easily change m=
y PIN when desired</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"014b4db8-836a-40f3-8e06-4e5b3c50fe0f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"005982855af6">The Beem digital banking platform, both online=
 + mobile app, shall allow the member to change the PIN on their card</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"59765689-5f82-42e0-bf1d-ebdd6c0fe618" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"240dd86e3310"><em><strong>Descoped</strong> currently - for =
future consideration/development if and when capabilities exist in BeemDB:<=
/em></p>
<p local-id=3D"7a0e91d29092"><em><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data=
-ref=3D"af32365d-01a2-4d86-a195-be4da4bbda57">Member should be able to chan=
ge their debit card PIN in BeemDB</span></em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c089bb76-4da2-4579-9d33-cec979f13b22" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f150ba7570f">P3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"54de30be-855a-4b53-8968-9025f14cee0d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d4f03aa5bdb2"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-181?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-181</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"fec89bfb67ae" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-10.Statements&amp;History">10. Statements &amp; History</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3cd2459b1ca5"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"5b0243e066f1"><strong>WHEN I </strong>have performed transac=
tions on my Beem account using my Visa Debit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"87837a788472"><strong>I WANT TO</strong> see all settled tra=
nsactions recorded on my monthly paper statement and all settled and pendin=
g transactions to show in BeemDB online and mobile banking and that all for=
eign transactions clearly show the foreign currency conversion rate,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9a3968697105"><strong>SO THAT I CAN </strong>easily review m=
y card transactions and know my available account balance to accurately man=
age my finances.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1299085637" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1299085637" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1299085637" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"7a9=
40cd4-6c00-4fc6-a8b7-4b8592849f03" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 179.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 227.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 231.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 229.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b10876b4-a00a-46fb-b4b3-9ce12a3f18a4">
<th data-local-id=3D"48a3521956bd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"85e144647d4d"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"7bc20acf-7dd1-4264-8802-d29cc217d909" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8b73cc05e367"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c89eb89b-c147-4cba-9e42-6e0573bc177f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fdbfc3d1d58b"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"afcd87a9-30cb-4fae-bfc5-3756c5b4579a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"caa92c01f32b"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f93c485e-e30e-4210-8d3b-37d9282ec89e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a47ffc1c221b"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"50fa09e3dbb4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"381a48235d8f"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ac0b9e7f-2a0a-436b-b43b-bc08202b5859">
<td data-local-id=3D"f73f6370-5bf8-43e7-ac60-4ab10189a15c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96aff1c3d4fa">10.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e865c94f52c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"594c2a66b570"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a6eca58181c"><strong>I want to </strong>see a record of all=
 transactions conducted on my card in my paper statement</p>
<p local-id=3D"fa92e1f0546e"><strong>So that </strong>I have full visibilit=
y of my transactions and can easily review and manage my account and funds<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6af3ab2e-9cb0-4fbe-90f9-63aaa65ea14f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"17cdfb426e6e">The Beem-issued monthly paper statement shall =
include a record of all transactions conducted on my card, including ATM, P=
OS, CNP, and foreign transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ca8e4ad0-605b-46bc-9d9a-a13d591a12bc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"59a56705cf55"><strong>1 - Domestic Currency (CAD) Transactio=
ns</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a73a858675b4"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
has conducted one or more CAD transactions using my card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"571a855083d9"><strong>When </strong>I receive my monthly pap=
er statement,</p>
<p local-id=3D"811a6cbf47ff"><strong>Then </strong>I can clearly see a reco=
rd of all transaction(s) performed on my card, including the date the trans=
action was performed, the amount of the transaction, and the merchant and l=
ocation where the transaction was performed</p>
<hr local-id=3D"d30e00c86b07">
<p local-id=3D"ec1d17ca3c65"><strong>2 - Foreign Currency (FX) Transactions=
</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0509e88caa65"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
has conducted one or more FX transactions using my card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"58a18801f814"><strong>When </strong>I receive my monthly pap=
er statement,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5af35fd6b92e"><strong>Then </strong>I can clearly see a reco=
rd of all transaction(s) performed on my card, including the date the trans=
action was performed, the amount of the transaction in the foreign currency=
, the amount of the transaction in CAD, the exchange rate used, and the mer=
chant and location where the transaction was performed</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"59c481a0-226d-47d6-a8e0-2af7e8315844" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3853b4c73449">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01da2959-b9ec-4b91-8106-b85948e4553a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"45843c86e9a3"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-154?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-154</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p>
<p local-id=3D"7e9d11040903"><span class=3D"aui-message aui-message-warning=
 jim-error-message jim-error-message-single"> <span class=3D"icon-in-pdf"><=
/span> <a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/VDC-157?src=3Dconfmacro=
">VDC-157</a> - Data cannot be retrieved due to an unexpected error. </span=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f0aa116e-2a6b-4d01-87f5-d04bd4f082b9">
<td data-local-id=3D"3701a42ef706" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"762ccc136308">10.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8f1581e1-572d-4459-9fe2-7f5588487d43" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"216074961a5b"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7d9ee862fe15"><strong>I want to </strong>see a record of all=
 transactions conducted on my card in my digital banking,</p>
<p local-id=3D"55f7a6c0e039"><strong>So that </strong>I have full visibilit=
y of my transactions and can easily review and manage my account and funds<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d18c1aec-9d65-4e18-8ee8-5f589305125b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fc867e4c249">BeemDB, both online banking and the mobile app=
, shall include a record of all transactions (settled and pending) conducte=
d on my card, including ATM, POS, CNP, and foreign transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b3c8886b4cc7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b6df2ac3ca1"><strong>1 - Domestic Currency (CAD) Transactio=
ns </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"dbe84f5823a9"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
has conducted one or more CAD transactions using my card that have settled,=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"70c33cc2d79b"><strong>When </strong>I access my transactions=
 on BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d3fd4991809b"><strong>Then </strong>I can clearly see a reco=
rd of all settled transaction(s) performed on my card, including the date t=
he transaction was performed, the amount of the transaction, and the mercha=
nt and location where the transaction was performed and the corresponding b=
alance as a result of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"26c14660-1b4b-456a-ac46-8659cd56200a">
<p local-id=3D"16699bb6cc61"><strong>2 - Domestic Currency (CAD) Transactio=
ns - CNP pending</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"db2970fb48d4"><strong>Given:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3ed06373-6f2e-41a9-b720-e90a790026a5">
<li local-id=3D"bbf17eb8-fe3f-4052-9077-3c213050cee1">
<p local-id=3D"857a349900ca">I made one or more CAD CNP transactions via th=
e Visa Network .</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9a50aaa1-f0fc-425e-b45f-fa531491266a">
<p local-id=3D"8218241a41f3">The transaction is pending (authorized but not=
 yet settled)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d346e3c0113d"><strong>When:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5e1c337d-0d88-4563-bb4e-c641d3c8e9a3">
<li local-id=3D"953f4915-bf10-4e2e-9cd6-de0acd54842b">
<p local-id=3D"53095ded0383">I view my transaction history in BeemDB/Mobile=
 Banking.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e2910aa9d805"><strong>Then:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"31b9bdbd-82db-4445-996f-75fb6c1f4a0d">
<li local-id=3D"09a7cf4e-3027-4c8e-bf61-d789cd0830d7">
<p local-id=3D"bd1b99fdafbb">I see the transaction(s) is clearly marked as =
pending.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"860e8a0d-37d8-45c0-9a88-c5040dcc207a">
<p local-id=3D"f819b6b21037">The record shows the date, estimated amount an=
d merchant.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a315671-df66-4ced-926e-9fb844de31a0">
<p local-id=3D"a2cb34689654">The transaction amount has not been deducted f=
rom my current balance.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3491e5a4-2231-478a-8bf3-115a5a9e27cb">
<p local-id=3D"dc9c266cd929">The transaction amount has been deducted from =
my available balance.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"3c3dd01c-08fe-4cc2-919c-ecb17bf0a3a2">
<p local-id=3D"92253841de6b"><strong>3 - Domestic Currency (CAD) Transactio=
ns - Preauthorized pending</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"37ba569e9a78"><strong>Given:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b976eb74-dc13-4585-a517-f339a2315989">
<li local-id=3D"e3812389-7406-4b9a-8956-62c00c7b057b">
<p local-id=3D"b5c9f4759193">I made one or more CAD Preauthorized transacti=
ons via the Visa Network .</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1d22b6e7-2695-4f77-abdf-61247cfd4c47">
<p local-id=3D"8fbc64b8cf65">The transaction is pending (authorized but not=
 yet settled)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fa277fd5d4d9"><strong>When:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"17720904-b0c4-4bc6-8cd4-1e2dda978c5a">
<li local-id=3D"1e905ea8-86a0-447c-b043-ca67ca9846f9">
<p local-id=3D"86acac866054">I view my transaction history in BeemDB/Mobile=
 Banking.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ccc194f94251"><strong>Then:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"97cd698a-f323-4983-bbe9-7d7cc258a558">
<li local-id=3D"385fcba3-b27e-48f5-bcc9-8a587eb47562">
<p local-id=3D"ae1ab29666e8">I see the transaction(s) is clearly marked as =
pending.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f40df02-d108-49a4-af0a-4b93f9593fee">
<p local-id=3D"45d7f9b61221">The record shows the date, estimated amount an=
d merchant.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0df99d07-e84b-46c1-b59a-b0b474024155">
<p local-id=3D"176409764492">The transaction amount has not been deducted f=
rom my current balance.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f3ca855b-74fe-421c-b164-b80e4686a7ed">
<p local-id=3D"0b31691805cf">The transaction amount has been deducted from =
my available balance.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"a713854b-ffcd-48f9-af80-595c8f578ea6">
<p local-id=3D"89bdf2fc55ba"><strong>4 - Foreign Currency (FX) Transactions=
</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"33d69d100d76"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
has conducted one or more FX transactions using my card that have settled,<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"7b37991928c7"><strong>When </strong>I access my transactions=
 on BeemDB,</p>
<p local-id=3D"1f7f69cac687"><strong>Then </strong>I can clearly see a reco=
rd of all transaction(s) performed on my card, including the date the trans=
action was performed, the amount of the transaction in the foreign currency=
, the amount of the transaction in CAD, the exchange rate used, and the mer=
chant/ATM and location where the transaction was performed</p>
