<h3 local-id=3D"2d0ab92f80f7" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-11.MemberFeedback">11. Member Feedback</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5ab156e9ad2d"><u>JTBD:</u></p>
<p local-id=3D"01885006cf57"><strong>WHEN I</strong> am a Visa Debit cardho=
lder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"93cb20bdb2f2"><strong>I WANT TO </strong>provide my feedback=
 to Beem on how satisfied I am with my Visa Debit card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"86668e86b59c"><strong>SO THAT I CAN</strong> give Beem helpf=
ul information on how my experiences can be improved, and so that I can see=
 Beem=E2=80=99s commitment to member centricity.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1520544936" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1520544936" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1520544936" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"be9=
1b84a-d352-44e2-9107-1580833f8a05" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 123.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 260.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 242.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 241.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 83.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"82d0f667-02c6-4d53-a782-9f0d0d4ae994">
<th data-local-id=3D"aa2b5ef9-e016-476c-88bc-32ba4e59ea8b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3bed0464713b"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3a1120f4487b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7337ff0844ac"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"21857a85-f1ca-4b05-a8a6-d6e892917515" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a5e6666ebb81"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"6dfa9b47-e3f1-46a9-82af-16ffdcab5814" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e6c5144bee7f"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a0da05ab-868d-4f80-9314-89dacb20f97f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"053cf91722d9"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"584472bb-0476-4b90-8d3c-d5bc347637b5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9d6849598339"><strong>JIRA</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1407d99d-51e6-4257-aba0-ec890a5782cd">
<td data-local-id=3D"4faa7ac8-67df-4980-a4c1-4b1e1acddfec" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4e1ee5b23608">11.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"18001a74b0cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5477d4c221f9"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"156e96d5311e"><strong>I want to </strong>communicate digital=
ly with Beem regarding my card experiences,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f58807501c3e"><strong>So that </strong>I can provide feedbac=
k, ask questions, and share concerns about my card</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3e8bbade-bbf1-47c2-9a27-81fa17f81f65" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67828555716e">The BeemDB platform, both online banking and t=
he mobile app, shall provide the option for the member to communicate with =
Beem and share feedback regarding their card experiences.</p>
<p local-id=3D"095ac9ce1bcc">Beem staff shall review the member=E2=80=99s s=
ubmission and reach out to the member to discuss further if appropriate.</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c4dc8382-50ec-4fa7-978a-948798901a99" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d163f7517f9"><strong>1 - Share Feedback Digitally</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"d04213ba971b"><strong>Given </strong>that I am a member who =
wishes to communicate digitally with Beem and share feedback regarding my c=
ard experiences,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8e020e25782a"><strong>When </strong>I access BeemDB and navi=
gate to the =E2=80=98Contact us=E2=80=99 page,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2273ed684638"><strong>Then </strong>I have the ability to su=
bmit compliments, questions, concerns/complaints, and/or suggestions, and a=
ssociate my feedback with the =E2=80=98Cards=E2=80=99 communication categor=
y to indicate it is related to Beem=E2=80=99s card products</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0449e956-07d9-4ffd-b412-e10ca43c7c74" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"19cee6b5d95f">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7350b87c-3cf8-4351-bf11-c6f3fd801323" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58f57dc5d0fc"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3cd60a24-0d56-45e3-ba08-379ff747be8e">
<td data-local-id=3D"7a685922-ff1e-4978-84d9-dd33a03c7308" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4dac666120ce">11.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1054f316f71a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e8b0c81a678"><strong>As a </strong>member cardholder,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c1a1f7cea88c"><strong>I want to </strong>provide Beem with s=
urvey feedback regarding my experiences and satisfaction with my card,</p>
<p local-id=3D"79e50c9ab445"><strong>So that</strong> card experiences can =
be improved, and so that I can witness Beem=E2=80=99s commitment to member =
centricity</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d39b91c0-97dd-4985-bb41-84440a451860" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2204b25d9cc2">Beem shall provide the member with the opportu=
nity to participate in card feedback survey(s)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e0c4bda-13a2-499b-a1e4-a77413fc2cb6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9e0b504cac8"><em><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-mark=
er" data-ref=3D"01010e5c-3ac7-49b2-b762-1f69bc048ad7">Descoped</span></stro=
ng><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"01010e5c-3ac7-49b2-b76=
2-1f69bc048ad7"> </span>currently - for future consideration and developmen=
t post-launch:</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ab6089a3-9664-4cb0-94b4-e66f8810e69f">
<li local-id=3D"bacead8f1a0f">
<p local-id=3D"350cbd0f6702"><em>Eligible members should be able to see a s=
atisfaction survey / question</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"049ede90-e5bf-4040-a062-3c7f3963b3f4">
<p local-id=3D"5fed7cb8720a"><em>Members should be able to indicate their s=
atisfaction score and submit the response</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"411f4259-110e-4041-a9ac-702a9b14f239">
<p local-id=3D"3d3e8ac6441b"><em>Members should also be able to add more co=
ntent as they feel appropriate</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7c47c3d9-d41c-40df-8f89-31ce97838e1d">
<p local-id=3D"71da0132ae35"><em>Acceptable channels</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"6e4ec41f-d094-4fdb-8e18-55faa1831043">
<li local-id=3D"303ea1d5-9a03-4c6b-a452-f1980512f6dd">
<p local-id=3D"89c6d9855d9c"><em>Mobile app</em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"582c3622-1bca-48e0-b46a-d9ddd45371a5">
<p local-id=3D"9376054ff619"><em>Online banking </em></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14c7ba82-837f-438a-9e00-59310cdbf33b">
<p local-id=3D"e412df3bc9f1"><em>Emails</em></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b19fa3c-66ad-4470-b9e9-8a89918c52d6">
<p local-id=3D"959475e3bd31"><em>The survey should follow a set of rules an=
d parameters to decide the member base and the cadence to send the satisfac=
tion survey</em></p></li>
</ul></td>
