<tr data-local-id=3D"34785d0f74f3">
<th data-local-id=3D"f8d0bb0fc0fe" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b9c6678e2d9f"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f9f3e403408d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"deaa455774ee"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b9f64efa2040" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3684e100bf46"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"91c0e397a522" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0feacf1bf11c"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5565c0d46920" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ed1faaf9bd7a"><strong>Owner/Teams</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fea669b94d76" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"19f4dc7c8dcb"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e7fad1ca09a3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c1530ea9ed26"><strong>Jira</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3c884f877375">
<td data-local-id=3D"8bd08208aa96" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"417b0e606da1">1.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5033cc9474f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f27d4a8a99f"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"aa8a274926e1"><strong>I want to</strong> view all pending pr=
eauthorized hold transactions (eg hotel/gas) processed via the visa debit n=
etwork and the authorized amount posted to a member=E2=80=99s account</p>
<p local-id=3D"3bba3d0a2168"><strong>So that I</strong> can confirm the cal=
culation of the available balance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8b8bbace1310" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"33af9714e131">Ability for core banking system to display all=
 pending preauthorized hold transactions processed via the Visa Network tha=
t are pending (authorized) but not yet settled.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aaf6e9875f88" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe1539aa1468"><em><span data-colorid=3D"fdt06vcn6n">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"a0d16d43f04f"><strong>1 - Preauthorized Hold (CAD to CAD)</s=
trong></p>
<p local-id=3D"98c529662649"><strong>Given</strong> a preauthorized transac=
tion that originated in CAD has been authorized and in pending status,<br><=
strong>When </strong>the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then</str=
ong> the system displays the merchant name, authorized amount, date and the=
 authorized amount is deducted from the available balance and the current b=
alance is unchanged.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"013321cf-b1b8-4c34-a916-0b2695a39c59">
<p local-id=3D"b862750331bf"><strong>2 - Preauthorized Hold (FX to CAD)</st=
rong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7cd0bd6f3fe3"><strong>Given</strong> a transaction that orig=
inated in foreign currency has been authorized and in pending status,<br><s=
trong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then</stro=
ng> the system displays the merchant name, authorized amount (converted to =
CAD), date and the authorized amount is deducted from the available balance=
 and the current balance is unchanged.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b397441aba9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"673a3d75c7ed"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd983f818215" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b31724720587"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f11b39584b1e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d5bf231e8b4"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9bbd53ff6d28">
<td data-local-id=3D"9564fee43076" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b10b37fe0b67">1.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17b9598dd2b0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2d72a6fa24d8"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"147bc5747556"><strong>I want to</strong> view all pending In=
ternational POS transactions processed via the visa debit network and the a=
uthorized amount posted to a member=E2=80=99s account</p>
<p local-id=3D"5e0fc3ebe760"><strong>So that I</strong> can confirm the cal=
culation of the available balance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8fa42ede92e8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7de89bf6f3af">Ability for core banking system to display all=
 pending International POS transactions processed via the Visa Network that=
 are pending (authorized) but not yet settled.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"426469aeab49" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5c3eb29cca4e"><em><span data-colorid=3D"jgsg62eax9">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"c44bb103f06c"><strong>1 - POS (FX to CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d7586e0fb2e4"><strong>Given</strong> a POS transaction that =
originated in foreign currency has been authorized and in pending status,<b=
r><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then <=
/strong>the system displays the merchant name, authorized amount (converted=
 to CAD), date and the authorized amount is deducted from the available bal=
ance and the current balance is unchanged.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a523fb3fffbc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd6c407a5641"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0fb3edd9c9a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da8afc545d5f"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2fc1d52959a2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"25814ba285ce"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8e06085de084">
<td data-local-id=3D"f6480ead7554" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"175ee18ac0b4">1.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"14a12162b50f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06029b8348ef"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b855cea67f1e"><strong>I want to</strong> view all pending CN=
P transactions processed via the visa debit network and the authorized amou=
nt posted to a member=E2=80=99s account</p>
<p local-id=3D"78cc327d8378"><strong>So that I</strong> can confirm the cal=
culation of the available balance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"44a93348d6db" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96afe9eb817a">Ability for the core banking system to display=
 all pending CNP transactions processed via the Visa Network that are pendi=
ng (authorized) but not yet settled.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"441494d1b52a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c7283d71de85"><em><span data-colorid=3D"whgdlalkt9">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"4541132928ac"><strong>1 - CNP (CAD to CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b848bacb7cdd"><strong>Given</strong> a CNP transaction that =
originated in CAD has been authorized and in pending status,<br><strong>Whe=
n </strong>the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then </strong>the s=
ystem displays the merchant name, authorized amount, date and the authorize=
d amount is deducted from the available balance and the current balance is =
unchanged.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"933fff79-08dd-429e-a995-57e1b15e69c2">
<p local-id=3D"64254621852c"><strong>2 - CNP (FX to CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b478dce4faaa"><strong>Given </strong>a CNP transaction that =
originated in foreign currency has been authorized and in pending status,<b=
r><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then <=
/strong>the system displays the merchant name, authorized amount (converted=
 to CAD), date and the authorized amount is deducted from the available bal=
ance and the current balance is unchanged.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0aa3d3cf0781" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8eb1500c59eb"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d6de259839a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d329f04f598"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aef8a0103bc1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a904b4a66ce"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0eb7521b89f0">
<td data-local-id=3D"cc63e999bdbb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14a913912841">1.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2f42d68ea07" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cab30229587f"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6a7e9dfd2be8"><strong>I want to</strong> view all pending AT=
M transactions processed via the visa debit network and the authorized amou=
nt posted to a member=E2=80=99s account</p>
<p local-id=3D"1628fb860dd8"><strong>So that I </strong>can confirm the cal=
culation of the available balance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4cf8d191758b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8884e904c156">Ability for the core banking system to display=
 all pending ATM transactions processed via the Visa Network that are pendi=
ng (authorized) but not yet settled.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"97780a2c21c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eeb5d9423925"><em><span data-colorid=3D"q6dxpvhafl">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"885552f608ab"><strong>1 - ATM (CAD to CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7d4c450254e7"><strong>Given</strong> an ATM transaction that=
 originated in CAD has been authorized and in pending status,<br><strong>Wh=
en</strong> the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the =
system displays the merchant name, authorized amount, date and the authoriz=
ed amount is deducted from the available balance and the current balance is=
 unchanged.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"74d02ac8-0750-482f-86d4-69f8ceaaab16">
<p local-id=3D"80b43e9af63c"><strong>2 -ATM (FX to CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0f48191b5545"><strong>Given </strong>an ATM transaction that=
 originated in foregn currency has been authorized and in pending status,<b=
r><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in DNA,<br><strong>Then <=
/strong>the system displays the merchant name, authorized amount (converted=
 to CAD), date and the authorized amount is deducted from the available bal=
ance and the current balance is unchanged.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"396e57fd0e9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a583eeaae969"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"abd9a7aa691d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"898d7d874f57"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f8ac2fc2729f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d0676537613b"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d489680ac3b6">
<td data-local-id=3D"75d3d7ae8407" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ec9460126bd">1.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9f7b6b6ee981" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1fcb8e27b8f8"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"edba1cd901ee"><strong>I want to</strong> see a record of all=
 settled visa network transactions conducted by a member via ATM, POS and C=
NP</p>
<p local-id=3D"c5b1460ec490"><strong>So that I</strong> have full visibilit=
y of this transaction and can help a member review and understand their tra=
nsactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d5f853a129f4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7935a1cd2179">Ability for the core banking system to display=
 all settled transactions: ATM, POS, CNP (domestic and foreign) transaction=
s that have been processed on the Visa Network.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f098c2e109ed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5c1832ed2bc5"><em><span data-colorid=3D"p6ofisafpm">Transact=
ion behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"a819e57f302a"><strong>1 -ATM -Domestic Currency (CAD)</stron=
g><br><strong>Given </strong>a transaction has settled and debited the memb=
er account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the trans=
action history in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the dat=
e, amount and ATM location along with the corresponding balance as a result=
 of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"993d8650-781a-4ed6-81f3-4051330665a6">
<p local-id=3D"199af3088d57"><strong>2 -POS - Domestic Currency (CAD)</stro=
ng><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction has settled and debited the mem=
ber account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the tran=
saction history in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the da=
te, amount, merchant and location along with the corresponding balance as a=
 result of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"32ce274f-ad71-4964-8cd3-7c251ab9425a">
<p local-id=3D"081f19cbbe47"><strong>3 - CNP - Domestic Currency (CAD)</str=
ong><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction has settled and debited the me=
mber account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the tra=
nsaction history in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the d=
ate, amount, merchant and location along with the corresponding balance as =
a result of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"46ee7009-cde7-4e5a-b2b2-aa29061be773">
<p local-id=3D"bdd484cafa8a"><strong>4 - ATM - Foreign Currency (FX)</stron=
g><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction has settled and debited the memb=
er account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the trans=
action history in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the dat=
e, amount (converted in CAD), exchange rate used and ATM location along wit=
h the corresponding balance as a result of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"515d4f65-9224-451d-96aa-9e39be887bd7">
<p local-id=3D"0a319dd26c5f"><strong>5 - POS - Foreign Currency (FX)</stron=
g><br><strong>Given </strong>a transaction has settled and debited the memb=
er account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the trans=
action history in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the dat=
e, amount (converted in CAD), exchange rate used, merchant and location alo=
ng with the corresponding balance as a result of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"03ddfa7c-291c-435c-b25e-365cea25f0fd">
<p local-id=3D"93a099c235d4"><strong>6 - CNP - Foreign Currency (FX) </stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"7887434160bb"><strong>Given</strong> a transaction has settl=
ed and debited the member account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction=
 is viewed in the transaction history in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the =
system displays the date, amount (converted in CAD), exchange rate used, me=
rchant and location along with the corresponding balance as a result of the=
 transaction.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"59deec8f8f2d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f8d990f5fcd6"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0af60df2113f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"726aeeffc060"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c2c194be38e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c60111e1efa"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a40cb5873444">
<td data-local-id=3D"f0b676b49b04" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c2ff44a7406">1.6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e4c2ca8b5861" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"948fefd87869"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"cf16925482e8"><strong>I want to</strong> see a record of all=
 settled visa network transactions conducted by a member via Visa Direct (A=
FT and OCT)</p>
<p local-id=3D"da9560d7c609"><strong>So that I</strong> have full visibilit=
y of this transaction and can help a member review and understand their tra=
nsactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e62352494a25" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c612d7da7913">Ability for core banking system to display all=
 settled Visa Direct transactions that have been processed on the Visa Netw=
ork.</p>
<p local-id=3D"052c029ef80c"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7085a87442b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"345563428ec1"><em><span data-colorid=3D"mdc34nkzcj">Transact=
ion behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"aa9c889f24be"><strong>1 -Visa Direct AFT - Domestic Currency=
 (CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a423ed312800"><strong>Given</strong> an incoming AFT transac=
tion (pulled from an alternate account) has credited a member's account,<br=
><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the transaction history=
 in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the date, amount, sen=
der name and purpose of payment along with the corresponding balance as a r=
esult of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0c937c1b-b615-4554-a645-eff749b60eaf">
<p local-id=3D"d21e41a92704"><strong>2 -Visa Direct OCT - Domestic Currency=
 (CAD)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"46dc728d8090"><strong>Given</strong> an incoming OCT transac=
tion (pushed from an alternate account) has credited a member's account,<br=
><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the transaction history=
 in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the date, amount and =
sender name along with the corresponding balance as a result of the transac=
tion.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0c52d8aa-b435-4162-910d-cbb5eb71ad7a">
<p local-id=3D"6ae5d4de8eae"><strong>3 -Visa Direct AFT - Foreign Currency =
(FX)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b8e51814b8ba"><strong>Given</strong> an incoming AFT transac=
tion (pulled from an alternate account) has credited a member's account,<br=
><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the transaction history=
 in DNA,<br><strong>Then </strong>the system displays the date, amount and =
sender name, exchange rate used along with the corresponding balance as a r=
esult of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5c78759c-e5d0-45a0-89b0-e69767a17a94">
<p local-id=3D"09b14135231b"><strong>4 - Visa Direct OCT - Foreign Currency=
 (FX)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"783f2dec225a"><strong>Given</strong> an incoming OCT transac=
tion (pushed from an alternate account) has credited a member's account,<br=
><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the transaction history=
 in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the system displays the date, amount and =
sender name, exchange rate used along with the corresponding balance as a r=
esult of the transaction.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"80ec47783ab3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"768b1dd357f7"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a0299da64348" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd50ec6c8f8a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95c24df8fa82" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1bc6742602bc"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5569dc87cff7">
<td data-local-id=3D"ea30f6d57efe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"435d2a81b7ae">1.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e7474822d95b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd75863a63d5"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4528b288d308"><strong>I want to</strong> see the reversal of=
 a pending visa network transaction on a member account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"beec970670e1"><strong>So that I</strong> can confirm only ex=
pected authorized transactions remain pending for available balance calcula=
tion.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1d1e76b491f9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba3c4d66f2f7">Ability for core banking system to reverse/can=
cel pending transactions: ATM, POS, CNP, and foreign transactions authorize=
d for available balance calculation that have been processed on the Visa Ne=
twork.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cb95f738a592" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3692f0a3bba7"><em><span data-colorid=3D"ueykyleyrn">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"7efab80b1169"><strong>1 - Reversal of ATM,POS or CNP transac=
tion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"06f2949f9206"><strong>Given</strong> an ATM, POS or CNP tran=
saction has been authorized and a hold placed and available balance reduced=
 by the transaction amount (no settlement or debit posted to the member acc=
ount)</p>
<p local-id=3D"440398d4a82d"><strong>When</strong> the transaction is rever=
sed by the merchant through a reversal message</p>
<p local-id=3D"907853a16075"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction hold is =
removed/expired and the available balance is restored.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f06d31c5-e1e7-45ee-b7da-ed492f711996">
<p local-id=3D"0d375d623f6f"><strong>2 - Reversal of preauthorized transact=
ion hold (hotel/gas)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"45fe785631c4"><strong>Given</strong> a preauthorized transac=
tion has been authorized and a hold placed and available balance reduced by=
 the transaction amount (no settlement or debit posted to the member accoun=
t)</p>
<p local-id=3D"51edd72a23ee"><strong>When</strong> the transaction is rever=
sed by the merchant</p>
<p local-id=3D"9b338ddee4ec"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction hold is =
removed/expired and the available balance is restored in DNA.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1007b8b43bf2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e2a43a0418a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4a76d04466dc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f07a1501751"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1b8e9f88d265" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01d42daafb1c"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e653cf4a9f5e">
<td data-local-id=3D"9f6ba4265da6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"53f9625246f8">1.8</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"676f4294b87e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a6926eacc62"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9e50f9ddb88e"><strong>I want to</strong> see a record of all=
 pending refunded visa network transactions conducted on a member account,<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"3d4335a2eec9"><strong>So that I</strong> have full visibilit=
y of this transaction and can help a member review and understand their tra=
nsactions and how they are used to calculate available balance and current =
balance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7455e918aa7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"320d68ca535f">Ability for core banking system to display all=
 refunded pending transactions: POS, CNP and foreign transactions processed=
 via the Visa Network that are pending (authorized) but not yet settled and=
 credited to the member account.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b391581f0219" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3a098c23a327"><em><span data-colorid=3D"bf3mnpo66n">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em>. <span data=
-colorid=3D"h54mwjwiku">Need to understand how pending refunds will display=
. Will the available balance be increased and current balance remain? </spa=
n></p>
<p local-id=3D"9e7c1341ac11"><strong>1 - Refund of POS or CNP transaction</=
strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7001170055b7"><strong>Given</strong> a POS or CNP refund has=
 been sent for authorization to a member account and in pending status</p>
<p local-id=3D"af5d82a40ab9"><strong>When</strong> the member account is re=
viewed in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"e7be0a92dddd"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction appears =
as a pending credit showing the merchant name and the available balance is =
increased by the transaction amount and the current balance does not change=
 until settlement is processed.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b289de4a25c0"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1db11725c49f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"17b89b9c88e6"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"48e558242223" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12eefee225a3"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1d3aabd63d54" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"72b132c78805"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fe93190ae029">
<td data-local-id=3D"cf38f9c842e6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a72e8d48ba9">1.9</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c0e89979ceee" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de3c3bb92946"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3d73683b20b8"><strong>I want to</strong> see a record of all=
 refunded visa network transactions conducted on a member account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f30614d02ba5"><strong>So that I</strong> have full visibilit=
y of this transaction and can help a member review and understand their tra=
nsactions and how they are used to calculate available and current balances=
.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9509b02d6419" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cc2e80d963f">Ability for core banking system to display all=
 refunded/reversed settled transactions: ATM, POS, CNP, and foreign transac=
tions that have been settled via the Visa Network.</p>
<p local-id=3D"fed1f07d6b52"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0bff3d9526a2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1ad31fd2e81e"><em><span data-colorid=3D"sm09b7v9y4">Pending =
transaction behaviour requires testing confirmation</span></em>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"84e1e5c4cc4c"><strong>1 - Refund of POS or CNP transaction</=
strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e39d25cb5d07"><strong>Given</strong> an authorization of a r=
efund/credit is processed by a merchant and available balance increased by =
the transaction amount and the transaction is in a pending state</p>
<p local-id=3D"21a600a8fd7b"><strong>When</strong> the transaction settles =
the member account in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"3d44db8bf598"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction appears =
in the transaction history showing the merchant name, location and amount a=
nd the current balance is increased.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5cc25d75e25b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3e196727f85c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9e8dcef65c3"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1df60a3b0da8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc8de6ff595a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"360c8ab083c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10f972a07827"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c184b7fb3ce7">
<td data-local-id=3D"2d67c682dca6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"776661b4e92a">1.10</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81a4920fef67" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"17b82419719f"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d60e57cf85a1"><strong>I want to</strong> be able to easily i=
dentify transactions processed via the Visa network,</p>
<p local-id=3D"aef5ca8df230"><strong>So that I</strong> can follow appropri=
ate steps when further investigation of a transaction is required.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c57a5e0226f6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3d56c4cf6246">Ability for core banking system to display tra=
nsactions processed via the Visa network from the member DNA transaction hi=
story.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c7fa60ffcec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"578d54f62c69"><strong>1 - Transaction History POS/CNP</stron=
g><br><strong>Given</strong> a POS/CNP transaction has been debited from th=
e member account</p>
<p local-id=3D"2746d01bd37b"><strong>When</strong> the account history deta=
ils are reviewed in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"1f978834cb20"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction will dis=
play Visa as the network posting.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5c2b2aa7-85a8-4d2a-89aa-96f6be60e662">
<p local-id=3D"0295996d18ca"><strong>2 - Transaction History ATM</strong></=
p>
<p local-id=3D"bfcf3f54bd80"><strong>Given</strong> an ATM transaction has =
been debited from the member account</p>
<p local-id=3D"5e6ed97de9b8"><strong>When</strong> the account history deta=
ils are reviewed in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"9583aadea913"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction will dis=
play Visa as the network posting.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"7b1ffe4f-8aaa-4d2d-82b0-e5651c0cd91a">
<p local-id=3D"9c151eeebaab"><strong>3 - Transaction History Visa Direct</s=
trong></p>
<p local-id=3D"4814ef1ee84e"><strong>Given</strong> a Visa Direct transacti=
on has been debited from the member account</p>
<p local-id=3D"fd9cebe12169"><strong>When</strong> the account history deta=
ils are reviewed in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"390f0d968282"><strong>Then </strong>the transaction will dis=
play Visa as the network posting.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d65513620d2a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e921603af7a9"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bb90e6b0dfa4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d8297d5befa"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"63cf292337aa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31adee9cc87a"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"63e9d91f278f">
<td data-local-id=3D"e8eb46deb511" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cedba9cfb90">1.11</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4debdd08bdcd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9126cec6a3e5"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5dceaeb0b5da"><strong>I want to</strong> be able to easily t=
race a member transaction processed via the Visa network from pending to se=
ttled,</p>
<p local-id=3D"78e54cbc5d69"><strong>So that I </strong>can confirm current=
 and available balances match.</p>
<p local-id=3D"46f39ca61351"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"78f46be637ff" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"95fcd9575c56">Ability for core banking system to update curr=
ent and available balance when a transaction settles and debits/credits the=
 member account.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8ffb550d3576" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b8616661a64d"><strong>1 - CNP/POS Debit</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"9ce37bf3e0af"><strong>Given</strong> a CNP or POS transactio=
n has been authorized and a hold placed and available balance adjusted by t=
he amount of the transaction</p>
<p local-id=3D"a5aaec192502"><strong>When</strong> the clearing file is rec=
eived by DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"9730fbf4b7b4"><strong>Then</strong> the member account is de=
bited the funds and the hold is expired/removed and the current and availab=
le balance are adjusted by the amount of the transaction.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f8602d044860"><strong>2 - ATM Debit</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"1f1cc1ddbc64"><strong>Given</strong> an ATM transaction has =
been authorized and a hold placed and available balance adjusted by the amo=
unt of the transaction</p>
<p local-id=3D"c79db868d9fa"><strong>When</strong> the clearing file is rec=
eived by DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"081f26b341b8"><strong>Then</strong> the member account is de=
bited the funds and the hold is expired/removed and the current and availab=
le balance are adjusted by the amount of the transaction.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ab304a7be9b7"><strong>3 - CNP/POS Credit(refund)</strong></p=
>
<p local-id=3D"295d92d8ee26"><strong>Given</strong> a CNP or POS refund tra=
nsaction has been authorized and available balance increased by the amount =
of the transaction</p>
<p local-id=3D"4fa41b4b0861"><strong>When</strong> the clearing file is rec=
eived by DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"b19bf6209b07"><strong>Then</strong> the member account is cr=
edited the funds and the current and available balance are increased by the=
 amount of the transaction.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"36390d938876" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc3ea6dfe335"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"274b3ccf6f60" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf3a754fd91b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f925e2bc1c52" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0851cba3048a"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0a050f0748a1">
<td data-local-id=3D"77e447a4d1c9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"03940201c309">1.12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3aed3f519742" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe0b50e45bd8"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ad10c251aa36"><strong>I want to</strong> review the visa net=
work transactions conducted by a member each month,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3a2f50a28ef7"><strong>So that I </strong>can confirm the cor=
rect charges were calculated based on the account type.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5588fdb8411b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"73bfc5734323">Ability for core banking system to calculate c=
orrect charges for each Visa transaction based on account type for immediat=
e and monthend charges (including overdraft fees).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"79241272919e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a1ebb2921192"><em>Need to confirm all possible transaction t=
ypes.</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"af88fea90f75">Happy Path (to be expanded)</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"762c18dbde19">
<li local-id=3D"fa3e9cf82150">
<p local-id=3D"ed8a06c9c8d1">POS Domestic (CAD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0bf30ee63fa7">
<p local-id=3D"448246350030">ATM Domestic (CAD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5530345ae519">
<p local-id=3D"968a88d03107">CNP Domestic (CAD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5c2e1a53708d">
<p local-id=3D"a7f09d2df555">POS International (FX)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"637dc74d3937">
<p local-id=3D"2baa4f5832a3">ATM International (FX)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fd89a0f4589b">
<p local-id=3D"f0c4af7826ed">CNP International (FX)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2c710238e537">
<p local-id=3D"27cfb11ffddc">Visa Direct Domestic OCT (CAD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aaefb2b69d82">
<p local-id=3D"9b5afcf5bd8c">Visa Direct Domestic ACT (CAD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37c54e568044">
<p local-id=3D"3f9d4c194bf1">Visa Direct International OCT (FX)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fecdf664ae83">
<p local-id=3D"62d942758dd4">Visa Direct International ACT (FX)</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"0e3527e04e71">Negative Testing<br>
Reversals/recalled transactions and charging to ensure not included in tran=
saction calculation.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72b879c32059" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"401d82267ec0"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"67f33d988b88" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6ed3b9df804f"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"92a47a925825" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df60fc60db69"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"33e6bfc30488" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-2.CardIssuance/Ordering">2. Card Issuance / Ordering</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-903758029" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-903758029" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-903758029" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"4000" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"dc9863cd-2a0c-40bc-abbd-9e6b3db66e4b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 80.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 209.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 380.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 63.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 69.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 51.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f655781743ae">
<th data-local-id=3D"4a3640967866" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5a8d6b76eb9f"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"aad87382933e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"94862b6af125"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d4b498cfb873" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2a1793e3f47e"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"044c5d8ffdb1" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ecddba38b4da"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3941686abcd8" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6f667600f651"><strong>Owner/Teams</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fee860cc3076" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bacff4247e2f"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"bdadf726c4a7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6b29564ec706"><strong>Jira</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"57bebf8dde69">
<td data-local-id=3D"078608191bd5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"882cd0a5d0b8">2.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"482015d8-3639-4a3b-b563-2a5c11bc8865" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e88ca2897760"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4bb2024ad28d"><strong>I want to</strong> order a card</p>
<p local-id=3D"2576a138460a"><strong>So that I</strong> can provide a membe=
r access to funds in their account</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b01a8884744a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9892fe06e6e">Ability to order card via core banking system<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6c4d70b8ee0f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9ac93a89fec"><em><strong>(exact process to be understood)</=
strong></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"0baf2b290a64"><strong>1 - Default limits/holds/expiry date (=
Personal and Business)</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>a member is eligi=
ble to receive a membercard and default card setup is selected in DNA<br><s=
trong>When</strong> the card order is confirmed in DNA and a PIN selected<b=
r><strong>Then</strong> the card details and limits of the card will appear=
 on the card order file.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"8c02015f-a489-420a-b74d-2f54f4b35756">
<p local-id=3D"3dff750e99de"><strong>2 - Custom limits/holds/name (Personal=
 and Business)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a977b3b364b9"><strong>Given </strong>a member is eligible to=
 receive a membercard and custom limits/holds/name is selected in DNA<br><s=
trong>When</strong> the card order is confirmed in DNA and a PIN selected<b=
r><strong>Then</strong> the card details and customized limits of the card =
will appear on the card order file.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c29b4d54-92d7-4d1e-8d70-26ebfcf042c8">
<p local-id=3D"210be2d386e2"><strong>3 - Remotely Via PIN mailer (Personal =
and Business)</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>a member is eligible to re=
ceive a membercard and default is selected in DNA with a PIN mailer.<br><st=
rong>When</strong> the card order is confirmed in DNA and a PIN selected<br=
><strong>Then</strong> the card details and customized limits of the card w=
ill appear on the card order file.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c219a2f2c014" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"412305b2c634"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b7c9e02347a3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"adf4285f5319"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8366b11b053c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c2183b51b20"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ebd0746d05d8">
<td data-local-id=3D"88fd201ab6af" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"11f5d23fae67">2.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc3812b2465d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6547fbf12edd"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9e92cbe5da23"><strong>I want to</strong> replace a card that=
 is lost or damaged</p>
<p local-id=3D"404df77aac08"><strong>So that </strong>the original details =
of the lost/damaged card (ie PAN,holds,limits,name) remain intact for the r=
eissued card</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3438a6a5439f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"97f38ecb6175">Ability to replace/reissue card via core banki=
ng system based on current card setup (PAN,holds,limits,name).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"18a8b89daa42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a79d7a5b305e"><strong>1 - Reissue card with default settings=
</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"386c35d6b711"><strong>Given</strong> a membercard with no cu=
stomized setup is reissued<br><strong>When</strong> the card order is compl=
eted in DNA<br><strong>Then</strong> the card order report confirms the sam=
e details as the original (PAN,holds,limits,name) and the same PIN can be u=
sed for in person transactions.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"db6787de-574f-44d8-888a-354ae4766e45">
<p local-id=3D"1e6cf2a162e5"><strong>2 - Reissue card with custom settings<=
/strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"91d7c84cc8ee"><strong>Given</strong> a membercard with custo=
mized setup is reissued (holds,limit,name)<br><strong>When</strong> the car=
d order is completed in DNA<br><strong>Then</strong> the card order report =
confirms the same details as the original (PAN,holds,limits,name) and the s=
ame PIN can be used for in person transactions.</p>
<p local-id=3D"712c926c226b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3a97dacef114" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0cae5368fa53"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa9e54a3c07a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"680145426899"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1267d0942b70" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f8c11218653"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d5010b9d123d">
<td data-local-id=3D"167c9a6f891c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ed4225dc5ca">2.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2bbbce8cf3c9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d669c73cddd"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"282cec534b37"><strong>I want to</strong> renew a card that w=
ill be expiring in the near future</p>
<p local-id=3D"c991f3df4a97"><strong>So that </strong>a member can receive =
a new card that can be activated with no service interruption.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e70389823179" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9bd3c6711741">Ability to renew card via core banking system =
based on preset parameters.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"da9e763f81bf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"369aa6647614"><span data-colorid=3D"zaywmcpyos">Set standard=
 number of days before card expiry date that card is reordered?</span><br><=
span data-colorid=3D"ako29ht79j">Ways to trigger a renewal outside of syste=
m default settings. Are there differences between renewal and replacement? =
Can expiry date be modified from standard? Need to understand further befor=
e acceptance criteria fleshed out. </span><br>
Confirm order on card report</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a936d2217ec9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b10042b9bca8"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8f2195428f23" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a8bd2885af5a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b3a820b63e3c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"889fe8b0255d"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cc840cd37369">
<td data-local-id=3D"f2bf37e92ecf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbe6afd49e84">2.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17eeaa718c82" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55eabcddf579"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9932ed34250e"><strong>I want to</strong> cancel a card</p>
<p local-id=3D"d847ce979252"><strong>So that </strong>the card can no longe=
r be used to authorize and process transactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a2c83296-ff31-43cf-b63a-5e618635ff0d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b8a28fa3b48">Ability to cancel a card via core banking syst=
em to prevent any further transactions from being processed (in person and =
CNP).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"60c6c0cf2a5a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08f18517f41d">Need to understand all ways a card is cancelle=
d and how that impacts pending transactions and card on file setups for CNP=
 transactions.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3335488c2cac"></p>
<p local-id=3D"a87d73eddca2">Confirm change on card report</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"588745814664" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74737ac63341"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6e57274258c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc28cdcb263e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4110cefae495" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"50084f7c40b3"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e2db8a1fc8d0">
<td data-local-id=3D"067f0443beaa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a363a50c67a">2.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"09c2cd9b204a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2d3f9369a8a"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8c12243d15b6"><strong>I want to</strong> confirm individual =
card order details processed in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"882f5d38cd95"><strong>So that </strong>I can confirm the cor=
rect details were received and processed by Everlink.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e33b3fdb6cb1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"07690fe4112a">Ability to view individual visa debit card ord=
er details processed in core banking system via Everlink connector report C=
ard Order File - CCID001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73fefb665509" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a7ab32b6534">Happy Path<br>
Complete card order in DNA<br>
Download COF CCID001 report<br>
Confirm PAN received and all other pertinent details received on report wit=
h a successful order message</p>
<p local-id=3D"f1b22236c8f8">Edge Case<br>
Complete card order in DNA that would trigger an error<br>
Download COF CCID001 report<br>
Confirm PAN received on report with an error message<br>
Correct errors in DNA and submit order again via DNA<br>
Download COF report CCID001 again to confirm the PAN now generates a succes=
sful order message</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"44e9ddef4571" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9f5d4aa77b16"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b361fc1d527d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cdbf77dc3d21"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f74f060412f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a58126813ee"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"18b4beee8922">
<td data-local-id=3D"dabae4e530d2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29de18abb0e7">2.6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d09b8e36a4f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"af3aa61cb2d4"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3bd801510d91"><strong>I want to</strong> confirm all card or=
der details processed in DNA for the previous day</p>
<p local-id=3D"267481675810"><strong>So that </strong>I can confirm card de=
tails received and the cards processed by Everlink.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4d0ba05f7d7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e5ebd2462aa">Ability to view all cards ordered in core bank=
ing system from previous business day (3PM EST cutoff) via Everlink connect=
or Card Summary Report - CCID003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"235e6854354e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22eeafea8d71">Happy Path<br>
Complete card order in DNA and successful order on COF CCID001<br>
On the following business day after 3PM EST, download Card Summary Report C=
CID003 to confirm correct details received.<br>
Confirm cards that triggered an error did not process any order.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d6531de6210f">Full details in Everlink Central Card Issuance=
 User Guide</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cd03acfefba5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"606b934334b5"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"36ba4b6a522c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0853e2ad9b9c"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51289c14d486" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26f941a06968"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"33ddd253f353">
<td data-local-id=3D"c0a663aa9e1c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3833b6346a53">2.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"86dd31e9edef" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"45c6f5696c49"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5bb15a7392d7"><strong>I want to</strong> confirm all card or=
ders processed in DNA with PIN mailers for the previous day</p>
<p local-id=3D"8ae4574298e4"><strong>So that </strong>I know Everlink has r=
eceived and will process PIN mailer requests.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c9a8a358be3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fed642ba9e9c">Ability to view all cards ordered with PIN mai=
lers in core banking system from previous business day (3PM EST cutoff) via=
 Everlink connector PIN Summary Report -CCID004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5681ca85f6ea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbbf3cfed8ef">Happy Path<br>
Complete a successful order of a card with a PIN mailer<br>
On the following business day after 3PM EST, download PIN Summary Report -C=
CID004 to confirm correct details received.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f1ab72a536f1">Full details in Everlink Central Card Issuance=
 User Guide</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"733c6dc1ddcd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"93aad5f8a6e0"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d1a0fca2f27f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9f0e3067491"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"529a853656a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ae143e718f6"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"928c44ec9b53">
<td data-local-id=3D"d46d82082825" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c187907052a3">2.8</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f3ee5483d8a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d627074e20ea"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"25b1707b09e9"><strong>I want to</strong> confirm all card or=
ders placed in DNA that were rejected by Everlink</p>
<p local-id=3D"900343e40f4f"><strong>So that </strong>I know what details t=
o fix so that the order can be submitted successfully.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"957f1494cdeb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"775f64a27fc4">Ability to view all rejected card orders place=
d in the core banking system from the previous business day card (3PM EST c=
utoff) via Feedback Report - CCID002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5fb528a464b6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26102a4d9264">Happy Path<br>
Complete an order that triggered an issue and appeared on COF CCID001 repor=
t.<br>
On the following business day after 3PM EST, download Feedback Report - CCI=
D002 to confirm details of account with error received.<br>
Confirm that a successful card order was not produced.<br>
Confirm that once errors corrected that a successful order can be completed=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2f49113aa509">Full details in Everlink Central Card Issuance=
 User Guide</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5d5064df50d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"939ad2c557c3"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c86c14a7ff1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cde259c6a442"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4bbd4f291049" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b183d3ef4e7"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c76303802f60">
<td data-local-id=3D"06b0cac17db1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b31e60a62efa">2.9</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3bad7a13745e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"05b3afd74c1e"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"48c7b11edb3f"><strong>I want to</strong> confirm the card an=
d collateral inventory at any given time</p>
<p local-id=3D"2005bc3668f4"><strong>So that </strong>minimum quantities ca=
n be maintained.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"901760631081" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a3e2ea56ace">Ability to view card and collateral inventory =
weekly on Monday by 3PM EST via Card/Collateral Inventory Report - CCIW001<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e62cf29b9bf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb3e6db0dce5">The inventory report provides a four week coun=
t of inventory levels for physical card stock and collateral materials resi=
ding at the card vendor. The report details what has been<br>
received, consumed and spoiled weekly totals, the opening and closing balan=
ces, the Average Weekly Use (AWU) and the Warehouse Stock On Hand<br>
(WSOH) in weeks.<br>
The Balance should be actively monitored in order to manage inventory level=
s and ensure that manufacture orders are placed in advance of need.<br>
Everlink=E2=80=99s Card Issuance Support team will work in parallel with th=
e Issuer to receive forecasts and assist in managing inventory.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ac85c4d2d04c">Need to ensure minimum annual card quantities =
as per Everlink agreement. Specified in Schedule 4 noted under Minimum Busi=
ness Requirements section 1.7</p>
<p local-id=3D"61f444af6152">Full details in Everlink Central Card Issuance=
 User Guide</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd028f416d01" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47d8c84811df"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a4e2c2c7de53" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6e4722402e9b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2b957c73aaa3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c90f8e945500"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f17ee74ebdf8">
<td data-local-id=3D"0d0bfa3e9b36" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"15461f170c06">2.10</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"80b3aecd3288" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c23735893d99"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0ee8db241a9c"><strong>I want to</strong> view the card detai=
ls of all active cards in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef8dbedcaa22"><strong>So that </strong>I can confirm card de=
tails used by Everlink to validate card usage are accurate.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5872c7bc5bf5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7474b22a0ab3">Ability to confirm card orders and renewals on=
 Card Activity File (CAF) that is generated from the core banking system.</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ea4125fcc552" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0110ad82925b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"24f987d380e3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"72d367d84a12"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3838d56a0a5c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d0ce7ef2436"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b4bf30acfafa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1cefeb391599"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4f87c2263c98">
<td data-local-id=3D"4c8b65b4a8cf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b38b1c81e5c1">2.11</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01f352352062" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a22b41f95f7b"><strong>As a</strong> System User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9d5e4677e9f5"><strong>I want to</strong> report current memb=
ercards that are being replaced with new Visa Cobadge cards to CUCC.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5e749822e4da"><strong>So that </strong>member transaction us=
age and customer behaviour analysis captured by Interac is migrated to the =
new card and not double counted.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8b7588b85ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f3f5650f90dd">Ability for core banking system to support man=
datory monthly reporting to CUCC of ISO standard 8 digit bank identificatio=
n numbers (BIN) for card reissuance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6d33c29c-da44-4ab8-a727-2bd08faa688e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"09d997b69b2a"><em>Need to understand Fiserv report AT_INTERA=
CIIN and what data elements will trigger the capture on this report.</em> I=
s there a difference between system triggered reissuance and manual?</p>
<p local-id=3D"cc4a5bf2842f">1 -Reissuance/Replacement</p>
<p local-id=3D"7a357c391854">Given a member has an existing card that will =
be replaced with a Visa Cobadge card</p>
<p local-id=3D"ba23ae485767">When a replacement card is ordered</p>
<p local-id=3D"3f5a588b7ba0">Then the <em>AT_INTERACIIN</em> report capture=
s CU name, timestamp, old PAN, new PAN and Reissuance reason code.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"7ea5e254-c241-4720-8d40-b1cb0706cc27">
<p local-id=3D"c4e908b3e5ac">2 - New Card Issuance</p>
<p local-id=3D"7042ab00a2c6"></p>
<p local-id=3D"dd2967a6101d">Are there situations where it=E2=80=99s not a =
straight reissuance of the card where manual intervention is required to re=
port?</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"beee6815d6f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"713248a9518a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"57cb0d34288b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbde0c441342"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3bc64fc6ecf4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"89048aba0b30"><a href=3D"https://beem.atlassian.net/browse/V=
DC-33" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">[VDC-33] Create new IIN mig=
ration report - Jira</a></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
