<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"24fa2139552e">
<th data-local-id=3D"f4806ab24a4b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fdd6e1011475"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"eea6e333789f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d54be9fe704f"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"999924a13a8d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"122925c58b58"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"ce6a5ce6561e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e32e18547736"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"4e109b2af790" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"878e6a21349f"><strong>Owner / Teams</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"87f941a678bf" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"852084bbf501"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"826a843c0981" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fa7df8e5ae4e"><strong>Jira</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"299817a45f11">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce715f4ac379" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9193dd84b81">3.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd9a73fc3403" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efe95b110873"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"71bd63a4c278"><strong>I want to</strong> change a Card Hold =
type assigned to a Visa debit card</p>
<p local-id=3D"4ab19f0f28b8"><strong>So that I </strong>can assign differen=
t card limits and holds for transactions performed by the cardholder.</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8ab8bbca49f2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55ef5b96900a">Ability for core banking system to modify the =
card hold type linked to Retail and Business cards by selecting different d=
ropdown menu types so that ATM/ POS withdrawal limits, ATM deposit limits a=
nd ATM / RDC (remote deposit capture) hold days can be customized based on =
member relationship with BEEM.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"154f038469d2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ac56177e2dd">Confirm all applicable card hold types can be =
assigned and limits are received by Everlink.<br>
1 - Standard Hold Type<br>
2 - Maximum Hold Type<br>
3 - Extended Hold Type<br>
4 - High Risk Hold Type<br>
5 - Trusted Member - no hold Hold Type<br>
6 - Junior Member</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7549a47ac22b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a067c9bd64cc"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bba1e60851ae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"30f7c361b29e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"837f1ade91f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"251f1781010c"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7f23ae69ea03">
<td data-local-id=3D"cd0d4beff77c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55445a666a79">3.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c25883d41360" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a5a3bfa74c3d"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fd6858e55862"><strong>I want to</strong> change individual C=
ard Holder limit amounts for ATM / POS withdrawals and deposits</p>
<p local-id=3D"7dfeb1f6b051"><strong>So that</strong> transactions performe=
d on any accounts linked to the Visa debit card will be controlled by custo=
m limits entered.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4e63546ea231" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c5adaf4de32">Ability for core banking system to modify indi=
vidual ATM and POS Card Holder limits assigned to a Card Hold type linked t=
o a membercard.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"02112baf21a7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"91c82362e22e">ATM Withdrawal Limit<br>
POS Withdrawal Limit<br>
Combined Withdrawal Limit<br>
Daily Deposit Limit<br>
ATM Offline Withdrawal Limit<br>
POS Offline Withdrawal Limit</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bdac55cfbafe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b4f4842c1911"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"26aacb521463" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46cf5d9b35e5"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"65831e3dc113" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d8a0c76376d"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"90bc8a7cd9df">
<td data-local-id=3D"235a35a21407" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"93c1c7ab91b1">3.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f591619a8924" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc9d9ecfdb5a"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"25ab29516dcd"><strong>I want to</strong> change daily withdr=
awal and deposit limit amounts for an individual account linked to a Visa d=
ebit card</p>
<p local-id=3D"e9e6ff519567"><strong>So that </strong>transactions performe=
d on that account will be controlled by custom limits entered.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"99555f6f254d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b52a33db23b2">Ability for core banking system to modify indi=
vidual daily withdrawal and deposit limits on an account linked to memberca=
rd.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f16a356d37fc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b85b7cb55096">Daily withdrawal limit<br>
Daily deposit limit</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"173c50cb764e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0a980b72668"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a2e949e6e195" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f53fddb8bbc5"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4eb0f866ab2a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ed18879c6bd"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"091151c0e862">
<td data-local-id=3D"1a1e74aff6e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd0c2ca75d78">3.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2dc9b8852b62" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d18c8e2d34f"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"1033a5fe6547"><strong>I want to</strong> modify the card sta=
tus assigned and applicable Status Reason where applicable to a visa debit =
card</p>
<p local-id=3D"b8a6b563a570"><strong>So that I</strong> can help manage the=
 usage of the Visa debit card.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4566f2db05a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d331d3fe4268">Ability for core banking system to modify a ca=
rd status as per business rules to control card usage. System user or Everl=
ink.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f958af84a12b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3835e9ef3309">1 - PIN Selection<br>
2- Active<br>
3 - Chip Only - Assigned by Everlink FAS (Fraud Alert System)<br>
4 - Closed<br>
5 - Hot Card - Assigned by DNA or by Everlink<br>
6 - Issued - When card issued by Everlink (ie Pin Mailer)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"42cdb85a2c8a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e92221da3fa9"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1616514aa500" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbc4c8bf6911"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"122d714becdc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c4460b8c810"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e7f8e88f6c70">
<td data-local-id=3D"6d953b77ea43" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7bcc084f538">3.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2013d5f1-5d13-4a56-93aa-31e9c7399382" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ee3503a9830"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ad94f0e4d1d7"><strong>I want to </strong>disable flash limit=
s on a Visa debit card</p>
<p local-id=3D"5b3f685adae9"><strong>So that </strong>a member will always =
have to complete POS purchases via chip and PINwhen their members card is p=
resented.&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"315d15ed0468" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"681d2cb58533">Ability for core banking system to disable fla=
sh limits (proximity capability) on a card.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9eade7c89b04" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9dd00d5b0ada">Update person agreement information by unticki=
ng box for proximity capability ON</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f689c4b6b2d6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7daa4d29b5a5"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0d8a414819b9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b06e528815a5"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd09778fe467" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e7e52df95cd"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f1aabfd0f2d3">
<td data-local-id=3D"0cfa139a5b96" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0dc3e36b282d">3.6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"970c3ea34a7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8bb458b9dd41"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"829261bdd52f"><strong>I want to</strong> disable Internation=
al and/or Online Purchases on a Visa debit card</p>
<p local-id=3D"656080c54952"><strong>So that </strong>the card will not all=
ow transactions outside of Canada or online CNP purchases.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"471d0627780e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"347a48addb78">Ability for core banking system to disable Vis=
a network transactions (eg International ATM/POS or CNP).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ab4fcce5ec1b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e35f843dfac3">Can this be supported?</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b2699e5a89c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1346c7335ee"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"27879c171e81" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"85183555a96d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a0f1bf963c2e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d105ab11e98"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b6752592fad3">
<td data-local-id=3D"46eb0255804a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe1b5237885e">3.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"31f348183f16" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6762c559b6c4"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c3dfdb1565a7"><strong>I want to</strong> help a member chang=
e the PIN on their existing Visa debit card</p>
<p local-id=3D"581f1b886cd6"><strong>So that</strong> they can successfully=
 complete transactions that require a PIN.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95f4cd780a3f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"884c69e94823">Ability for core banking system to set a new P=
IN on Visa card via ATM or Everlink Terminal.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4c8b61ed887b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9d3efc67f9f"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f727e2ffdcfc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e31d93164941"></p></td>
