<h3 local-id=3D"40b7b968454f" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-4.Clearing&amp;Settlement">4. Clearing &amp; Settlement</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-106505328" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-106505328" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-106505328" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"4000" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"ea0cc555-dc0a-4820-b612-379a5d72a3d1" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 85.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 307.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 243.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 218.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 66.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 63.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 50.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b0d59a040cb9">
<th data-local-id=3D"75c6f644c57f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a88d72518bb5"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5befaa065115" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ba189187faea"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a67f16ef4e33" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c50f67a574c6"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"5f3457664c63" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3c647fc8a8a7"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a699937f2031" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3877592b26f7"><strong>Owner/Teams</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0e435002d0df" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"1a734f02d017"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c0f4d52c0d4e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"eb59b68a5271"><strong>Jira</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"40dcd5ecee5b">
<td data-local-id=3D"f5fdbb6f17c4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c71b0b35dfc5">3.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bd0d7d05fbf4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb754d12e9dd"><strong>As a</strong> Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"7a4ec99bb7dd"><strong>I want </strong>to process Visa cleari=
ng files daily,</p>
<p local-id=3D"003b7d6d01c5"><strong>So that </strong>all Visa authorized t=
ransactions are fully reconciled.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"38be27a753e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"61dccbba8831">The core banking/settlement system must ingest=
 and process Visa clearing files daily to reconcile all Visa authorized tra=
nsactions.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"840417f5d3d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dedc7140f68a"><em><span data-colorid=3D"buznwy16bu">Need to =
confirm the below processes for successful clearing file</span></em><br>
1 - Verify the system successfully triggers the file ingestion process at t=
he scheduled daily time.<br>
2 - Verify that valid Visa files are fully parsed and status updates are re=
corded in the database.<br>
3 - Verify that 100% of matched authorized-to-cleared transactions are mark=
ed as "Reconciled".<br>
4 - Verify that any clearing record missing a corresponding authorization i=
s flagged and routed to an exception queue.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ddf9cdb58985" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b2a6e2294e49"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6b27f3fe8962" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1dd011182788"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"31eb05c4159c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0af832b2010"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"69860eaa34d7">
<td data-local-id=3D"304059528467" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da25f6eb71f0">3.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fe31a64eb934" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b2817ebd273"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"204e0c2fbc73"><strong>I want </strong>to remit the Daily Set=
tlement Amount to Visa on a daily basis,</p>
<p local-id=3D"ad31e1b8ac94"><strong>So that </strong>financial obligations=
 are met on time and account balances remain clear.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2410381d6f96" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"890afe2e2424">The core banking / settlement system must supp=
ort reconciliation and remittance to Visa on a daily basis the aggregate am=
ount of all net transactions by cardholders as specified on daily reports r=
eceived by Everlink (Daily Settlement Amount).</p>
<p local-id=3D"5858728a470c">Includes purchases, adjustments for returns, A=
TM withdrawals, cash advances, interest, fees and adjustments for chargebac=
ks</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3239001b5d9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"299649278966">Need to understand steps for successful comple=
tion of the settlement process after clearing has processed that considers =
all visa transactions. <br>
What are all the items that need to be matched for a particular transaction=
?</p>
<p local-id=3D"70d92c6abc81">Does the system log the unique transaction ID,=
 amount, timestamp, and status? <br>
Are there any settlement reports in addition to the connector reports that =
are maintained for audit?</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"10ddaaf5695f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0317ceaa9acb"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f3124149e47e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f4ad15fd3f6"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"64cebbf55cd2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbc6ed2ac435"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"24d06fb9c982">
<td data-local-id=3D"8689560b5463" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8690380fed4f">3.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bf5c3a7ef738" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e430fdb2b301"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"a3f11be0c0ef"><strong>I want </strong>a clear workflow proce=
ss to follow when settlement items fail or are unmatched,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c6c9f4654e9d"><strong>So that</strong> discrepancies can be =
easily identified in a timely manner and be corrected.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"138401c7f2de" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2cf470197aa1">The core banking / settlement system must supp=
ort failed/unmatched settlement items via controlled exception workflows/pr=
ocesses.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c136fd177934" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a4b3e4bc0d90">Any other failures or mismatches?</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"08efb45442c8">
<li local-id=3D"f9d4f972287c">
<p local-id=3D"c74264670e27">Authorization Expiration</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d92960d84e54">
<p local-id=3D"f13cf94ac279">Post Authorization Account Changes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1269a78ea20a">
<p local-id=3D"e9f931afb99d">Data mismatches in the capture file</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e4a4468a728a">
<p local-id=3D"44d17f7fecf2">Over Capturing (Amount Discrepancies)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"31e1595d1c24">
<p local-id=3D"dec6be98e76b">Asynchronous Banking Fraud Checks</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"860e47f1e9c7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7cb602b893a0"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"23a369fe3bf4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dbca465bc70e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cbcc49418b39" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b5af61e695f2"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1ac4f4d5e3e0">
<td data-local-id=3D"e91a1c8ddeeb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e38244bc9a9">3.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"30e928144470" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c62b9dd6bad"><strong>As a</strong> Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"1990bf317a10"><strong>I want </strong>to reconcile transacti=
ons between the core banking system and the connector reports,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5204924821a6"><strong>So that </strong>all transactions are =
balanced daily.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39e3d23374b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd1980c147e9">The core banking / settlement system data must=
 reconcile with connector reports and daily settlement calculations</p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"601e39b62903" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"791691f782b1">Need to understand how the connector reports a=
re used for settlement process.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"20f0e40dceb1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7df0f241a0f7"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4b343a91862e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec78f3d8972d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4867ab297363" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0afcd2f53a64"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c51dc5611fc1">
<td data-local-id=3D"04413657162a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4abbb44f6719">3.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5d0e76aedf29" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ac0bd010f89"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"ce0d0f506be7"><strong>I want </strong>the core banking syste=
m to automatically cross-reference daily settlement reports from both the V=
isa and Interac networks,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5da1be2f6e8a"><strong>So that</strong> duplicate co-badged t=
ransactions are cleared before a cardholder's account is debited.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2f8216fca08" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a2a032d3500">The core banking/settlement system must automa=
tically cross-reference daily settlement reports from both the Visa network=
 and Interac network to detect, isolate, and eliminate duplicate transactio=
n records prior to ledger posting.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"023f3da7d6a0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62ffdc4de34a">How are duplicate records handled? Is the belo=
w something that is done?</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"cb85db62871d">
<li local-id=3D"f89520b32938">
<p local-id=3D"1f18042681c5">The system must automatically fetch or ingest =
settlement files daily for both Visa and Interac.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a56633c1718">
<p local-id=3D"e242419c31f7">The system must flag a duplicate transaction w=
hen a record in the Visa report matches a record in the Domestic report bas=
ed on:Same PAN (Primary Account Number) or token equivalent.Same Transactio=
n Amount (in billing currency).Same Acquirer Institution ID and Merchant ID=
.Same Transaction Date and Time .Same Retrieval Reference Number (RRN) or A=
uthorization Code.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"456e2ec0b1e4">
<p local-id=3D"97871ee9dbe3">Flagged duplicate records must be automaticall=
y moved to a temporary isolation queue.Ledger Protection: Isolated duplicat=
es must be strictly blocked from posting to the cardholder account ledger.A=
lerting: The system must generate an automated alert to the Reconciliation =
Operations team with a summary of the isolated records.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a1f915b71533">
<p local-id=3D"73e182dfbbda">The system must apply standard business priori=
ty rules (e.g., matching the original authorization network path) to select=
 the valid "gold" record for ledger posting.Purge/Drop: The duplicate count=
erpart must be marked as "Eliminated - Duplicate Path" and archived for aud=
it purposes.Audit Trail: Every eliminated record must retain a hard link to=
 the successful record that was actually posted.</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9f2d32108b01" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"84046c7776e0"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a4e7afd8f903" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"715d7f2d274d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fad66f2b33ca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b9c7080f528"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2d183f6abf1b">
<td data-local-id=3D"2ca64aac8170" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ffe28737b47">3.6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"69808b31b083" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2586c399dac4"><strong>As a</strong> Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"cac40fffd755"><strong>I want </strong>the core banking syste=
m to capture the correct transaction timestamp regardless of settlement rep=
orting window</p>
<p local-id=3D"187f145c7cfe"><strong>So that </strong>the correct transacti=
on details are maintained for audit.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"75582190c239" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"86a2aef248b9">The core banking / settlement system must capt=
ure correct transaction timestamp regardless of Visa settlement cut-off rep=
orting window.</p>
<p local-id=3D"adc135c9c79f">Visa transactions settled daily within Visa se=
ttlement window: 6:00am EST to 6:00am EST<br>
Domestic network settlement processing follows the Everlink settlement wind=
ow: 9pm EST to 8:59:59pm EST</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7c0624c1f4df" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"981379a3dd1a"><strong>1 - Transaction performed within settl=
ement window</strong><br><strong>Given</strong> a visa transaction debited =
a member account on 2am on Jun 1<br><strong>When</strong> the Jun 1 settlem=
ent report is received by the core banking system<br><strong>Then</strong> =
the transaction maintains the processing date of Jun 1 and will be included=
 on Jun 1 settlement report.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cca29df599fd"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"454bbcfe-b250-4802-aa7a-034f8fa340eb">
<p local-id=3D"fd090a95061d"><strong>2 - Transaction performed outside of s=
ettlement window</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>a visa transaction debi=
ted a member account on 6am on Jun 1<br><strong>When </strong>the Jun 2 set=
tlement report is received by the core banking system<br><strong>Then</stro=
ng> the transaction maintains the processing date of Jun 1 and will be incl=
uded on Jun 2 settlement report.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7db1652024f1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24aefc7c23e3"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fcb72630807f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"922ef3aae900"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41c4fc8d5c5d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"deb38e85f238"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f00352be56a">
<td data-local-id=3D"e010a93a06af" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0f7bd0a46981">3.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00ae9a4ecd73" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b01e3f1a7cc"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"b8f63501cd26"><strong>I want </strong>to trace settlement di=
screpancies to a single transaction record</p>
<p local-id=3D"8d745ca147d9"><strong>So that </strong>I can determine the c=
ause of an outage and know what needs to be corrected.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d1a692d2134" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5f0bd77007f6">The core banking system / settlement discrepan=
cies must be traceable to individual transaction records</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"465880fd03bc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"77b913f5ef5f">Need to understand the flow and all details re=
quired for a transaction. <br>
Must be reported within 2 days of discovery as per Visa Rules</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bea53b99a7d7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0815467ff96e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"14208f753b38" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"80724ab2f7b4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1f850ba10e9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3bea935fe398"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c433e4faedc5">
<td data-local-id=3D"cda49c65d743" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a2e80a9966e">3.8</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"721a729d0948" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"172a115036cb"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"0f7a550a42c9"><strong>I want</strong> to see all processed v=
isa transaction details</p>
<p local-id=3D"39e5dc68c1a6"><strong>So that </strong>I can confirm all fee=
s and FX conversion rates charged.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"48594391edf6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e3f7dc249a6">Everlink settlement connector reports must con=
firm transaction processing includes txn amounts, OIF amounts, ISA amounts,=
 Interchange shares, and DCC shares</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aa45c0123988" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b8e6bed8c10"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1cdaf4785d2f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ffa925ed094d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"66560bd77cbf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58b7458b3072"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a7abd0f90973" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b667240b496c"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e49466a53295">
<td data-local-id=3D"b6bc1e641c2f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f398ea2f8468">3.9</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"423cebc489f1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"49a12e72b495"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"81e03ddd5f61"><strong>I want</strong> to confirm the FX rate=
 and settlement amount for a transaction</p>
<p local-id=3D"751d27750047"><strong>So that </strong>I can confirm the acc=
uracy of the calculation.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3479abaa2fdc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d77a1ba6b33">The core banking / settlement system to displa=
y FX conversion rates and settlement amounts in order to reflect currency c=
onversion accuracy.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"309f08f8b8fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a2f188193a7">Need to note all places where this can be conf=
irmed. Individual txn in DNA and on connector reports.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"969819235f38" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6955a7f0fb92"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"75eadf4d1eae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7c41c4783f95"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f2b713a949eb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7674abae40ab"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e43eb25ba03c">
<td data-local-id=3D"8112cc6a5e73" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3a576e8dd66f">3.10</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bda8bcfc6aac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8adc244a4ba8"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"26e9038be65b"><strong>I want </strong>to review incoming Ori=
ginal Credit Tranasctions and Account Funding transactions</p>
<p local-id=3D"2531480c8057"><strong>So that </strong>the all necessary det=
ails are captured with the transactions and maintained for audit.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b490fd2c9e70" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"57d0c4e42ce6">The core banking / settlement system must supp=
ort incoming Original Credit Transactions (OCT) and Account Funding Transac=
tions (AFT) and preserves sender, beneficiary, and purpose data required fo=
r reporting obligations</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5f1967b74b02" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b0fadbce64f6">Need to confirm reporting on this</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a0d1a10a8016" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"54634cd4ab9e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"848ea63a20a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51296a6c3257"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8a0e5fda3a30" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de63ac0e2179"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"48403c23dabd">
<td data-local-id=3D"36f8228614af" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0dbf7756c16a">3.11</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"821c93e61857" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8ccf9cf2319"><strong>As a </strong>Payment Services User,</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"7152e4bdeb05"><strong>I want </strong>the settlement system =
to be able to maintain minimum settlement funds required to support cardhol=
der spending volumes</p>
<p local-id=3D"c3093f866670"><strong>So that</strong> I can ensure complian=
ce with settlement obligations with ICICI</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e39ac81a4b0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"23d877dfc742">The core banking/settlement system to support =
providing Everlink with Settlement Funds (settlement prepayment) on a month=
ly basis along with Settlement Top up and/or Customer reserve when required=
.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c484b68f8112" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ab9670a64b1"><strong>1 -Settlement Prepayment</strong><br><=
strong>Given</strong> Everlink has requested an amount required for the set=
tlement account (3 days of the estimated daily settlement amount) within 2 =
business days of the last day of every month<br><strong>When</strong> the f=
unds are depostied to the settlement account<br><strong>Then</strong> Everl=
ink will setup an AFT to process debit/credit adjustments on the 2nd Wed of=
 each month</p>
<hr local-id=3D"d44b5ab0-ea7e-4173-b1b5-c6a4ea786fa4">
<p local-id=3D"1cd2d416c879"><strong>2 -Settlement Prepayment Top Up</stron=
g><br><strong>Given</strong> Everlink has requested an amount required for =
the settlement account in addition to the settlement prepayment during time=
s of increased activity within 2 business days of the last day of every mon=
th<br><strong>When</strong> the funds are depostied to the settlement accou=
nt<br><strong>Then</strong> Everlink will setup an AFT to process debit/cre=
dit adjustments on the 2nd Wed of each month</p>
<hr local-id=3D"734d36b5-9311-485f-9a46-19b23e7ac923">
<p local-id=3D"c1e73d1c7ab7"><strong>3 -Customer Reserve</strong><br><stron=
g>Given</strong> Everlink has requested an amount determined by ICICI per i=
ssued Visa Debit cards in addition to the settlement prepayment within 2 bu=
siness days of the last day of every month<br><strong>When </strong>the fun=
ds are depostied to the settlement account<br><strong>Then</strong> Everlin=
k will setup an AFT to process debit/credit adjustments on the 2nd Wed of e=
ach month</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"44a86abcb2a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c18b3dace364"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cbb88a540d96" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8925fa266f2d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"736205848945" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62e30e620cfc"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2360c4ae5913">
<td data-local-id=3D"b83de3dd9083" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6e7816fe7ffc">3.12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ddffc1be3ac3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58c7754bb536"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4136f9ae7596" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc9bbb0c0275">Complete settlement audit trails maintained</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d5d5162a9632" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8fdf09b0f469"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7120ca26372c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37e4881d9690"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"12953cc84b7c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e332ddb25e5"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"668a13d26b2e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24b2f74c7349"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"a9eeade19099" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-5.Disputes&amp;Chargebacks">5. Disputes &amp; Chargebacks</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-428414622" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-428414622" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-428414622" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"4000" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"c221901c-462b-4d19-ac0b-60ba59eb410c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 93.0px;">
