<h2 local-id=3D"0a9c75e6ae58" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequirementsDocument:VisaDeb=
itCards-FunctionalRequirements-System"><img class=3D"emoticon emoticon-docu=
ments" data-emoji-id=3D"1f4c4" data-emoji-shortname=3D":page_facing_up:" da=
ta-emoji-fallback=3D"=F0=9F=93=84" src=3D"9a9c9a217a8fd81cca5bdf1a26cc546ae=
22f3380c87327e47daaecbed0a2ead8" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" data-emoticon-n=
ame=3D"documents" alt=3D"content.emoticon.documents"> Functional Requiremen=
ts - System</h2>
<div id=3D"expander-254446950" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-254446950" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"c07bcdf0ced7b4d9093bebfbefa7168e923321=
ffd7300a885255d320adb1d0df" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Functional Requirements &amp; Acceptance Criteria<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-254446950" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"4000" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"0de09be8-63a3-4646-be09-bf23283bbb7f" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 65.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 276.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 204.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 312.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 57.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 61.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 57.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2114b09ec8aa">
<th data-local-id=3D"c2d300665847" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"cc1cce5357e8"><strong>#</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"7500c12aa6ad" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9bee8ef611ce"><strong>User Story</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fb711b34ecbd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7f6b98f0b70e"><strong>Functional Requirement</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"1933648f6c57" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5bfa6cb01441"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1435f5794399" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"069177eba6ca"><strong>Owner/Team</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8a3622fb3404" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"36c7b8fb39e8"><strong>Priority</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a86106f8832e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"83827792fd3e"><strong>Jira</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"33d0caf7590d">
<td data-local-id=3D"69a52fe4df9a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c5ca87f82b4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b72d9b4df28a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b8adcb8f64df"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3435227a2118"><strong>I want to</strong> see the network use=
d to post a member transaction</p>
<p local-id=3D"935e63601e9e"><strong>So that I </strong>can know which proc=
edure to follow when when there is a distinction between the network that p=
rocessed the transaction (Interac vs Visa).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3c56d33e0189" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb0187a58b6c">Ability for core banking system to display the=
 network used to process a payment through a member account.</p>
<p local-id=3D"31fee0c31d7e">The Everlink payment system must route dual-ne=
twork transactions by automatically selecting the Interac network for all d=
omestic point-of-sale purchases. It must route to the Visa network for inte=
rnational transactions, card-not-present e-commerce orders, and instances w=
here the primary Interac network is unavailable.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0529688635ca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7612028b693d"><strong>1 - Domestic POS</strong><br><strong>G=
iven </strong>a transaction is initiated at a POS terminal in Canada and de=
bits a member account,<br><strong>When </strong>the transaction is viewed i=
n the account summary in DNA<br><strong>Then</strong> the transaction detai=
ls will show Interac in the network field.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"8dfc958d-d429-441a-bafd-1f474482cf14">
<p local-id=3D"43ec36bb56e2"><strong>2 - Domestic ATM</strong><br><strong>G=
iven</strong> a transaction is initiated at an ATM in Canada and debits a m=
ember account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the ac=
count summary in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the transaction details will=
 show Interac in the network field.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"02874c48-decc-4c42-ab84-a5561b873d89">
<p local-id=3D"3a2b3aab9ec2"><strong>3 - Card-Not-Present (CNP) - Online/eC=
ommerce</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>a transaction is initiated on an=
 e-commerce website (domestic or international) and debits a member account=
,<br><strong>When</strong> the transaction is viewed in the account summary=
 in DNA,<br><strong>Then</strong> the transaction details will show Visa in=
 the network field.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"4e979582-890e-4c6c-a664-bcdf2d56b8c1">
<p local-id=3D"118e823c9c2e"><strong>4 - International POS</strong><br><str=
ong>Given </strong>a transaction is initiated at a POS terminal outside of =
Canada and debits a member account,<br><strong>When</strong> the transactio=
n is viewed in the account summary in DNA,<br><strong>Then </strong>the tra=
nsaction details will show Visa in the network field.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"9959f331-94d1-494f-a837-218a129c8528">
<p local-id=3D"d8522119ff6b"><strong>5 - International ATM</strong><br><str=
ong>Given</strong> a transaction is initiated at an ATM outside of Canada,<=
br><strong>When </strong>the transaction is processed by the system,<br><st=
rong>Then</strong> the transaction details will show Visa PLUS ATM in the n=
etwork field.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"59b1d4dd8665" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9262653d889"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c31b238b3639" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da5136802190"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1009d80265ff" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b46a4707b7a"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1815725c2eee">
<td data-local-id=3D"2c2140417d87" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"adbe22df08cd"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3aecafcd9a8a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2499935fe300"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8977c10b0660"><strong>I want to </strong>view understand the=
 real time authorization messages returned for different account statuses,<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"96f6a0ef9487"><strong>So that</strong> I can ensure transact=
ions are approved or declined as expected.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a48398371d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3657724b3865">Ability for core banking system to confirm the=
 status of an account to authorize or decline a visa routed transaction in =
real time using authorization request 100.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a89e56b8e0c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cd2c227d895a"><strong>1 - Active Account</strong><br><strong=
>Given </strong>an account has an active status with no lockout flags and a=
vailable funds,</p>
<p local-id=3D"313bd72f457d"><strong>When </strong>an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b6004b4f8de1"><strong>Then</strong> the system will approve =
the authorization of the transaction and debit the member account.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"a4f83489-7970-4489-99e1-a0f2c703d5d5">
<p local-id=3D"bfd8e67bb0b5"><strong>2 - Closed Account</strong><br><strong=
>Given </strong>an account has a closed status,</p>
<p local-id=3D"94925115c605"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b278f769d81a"><strong>Then </strong>the system will decline =
the transaction with the appropriate code for a closed account and there wi=
ll be no transaction posted from the member account.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"3fb94d58-d6e2-4d24-9a83-da9ca17005e8">
<p local-id=3D"10a57efa69fe"><strong>3 - Lockout Flag</strong> <em>(need to=
 confirm behaviour)</em><br><strong>Given</strong> an account has a lockout=
 flag (eg no debits permitted) and available funds,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c297cd8b07de"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"65013bc55ce6"><strong>Then </strong>the system will decline =
the transaction with the appropriate code and there will be no transaction =
posted from the member account.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0292a6e0-aca9-42ce-b676-f336cf26b224">
<p local-id=3D"c8c4b7fb7ead"><strong>4 - Dormant Account</strong> <em>(need=
 to confirm behaviour)</em><br><strong>Given</strong> an account is dormant=
 and available funds,</p>
<p local-id=3D"bc315396df1f"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c1c205f5c391"><strong>Then </strong>the system will decline =
the transaction with the appropriate code and there will be no transaction =
posted from the member account.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7873ca67a31e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5cdd2f3fb6e4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f452085c95dc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a42d72a16b28"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8db71423657" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c3b3ce7a51ff"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f7906fc9ea44">
<td data-local-id=3D"4b283bc7ed5c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35870d9e88c4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a3877c95730" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01b51601481d"><strong>As a </strong>DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"93ffd998bdb7"><strong>I want to</strong> ensure available ba=
lance is calculated correctly for transaction authorizations</p>
<p local-id=3D"3f6bcbf4ed47"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm transac=
tions will not be declined when funds are available.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"90fdc2b7ffc0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"646765a024d7">Ability for core banking system to confirm the=
 available balance of an account to authorize or decline a visa routed tran=
saction in real time (including existing cheque, account,card, ATM holds, o=
verdraft logic).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8036dfbd8b74" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b158be28ca85"><strong>1 - Funds available - no other holds p=
resent</strong><br><strong>Given</strong> account status is active and fund=
s available to cover the transaction request,</p>
<p local-id=3D"07fe53e222fd"><strong>When </strong>an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2dd507aed610"><strong>Then</strong> the system will approve =
the authorization of the transaction and debit the member account.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"24acfe31-d9c4-4899-80f2-c855bedd740d">
<p local-id=3D"6c3eddab2cd6"><strong>2 - Funds available - other holds pres=
ent</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>account status is active and funds a=
re available to cover the transaction and other holds currently active on a=
ccount,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2461ae55b0a8"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,an authorization requ=
est is received,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c79a7af25f50"><strong>Then </strong>the system will approve =
the authorization of the transaction and debit the member account.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c6774f79-97a3-44b2-8c26-0bb4a45c673c">
<p local-id=3D"b405e68f27ab"><strong>3 - Funds available - SAOD funds</stro=
ng><br><strong>Given</strong> account status is active and funds available =
using SAOD limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"19a7b9ef36ec"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"17df6b0fe588"><strong>Then </strong>the system will approve =
the authorization of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"13c9c9a7-2ad7-4830-b69d-9fa837f88f63">
<p local-id=3D"643b5e25f770"><strong>4 - Funds unavailable - no holds prese=
n</strong>t<br><strong>Given</strong> account status is active and funds ar=
e unavailable and no holds are currently active on account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b67dcaf28dfe"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"acdf05bf7a2e"><strong>Then</strong> the system will decline =
the authorization of the transaction.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"16a1e392-c671-4435-bed6-35cfe5499303">
<p local-id=3D"edf96879133c"><strong>5 - Funds unavailable - other holds pr=
esent</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>account status is active and funds=
 are unavailable due to holds currently active on account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"44bfdebba99e"><strong>When</strong> an authorization request=
 100 is sent to DNA from the Everlink payment gateway,</p>
<p local-id=3D"63cd4d1ed3e6"><strong>Then</strong> the system will decline =
the authorization of the transaction.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be76960aad46" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf8bf2289a1a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41a5d7805477" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f8b02ae9702"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5afc24a6f95f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"939f6092d180"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8da4abd9c033">
<td data-local-id=3D"c703d8ace8e1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e916a1ccb758"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e9e06facc759" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2777fbbf8e84"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"3396cdcb2a9e"><strong>I want to </strong>see holds placed on=
 an account after a transaction has been authorized (pending),</p>
<p local-id=3D"d831e293444a"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm funds w=
ill be held until the transaction settles.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f6db801de054" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f225fdb08992">Ability for core banking system to place an im=
mediate hold on funds for Visa-routed transactions that are authorized (pen=
ding).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0d1cc99487f0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"740c12c860a0"><strong>1 - CNP Online - transaction authorize=
d</strong><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction initiated via the Visa n=
etwork is authorized by DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"9e873c65fd1f"><strong>When</strong> the account management h=
olds section is viewed in DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8bdd4e53ff6d"><strong>Then</strong> the system places a hold=
 on the account for an amount equal to the transaction authorization and th=
e account is NOT debited.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"d17d7e80-a57a-463c-a428-431d44fbb052">
<p local-id=3D"2d9060c3b0ed"><strong>2 - Preauthorization Gas/Hotel - trans=
action authorized</strong><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction initiate=
d via the Visa network is authorized by DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7f1d4398eb63"><strong>When</strong> the account management h=
olds section is viewed in DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"708f84368b1e"><strong>Then </strong>the system places a hold=
 on the account for an amount equal to the transaction authorization and th=
e account is NOT debited.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"35a7af6b-5fcc-4db0-896c-7d3e6998fb71">
<p local-id=3D"5b4ded5f422b"><strong>3 - CNP Online - transaction declined<=
/strong><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction initiated via the Visa net=
work online is declined,</p>
<p local-id=3D"91261d80eddf"><strong>When</strong> the account management h=
olds section is viewed in DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"dcf47bf90355"><strong>Then</strong> the system takes no acti=
on and no hold is placed for the transaction amount that is declined and th=
e account is NOT debited.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6046ebaf-0c42-4c4e-ab7b-d9fedb412b0a">
<p local-id=3D"97ee9057dcf8"><strong>4- Preauthorization - transaction decl=
ined</strong><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction initiated via Interac=
 at a Gas Pump is declined,</p>
<p local-id=3D"6ca1d3e2cc22"><strong>When</strong> the account management h=
olds section is viewed in DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7a47741df0b6"><strong>Then</strong> the system takes no acti=
on and no hold is placed for the transaction amount that is declined and th=
e account is NOT debited.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e71ceae9d645" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa4053308043"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ae458420ee0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bdd46ebec6c9"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c221e4f0693e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37ebcc09e8b7"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c5568b22f62f">
<td data-local-id=3D"d199be10e51f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d0e518fee256"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d903aa66d596" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a7077a21ca8"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e32c9d12769e"><strong>I want to</strong> see holds expired o=
n an account after a transaction has been reversed or the transaction doesn=
't settle the account,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d932463d4ed1"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm the hol=
d is no longer active and the available balance has been restored.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4b3a4a44561c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"63606390c34a">Ability for core banking system to support par=
tial, full and automatic time-based hold reversals when a merchant cancels =
or fails to clear a transaction within standard clearing windows (typically=
 3 business days for retail, up to 30 days for car rentals).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"68dd4834f24a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f92b9e129c2e"><strong>1 - Partial Reversal</strong><br><stro=
ng>Given</strong> the system has placed an initial estimated hold on a memb=
er account reducing the available balance by the same amount,</p>
<p local-id=3D"66b2677f7f58"><strong>When</strong> the final purchase amoun=
t ends up lower than the initial estimated hold</p>
<p local-id=3D"0eefff3f9d5f"><strong>Then </strong>the system releases only=
 the difference of the held funds back to the customer and the transaction =
is in pending status and no debit is posted from the account.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6c895ef4-fe59-42cb-9afe-695bea0607c3">
<p local-id=3D"d89fda824c29"><strong>2 - Full Reversal</strong><br><strong>=
Given</strong> a temporary hold has been placed on a member account for a t=
ransaction and the available balance reduced by the same amount,</p>
<p local-id=3D"29a1bd2244bd"><strong>When</strong> the merchant completely =
cancels the order or transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"cea11527d1d7"><strong>Then</strong> the system releases/expi=
res the full amount of the hold amount and the available balance is restore=
d by the transaction amount.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0c3994b7-def1-4590-b3d5-063ab2f79097">
<p local-id=3D"ef46fbe47a6f"><strong>3 - Automatic Time-Based Reversal</str=
ong> <em><span data-colorid=3D"ay6exoihkw">(is this supported?)</span></em>=
<br><strong>Given</strong> a temporary hold has been placed on a member acc=
ount for a transaction,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4e233799959e"><strong>When</strong> the merchant fails to cl=
ear or capture the transaction within the card network time limit,</p>
<p local-id=3D"cc23da5eaadc"><strong>Then</strong> the system drops the hol=
d automatically after a set number of days.</p>
<p local-id=3D"55785e774047"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"708c48c23d57" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a87d24ef7183"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"86bb2a580d4d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"03fccecaf70e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b77c5c80704a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ae843ab1497"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6d42c30bcd30">
<td data-local-id=3D"89549e0f93e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da5fd232d0ff"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc2bc0198954" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2897230b3750"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0f5f3695fc11"><strong>I want</strong> to see authorized recu=
rring transactions and pending authorizations settle through an account aft=
er Lock and Block has been enabled,</p>
<p local-id=3D"864934fe08f5"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm only fu=
ture transactions will be blocked for authorization on a member account.</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8396ef5ecaa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4dcb7adcdd86">Ability for core banking system to prevent the=
 cancellation of active, authorized pending charges when lock and block has=
 been enabled on a card.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4c35403b7715" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"21ad9696872f"><strong>1 - Online - approved recurring paymen=
t</strong><br><strong>Given</strong> a transaction for a recurring payment =
has been authorized for setup and lock and block has been enabled afterward=
s,</p>
<p local-id=3D"dc9d01bce2c5"><strong>When </strong>the transaction submitte=
d for future payment authorization,</p>
<p local-id=3D"47b222a7cddd"><strong>Then</strong> the payment is authorize=
d by DNA and will appear as a pending transaction for settlement from the a=
ccount.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"4228b0e7-b731-4a8f-b827-395c2ad872ca">
<p local-id=3D"4f35b17345f2"><strong>2 - Online - pending status</strong><b=
r><strong>Given</strong> a transaction for payment has been authorized in p=
ending status on an account and lock and block has then been enabled afterw=
ards,</p>
<p local-id=3D"fbdc3ef860d5"><strong>When</strong> the transaction is proce=
ssed for settlement in DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"de89548797a8"><strong>Then</strong> the payment is authorize=
d for settlement from the account and will appear as a hold in management h=
olds section.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d755838625f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e86f8fd69471"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"38ca7160ad17" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"823cfc6e8ba6"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b44da7cf6302" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"625bf6f59fee"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"120709b8ff5e">
<td data-local-id=3D"98a21792f3f9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"986d556b7d26"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5184734d6820" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb68e78bac41"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7cec162ed40e"><strong>I want to</strong> view available bala=
nce adjustments in real time when visa transactions are authorized,</p>
<p local-id=3D"06f3cb138271"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm availab=
le balance is accurate after each transaction.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73a99267df7d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4073d3c9ead1">Ability for core banking system to modify avai=
lable balance by subtracting the incoming authorization hold and pending de=
bit/credit amounts from the available balance in real time.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6fd06e93e3ca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ffb63f42d01d"><strong>1 - Authorized/Pending txn</strong></p=
>
<p local-id=3D"cd104e516e13"><strong>Given</strong> an account has an avail=
able balance to authorize an incoming transaction</p>
<p local-id=3D"9af0ee7605d1"><strong>When</strong> the transaction is autho=
rized(pending) in DNA</p>
<p local-id=3D"0af7d114c516"><strong>Then</strong> a hold is placed by the =
amount of the transaction and the available balance is reduced by the same =
amount.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"1b9526d5-26e5-4084-a954-0b36a476eace">
<p local-id=3D"f14f095ce98a">2- Account with SAOD<br>
3 - Account with holds<br>
4 - Settled txn<br>
5 - Expired/Reversed txn<br>
6 - Returned txn (confirm available balance increased. <br></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6da456dd4cea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7ea9ba80fd3"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa032c4a8867" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"099627cb9fe4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dcdf0377e207" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6cafe0fc8c24"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"10fca17c9cc9">
<td data-local-id=3D"79adb5300a71" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eb4c7aa06217"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39d004e7d706" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08b25ed4f0bf"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8f8a4a71c32f"><strong>I want to</strong> view a transaction =
move from a pending status to a settled status,</p>
<p local-id=3D"25703358a831"><strong>So that </strong>I can confirm the cur=
rent balance remains unchanged until the transaction is debited from the me=
mber account.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ec29ae15001f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76034c3eee80">Ability for core banking system to ensure the =
current balance of account remains unchanged until the formal settlement me=
ssage arrives.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b8c3f998b31c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e87c5514f205"><strong>1 - Card-Not-Present (CNP) - Online/eC=
ommerce</strong><br><strong>Given </strong>an online transaction is authori=
zed (pending) and available balance has been reduced by the same amount of =
the transaction and a hold placed and current balance remains unchanged, <b=
r><strong>When</strong> the settlement clearing is received for the transac=
tion,<br><strong>Then</strong> the transaction will be debited from the mem=
ber account which will increase the current balance and the hold will be re=
moved (increasing the available balance).</p>
<hr local-id=3D"f7f6de79-56d9-4d0f-8d45-0feb51a0a512">
<p local-id=3D"bf954a8b096b"><strong>2 - International POS</strong><br><str=
ong>Given </strong>an international POS transaction is authorized (pending)=
 and available balance has been reduced by the same amount of the transacti=
on and a hold placed and current balance remains unchanged, <br><strong>Whe=
n</strong> the settlement clearing is received for the transaction,<br><str=
ong>Then</strong> the transaction will be debited from the member account w=
hich will increase the current balance and the hold will be removed (increa=
sing the available balance).</p>
<hr local-id=3D"8e8dec17-e1a3-4955-86b4-4b32fac43473">
<p local-id=3D"b36aa6620e16"><strong>3 - International ATM</strong><br><str=
ong>Given</strong> an international ATM transaction is authorized (pending)=
 and available balance has been reduced by the same amount of the transacti=
on and a hold placed and current balance remains unchanged, <br><strong>Whe=
n</strong> the settlement clearing is received for the transaction,<br><str=
ong>Then</strong> the transaction will be debited from the member account w=
hich will increase the current balance and the hold will be removed (increa=
sing the available balance).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3d340ddb40f0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37b202c7f93b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f7a2980ee102" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46ebddc3c503"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9fed5ebec5c4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"431839ebc416"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d1d826e02579">
<td data-local-id=3D"8a16f6bbdb6c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"937ebe5805fb"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"849ce599ce55" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"964e348f6b32"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"b28f2f7e2716"><strong>I want to</strong> see a transaction e=
xceeding an available balance of an account be declined</p>
<p local-id=3D"e8693497561f"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm that mu=
ltiple transactions posted for authorization during a settlement period wil=
l reduce the available balance correctly.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f631ce3baa31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8c15946e8216">Ability for core banking system to deny subseq=
uent transaction attempts if the requested amount exceeds the newly adjuste=
d available balance.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9b9f08032db8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0476f26d8d9"><strong>1 - Multiple CNP pending transactions<=
/strong><br><strong>Given</strong> one or more transactions are authorized =
in pending status and have reduced the available balance by the transaction=
 amounts and a hold placed,</p>
<p local-id=3D"e87b7607233f"><strong>When</strong> a subsequent CNP transac=
tion that exceeds the current available balance is requested by the payment=
 system for authorization,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c1ba93a16159"><strong>Then</strong> the system will send a d=
ecline message and the transaction will not appear as a pending transaction=
 and no hold will be placed by DNA.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f366070618aa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29fc9e9e76b4"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f90578eaed1e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9bc8df0cbf73"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"94be08d9aaab" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3511df220492"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c1b70302d5d7">
<td data-local-id=3D"09b5630c2001" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31de9ea01735"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0c6de94a8f8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"50327080cafb"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"d0baac449ac0"><strong>I want to</strong> see a transaction e=
xceeding an available balance of an account be declined.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ddf4be73cbac"><strong>So that</strong> I can confirm that mu=
ltiple transactions posted for authorization during a settlement period wil=
l reduce the available balance correctly.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5d45557d3035" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6afba7cef5fe">Ability for core banking system to support par=
tial approvals: Permit a partial authorization hold up to the max available=
 balance if the account cannot cover the full amount requested by the merch=
ant.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8a6187765c6f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74a44df64e11">Partial approval for available funds and hold =
placed, the balance of the transaction can be covered by other methods. <br=
><span data-colorid=3D"wciybx4khb">Need to confirm if this functionality ev=
en exists from Everlink. </span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1ad4f63b9793" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b29190966d54"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"82c22f916e69" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cc89159ad90e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"142303ba7070" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a00d26e2c702"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"84958bf44693">
<td data-local-id=3D"1b8cf32548c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"043d03a17e0c"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"383db3284530" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3e9afd9b9e4"><strong>As a</strong> DNA User,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2167895c9023"><strong>I want to</strong> see a Visa transact=
ion authorization request when the core banking system is offline</p>
<p local-id=3D"3fa1aac5a3ea"><strong>So that I</strong> can confirm the tra=
nsaction will be declined.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d0cabbfb495c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"39d5a4c61633">Ability for core banking system to support bot=
h Interac stand-in authorization and Visa stand-in authorization limits whe=
n banking host (DNA) is offline.</p>
<p local-id=3D"61fa581bbfe8">Visa limits are set to zero.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e15a9031ed1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b4e97cfed13"><strong>1 - Visa Stand In Processing</strong><=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"cabf7e0cdcb3"><strong>Given </strong>the banking host (DNA) =
is offline and a transaction is initiated via the Visa network for any tran=
saction amount,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4e76de33cc05"><strong>When</strong> a transaction is submitt=
ed for approval via the payment gateway to DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c721c842c100"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is autom=
atically declined and no transaction is submitted for store and forward pro=
cessing.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5265a024-e06c-40c9-ba34-09e9ec0a7435">
<p local-id=3D"b24ed03c3611"><strong>2- Interac Stand In Processing</strong=
> (within offline limits)</p>
<p local-id=3D"88510d3a328e"><strong>Given </strong>the banking host (DNA) =
is offline and a transaction is initiated via the Interac network for an am=
ount within offline limits as per DNA card limits,</p>
<p local-id=3D"43c95e32bcaf"><strong>When</strong> a transaction is submitt=
ed for approval via the payment gateway to DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5d85bc9c1aaa"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is appro=
ved and submitted for store and forward processing.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"68d40821-7ea5-4668-b9df-b329dd8f3509">
<p local-id=3D"428e925d81b5"><strong>3 - Interac Stand In Processing</stron=
g> (exceeds offline limits)</p>
<p local-id=3D"0bb3af6ba0f3"><strong>Given </strong>the banking host (DNA) =
is offline and a transaction is initiated via the Interac network for an am=
ount that exceeds offline limits as per DNA card limits,</p>
<p local-id=3D"4d5f2d7ba081"><strong>When</strong> a transaction is submitt=
ed for approval via the payment gateway to DNA,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c632f00222b2"><strong>Then</strong> the transaction is decli=
ned and no transaction is submitted for store and forward processing.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0db7d20c3fc2"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5382e0c004ea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d459bc409744"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ea6da78e7710" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a00d835bc26d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d980dd3964e5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6ac37c58cb2"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8a663a946d42">
<td data-local-id=3D"efd7811d234b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a69c545b93d6"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d1e0d073d6f4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"453b895caab1"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7c1f3b2ddd85" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"edb34ada73f7">Ability to support the mandatory ISO standard =
8 digit bank identification numbers (BIN)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e92fdc83510c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a61128847f78">Ensure log files support both 6 digit BIN and =
8 digit BIN</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8b14518db6c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4885bcb03c15"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"21a77c3d21fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"451442d5af69"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6028a87b6e3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b3746637551"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
