<p local-id=3D"9d0dacb94344">2.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"df31a804-8799-4a20-a6c9-b0ea6c5799d7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e98f4f547035">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6d174284-4f5f-42b6-85a0-9e1eb9689ed1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4154a08c3ee7">Protect all cardholder data (including PAN and=
 personal data/PII) from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure across all=
 components and must be encrypted at rest and in transit using industry-sta=
ndard protocols (eg AES-256 and TLS 1.3).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6c62c631-d8e1-449e-8511-7631b885fb52" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62669cc54f97"><em>100% PCI compliance</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17f71139-d088-4930-8ac3-d84bced3f201" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ad4e26e11e1c"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"537ed42c-b5e7-4ed0-9c25-b23aa0a523ba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0f6010245e7"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2dca5f5f-7054-4227-95b6-02ad3eecf8fa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4617bda04fbc"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"637bfb16bbb6">
<td data-local-id=3D"465b050c8d0e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b3fb3e4ada9">2.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"238b7c91cf3d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"293aad4135f6">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"226528f347ea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9d4d12a7b1c">All online PIN transactions (including PLUS) a=
re to be protected end to end<br>
using TDES encryption. Online PINs are to be decrypted and encrypted using =
double length keys with<br>
TDES between Visa and the Issuer=E2=80=99s Host.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41bd87cda338" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26306fdd7f90"><em>100% encryptio</em>n</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"65321bedddb0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc0e0935b1b8">Everlink</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8ca1f1dadfc5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9e36e0296675"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4e68462a988b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3bfb1b270ab2"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c833d77455cd">
<td data-local-id=3D"f763357114e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"988f547e6d1a">2.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c468f7d50f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37e77ae5f73a">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7979467a-216a-4e73-ba0e-746c4448a198" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"89d2215e1126">Scoring Master Engine Files (SEMF) securely ex=
changed with processor to support AVS verification</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"83c9fc291367" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8db531fd0dd5"><em>100% successful daily file exchange with n=
o data loss</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"82000559a1f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29b6f97d53fe"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ec0571c50cc7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f6146618b74"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73dc80736c26" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32975ec9c4fa"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"45c81d093b99">
<td data-local-id=3D"4801ca8219d3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b84435ea415">2.5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d02c0f6b1938" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cda95af7e2d0">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2b3e2cae15d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d644d7a2f943">Visa Consumer Authentication Service (VCAS) - =
3D Secure Authentication for one-time passwords (SMS or Email) must utilize=
 encrypted channels with short expiration windows.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f7b6419af8b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"626ac9cac2e3"><em>Typically 2 to 5 minutes</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9e4c495fb1cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb578f782d16"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a3e6c8ea4b2a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9943e0e3e47"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e7f8a55013c8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2652ddecfd3e">Requires setup of SEMF file which shares custo=
mer data between merchant checkout and issuer when a OTP is required.</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cf2d0491ad58">
<td data-local-id=3D"e1f233c68f97" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b3f4b614aca">2.6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd4e88a36817" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e6488bcd8f9">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fcb533281489" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a3bdbf90168">Access to cardholder data must be restricted t=
o authorized individuals with defined business need</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c63e6afbfbfc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"19389c99cf88"><em>100% role-based access enforcement</em></p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0fd4a1acf478" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b5b5de1d76b"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ce55bc622e00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"be8d76c9ced8"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"02e920419239" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb7c226f5950"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3ebb495889d2">
<td data-local-id=3D"13ceedb2139b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ccb4e00f9394">2.7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ef94fe670ab8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"65b8aea9e47d">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9daa48308a78" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f8bd080e4820">Cardholder data is only to be used for process=
ing transactions and fulfilling program obligations</p></td>
