<td data-local-id=3D"83092f5588e8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd386299ba39">Cardholder Data Protection</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"94314680a345" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9fcea7a5aadb">The Card Issuer must not store or retain the C=
ard Verification Value (CVV2, iCVV, or dCVV) in any persistent storage medi=
um, log file, database, dump file, or cache after the completion of the tra=
nsaction authorization process.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"310a6e04-1132-49d3-a70f-51c20eed7fb2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1fc38647ee99"><em>100% PCI compliance</em></p></td>
