<td data-local-id=3D"7163332a2564" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c2054c2a2d19">System must support enrollment of Visa Consume=
r Alerts (transaction alert service) by ensuring any data transmitted is ma=
sked and any stored information on reports are encrypted.</p></td>
