nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f86063d5cb61">Network must correctly trigger stand-in proces=
sing when issuer is unavailable.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cfcf167b1e18">Visa Network: Visa stand-in txns processed und=
er zero-dollar limits default to decline behavior.<br>
Interac Network: Interac stand-in txns processed as per limits set in CAF f=
ile.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72878018-fb24-4b24-baea-69d9b391bca8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3d8e33c7fe23"><em>100% correct fallback activation</em></p><=
