<td data-local-id=3D"d9dbfac9a046" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31c8f7f061b3"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"aeed9a766cc9">
<td data-local-id=3D"47c7931f9cad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"beea087e407b">3.12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2146c7a93ee0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f8e99bb8b4c">Retry &amp; Timeout Handling</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ced4056f30fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"73b71728707c">Authorization requests must prevent duplicate =
transactions/charges during network retries/timeouts</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2510ab51cb7c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08a11b3f8d3f"><em>0 duplicate financial postings caused by r=
etries/timeouts</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dab061cf5abd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"20c2a385b634"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6f8d6daa043b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8348f7c6025d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3a6c61e42c2a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d17a8baaddc2"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3a42ceb5cd20">
<td data-local-id=3D"5b4554549dc5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb2669a48623">3.13</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"103d48144379" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b3702724fc02">Retry &amp; Timeout Handling</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"14f176b35446" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3cbf89c14d53">During network timeouts, authorization request=
s must timeout gracefully and return deterministic outcome</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e7024195365e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf1ec1d9a36d"><em>100% of timed-out transactions return a de=
terministic response generated within =E2=89=A4 5 seconds</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5f955a427cf5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04dfa769d5bb"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"28bf8dd4a76d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1bd3c95f2b0a"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be0a1efff983" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"027141731f7c"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b8f7132b68e7">
<td data-local-id=3D"4b3bca3c2f5f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6e937564892b">3.14</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39f5e5bbb2d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"069be180972f">Real-Time Transaction Routing</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"32cdc273a611" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"669b7acc2df9">Responses processed in real-time, including ro=
uting between VisaNet, Everlink, and issuer host systems</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fda40aa5c970" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd9292b52567"><em>=E2=89=A5 99% of transactions processed wi=
thin SLA (=E2=89=A4</em>10s for POS and Visa Direct, <em>=E2=89=A4</em>25s =
for ATM cash disburement <em>)</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f4cd76345763" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"02a71b8ea4de"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b460eaacc759" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3139ae6db2c9"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e1206aeb0647" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c692ef65c0e"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"22a730aa44bd">
<td data-local-id=3D"07fe2f49e474" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9b690686f4b">3.15</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"85cd1355c9fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2769ac323058">Real-Time Transaction Processing</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c3cc01766160" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a08c46fe42f8">System must ingest, clear, and process cardhol=
der payments from Visa Debit co-badged issuers on personal accounts, ensuri=
ng that ledger balances across all affected personal accounts are updated a=
fter authorization.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e710856623bd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e56c3f494133">&lt;2 seconds for balance updates (except Visa=
 Direct credits)<br>
&lt;30 minutes for Visa Direct credits</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"095da8455f4c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29e1da3486d9"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dde5907d5224" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df10a030c9a2"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6be0fed13033" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc020e2cf187"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bb026049c3b0">
<td data-local-id=3D"79336226d79b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e48e1e0529e8">3.16</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d2f710e73f3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da0f382041a6">Real-Time Alerts</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8edee939b1fc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e542d99fc3c3">System must support enrollment of Visa Consume=
r Alerts (transaction alert service). Notifications are delivered via SMS i=
n near real time.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"357fbb9f595e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c54961398a99">=E2=89=A5 99.99% network uptime<br>
=E2=89=A5 95% of alerts initiated within SLA (e.g., &lt;2 seconds)</p></td>
