<td data-local-id=3D"5473133d69c7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f8f79ae8e09">Real-Time Dual Routing</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b4871e58eb63" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e192d17b90f2">System authorization engines must distinguish =
traffic to decide if a transaction goes to Interac (domestic POS) or Visa (=
