<p local-id=3D"dcd4d6d4d6e2">5.1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"52d9dacb-f295-46d2-bb25-a0a4f8dc3471" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47cf07272708">Maintenance</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5cb79b52-8cae-439d-8b9b-c94a64831823" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2c8085025d4">Implement a modular architecture (independent =
services / components) which allows for independent updates to individual c=
apabilities without requiring modifications / code changes to unrelated bus=
iness capabilities</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e9d1cace-4da4-4394-91a3-d53bb9cd3ada" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d91c70c0bdd0"><em>100% capabilities deployed as independent =
services / components</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6ddcadc6-e5ec-427f-beb8-8ef8b36e4448" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
