<td data-local-id=3D"dacfd129-ca6a-4bff-939d-0b341bd266f6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c3624cffb1e7"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f73856aa-82e9-490c-804d-79a83ca7f533">
<td data-local-id=3D"4e4d144d-4bea-451f-a59e-b3664be18ad0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd042d569622">5.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ff54a81f-a87e-4f00-a3b3-787e24373c3d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"59e46e7e9a7f">Maintenance</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a3307db-c2d8-4b6f-bd1f-6a28a0328d75" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b1422ab38fcb">Configuration-driven business rules allow admi=
n functions (such as card limits, transaction controls, fraud thresholds, a=
lerts) to be configurable via administrative settings without requiring cod=
e deployment / application restart</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0947fa19-3256-402a-b2f4-375c8ebe2131" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"864a430bc4c8"><em>100% of defined business rules can be modi=
fied via config settings</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0c178b72-00dc-453c-a03f-b77cfae82917" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ecb4f51ae37e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6140ec13-5b30-4a56-bdae-95711d3da0b8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"173a24285502"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eabfc517-feda-408c-8fa7-ea6695e23982" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3c4379d96c84"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"84f2a7b6-4718-4318-b7b5-0a65d355b362">
<td data-local-id=3D"884e2920-e3cf-4d2b-ad6c-96b3c6577250" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f157673db045">5.3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a4b43555-2c86-4a3b-88d8-33c37ed36d73" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"693012f34943">Scale</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a0f723e7-90ee-4658-b4a3-0225911738b2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14986d259bf9">Platform must support transaction volume growt=
h over and above currently-forecasted peak transaction loads, while maintai=
ning agreed service levels, without requiring substantial application re-de=
sign - in support of future membership growth along with increased card ado=
ption and usage</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"78acd60e-7f46-4e8a-a1e1-79771390a5bd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dfb020a688d2"><em>Minimum 3x higher than current forecasted =
peak transaction volume is supported</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2bb8f49-3927-4dd2-a616-73d1540441a7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96ac45c2d8c9"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c30877a6-c72b-4af4-823c-41ce924e9dd9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32d9e9926db0"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0c43b1f9-1f62-4004-ab73-836397acaf8e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b978137e4c2f"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"745ea0a1033c">
<td data-local-id=3D"076477c58e74" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3b889c5c731">5.4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f1b1a7643d33" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51600680e1fd">Scale</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7837e6704242" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32d72e57ed57">Platform must support horizontal scaling of ap=
plication instances without requiring code modifications or service interru=
ptions, to accommodate future growth and enable efficient infrastructure ex=
pansion</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"400cb1e06fe1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f1a2ecb0ad8"><em>Application instances can be increased by =
minimum 10x via horizontal scaling</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7fb07ce9a70c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42432625e526"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e4817c2656c9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5896c2311c17"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51d176058a9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
