nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cd07febf0a54">All member-facing interfaces, communications, =
and card designs ('look and feel') must follow Beem=E2=80=99s established d=
esign standards, terminology, and branding guidelines to provide a predicta=
ble and aligned user experience</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"78e6e172-3411-4200-a08e-1d5332c24a0e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
