el=E2=80=99 items are aligned with Beem standards</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b0b576fc-ac43-428f-b009-57f52743e42c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a40969f8730"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"972afe5b-88b9-4a28-9367-c0ee1873695e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c37bb50e3c45"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7c4ff370-93ec-4b99-83f2-1d12a4ef6c4d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52439eac92d8"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e55c71d3a4e6">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce210e50b10e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"07c784caa12d">6.2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8cbf65bf358f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb18eedd6579">Accessibility / Ease of Use</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f70913243cf9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7c1afc24dda6">All written card-related information (mailers,=
 card collateral, messages, disclosures, alerts, instructions, etc) must us=
e plain language that is easy to understand</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a16b02728096" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8871baa3ce77"><em>100% of member-facing written content achi=
eves an English-language high school reading level or lower</em></p></td>
