<h2 local-id=3D"91bd67ce-a417-43ed-abc0-79ce1f9e5e50" id=3D"PRD|ProductRequ=
irementsDocument:VisaDebitCards-Data,Metrics,&amp;Telemetry"><img class=3D"=
emoticon emoticon-bar_chart" data-emoji-id=3D"1f4ca" data-emoji-shortname=
=3D":bar_chart:" data-emoji-fallback=3D"=F0=9F=93=8A" src=3D"126f92fc414a66=
04c067914a4adab60e78c79ec589f6c457e623d998536b3b35" width=3D"16" height=3D"=
16" data-emoticon-name=3D"bar_chart" alt=3D"content.emoticon.bar_chart"> Da=
ta, Metrics, &amp; Telemetry</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6458558e9ed2">To measure success and health of the product /=
 project, we will measure the following metrics / KPIs categorized as:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"a8843ec4-f64f-4d28-bc05-56f4c66103b6">
<li local-id=3D"48042932-2de8-4833-a95a-3919a114dbd9">
<p local-id=3D"3dc4d6901fa6"><strong>North Star</strong> - the overarching =
definition of success for the product</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b36ac6d-2214-4457-bd63-b3bf2554aa5b">
<p local-id=3D"2df3a8037530"><strong>Customer KPI </strong>- to evaluate me=
mber satisfaction with the card</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b14d521a-a56f-4f6f-b251-771de831c0ee">
<p local-id=3D"e826b586ff33"><strong>Product KPI</strong> - to evaluate the=
 product performance in terms of activation, engagement, and retention</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"bab8607f-022e-4a55-a199-d4f08b01aa6e">
<p local-id=3D"089a5d2ef404"><strong>Financial KPI</strong> - to evaluate t=
he financial performance and viability of the product</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ac343e6-69e8-40a1-be17-67dfefab75f4">
<p local-id=3D"b6f1e9d511a8"><strong>Guardrails </strong>- to ensure that p=
roduct is within the acceptable allowances of risk, regulatory, and operati=
onal performance standards</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p local-id=3D"f5548901cffc"><strong>Please note that unless specifically m=
entioned, all metrics refer to transactions completed on Visa network only =
to measure the success of the product. If Interac network data is required =
for any logic, it will be explicitly called out.</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
